<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habali maha handa iyandikilwi na Lukasi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Habali Maha handa iyandikilwi na Lukasi ni imonga paghati gha vihitabu vinjechi vya lilaghano lyonu vyeni kulongela kulama kwa Yesu Kilisito. Kila kimonga kingukemwa “Injili ingumanyika Habali Maha.” Viyandikilwi na Matayu na Maliku na Lukasi na Yohana badili gha Yesu kuhova. Lukasi kayandika ng'ogha weka hela mighalu gha kulama kwa Yesu na ayandikili hilahila mighalu igholilwi na wavulwa wa Yesu badili gha kuhova na kuhinduka, kukihitabu wangukikema Matendu gha Wandumindumi. Kwahela mundu angumanya uchakaka wa lipindi lyeni chakaka na mahala kiyandikilwi kihitabu haki, ila wasoma watangala wangujumila yiwa inguwesekana kiyandikilwi machuva gha isabini badili gha kuwelekwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muyandika ni Lukasi, hilahila awelili dakitali. Kuyandika kwaki na kutumila kwaki luga kungulangiha yiwa awelili msomi. Lukasi apalili kuyandika kwa uchakaka mayandiko kulongelela kulama kwa Yesu na kulongela matendu vila yawelili yakihumila, ili wandu waghangi walinomi kwa kusoma haki Lukasi 1:1-3. Lukasi kawela ng'ogha Myahudi Wakolosai 4:10-14 na ayandikili kunjila hai ili iwatangi wala weni kuwela ng'ogha Wayahudi na weni wamanyi. Hai inguwonesa lipala vila Wayahudi wangulikala Lukasi 1:8. Habali Maha handa ayandikili na Lukasi ingulandine nesu na vihitabu vya Matayu na Maliku, kwaikiva vingulongela kindu kimonga na njila imonga. Imonga gha vihitabu viitatu, Lukasi angulongela kwa utali vila alelilwi Yohana Mbatisa. Lukasi hilahila anguyendelela kukasila mghalu wa kulekesela sula 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34; 24:47,) na mayupo (sula 3:21, 5:16, 6:12; 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati:</para>
  <para style="io">Lukasi angulangiha Habali Maha ghaki na kulongela kwa kyani kayandika haki. Ku sula 1:1-4,</para>
  <para style="io">Hinu angulongela kuwelekwa kwa Yesu na vila kaliyandala maha kwa lihengu 1:5-4:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Lukasi angulongelela lihengu ligholilwi na Yesu, yala makangaso agholili na mighalu avulili. 4:14-21:38,</para>
  <para style="io">Lukasi mwihu angulongela vila Yesu ahovili na kusikwa na kuhinduka. 22-24,</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mkulu Teofili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Wandu waghangi watangala wayesili kuyandika hila mighalu igholeka kumlima wa twenga. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Wayandikili handa tulongelilwi na wala wailolili mighalu hila kwa mihu ghao kuhuma utumbula wa lihengu lya Yesu. Hagha wandu ndiwa wala watumikila walandalisili Habali Maha gha Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />ni maha nenga kangi Mkulu Teofili, badili gha kulola kwa maha mighalu hyogha kuhuma utumbula, nikuyandikili kwa umaha, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ili na wenga uwesi kuimanya mweni uchakaka wa mighalu hila uvulilwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litangaso lya kuwelekwa Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Lipindi Helode kawela Nkosi wa mlima wa Yudasia, kuwelili na mtambika mmonga lihina lyaki Zakalia, wa kipinga kya utambika kya Abiya. Mdala ghaki awelili akikemwa Elizabeti, na mweni awelili wa ukolo wa mtambika Haluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Wogha waivili wawelili wandu wa maha wangulikala vila ingumuhekelesa Sapanga, wakilikala kwa kukovekela amuli na malaghilo hyogha gha Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Weni wawelili ng'ogha na mwana, kwaikiva Elizabeti awelili mghumba, na wogha waivili wawelili wagogolo nesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lichuwa limonga, paiwelili zamu ghaki kughola lihengu lya utambika kuulongolo gha Sapanga, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Zakalia ahaghulilwi kwa kukinisa gudu gudu, handa iwelili machuwa hyogha kughola, kuyingila mlighuta lya Sapanga ili kutumilila mahumba kwa Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Lipinga likulunga lya wandu liwelili panji likiyupa lisaa hila Zakalia awelili akitumilila mahumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kuulongolo Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamuhumila Zakalia, akigholoka upandi wa kulihila wa kihanja kya kutumilila mahumba kwa Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakalia paamlolili Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akakolwa holu na kutila. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ila yula Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamlongela, “Zakalia, ukotoho kuwela na holu, kwaikiva Sapanga kahyoghanila kuyupa kwa wenga. Mdala ghako Elizabeti atekulelela mwana mlumi, na wenga utemkema lihina lyaki Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Wenga utewela na luheku lukulunga kwaikiva gha hayu, na wandu watangala watehekelela kuwelekwa kwa mweni, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />kwaikiva atevalangilwa mundu wa maha kuulongolo gha Bambu. Na katu atenywegha ng'ogha divai au kinywegha kikalipa, na atememeswa Mpumulo wa Sapanga kuhuma kuwelekwa kwa mweni. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Yohanaatewayegha wandu watangala wa Izilaeli kwa Bambu Sapanga ghao. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Na mweni ateyenda badili gha Sapanga kwa makakala na Mpumulo handa mlota wa Sapanga Elia. Ateighalambula mioyu gha watati wawagholeli wana ghao ghala gha maheli, atewaghola wahakata wawoneki walungwana. Akipala amyandalile maha Bambu wandu ghaki.” <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakalia akamkonya yula Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, “Kyani kitenimanyisa yiwa milando hai ni gha chakaka? Nenga ni mgogolo na mhumbu ghangu hilahila ni mgogolo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamyanga, “Nenga ni Gabulieli mtumikila wa Sapanga, niyeghwa na Sapanga nilonge na wenga, nikupeghi hazi habali maha. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Milando hai itehumila kwa lipindi lyaki, kwaikiva uyakwinile ng'ogha, utelepelwa kulonga, hinu utelepelwa kulonga mbaka lichuwa lila mighalu hai ihumile.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Kwa lipindi lyogha wandu wala pawawelili panji, wakimlindila Zakalia, wakangasilwi kwa kulola kalikala lipindi litali mghati mwa Lighuta lya Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Paahumili panji, awelili akiwalangusila kwa mawoko kwaikiva kawesa ng'ogha kulonga awesili ng'ogha kulonga na weni, na wandu wamanyili yiwa kalangusilwa kindu mula mghati mwa Lighuta lya Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Lipindi lyaki lya kutumikila lihengu palipelili, akahuya ukaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Kuulongolo Elizabeti mhumbu ghaki akakola ndumbu. Akalikala ukaya kwa lipindi lya miehi mhano. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Akalonga, “Havi ndiwa anigholile Bambu; kanilola na kunihumisilila honi gha kulela ng'ogha kuulongolo gha wandu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwelekwa kwa Yesu kungutangaswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ndumbu gha Elizabeti paihikili miehi isita, Sapanga akamyegha mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga lihina lyaki wangumkema Gabulieli ayendi mmbwani Nazaleti, kumlima wa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Akimlaghila kwa mhinja mmonga kayingilwa ng'ogha na mlumi na alongelilwi na Yusufu, wa ukolo wa Daudi yiwa ateposwa nayu. Lihina lyaki angukemwa Malia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamyendela, akamjambusa, “Habale, wenga uhighililwi na Sapanga! Bambu ka pamonga na wenga!” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Malia paahyoghanilili hila milando akalikangasa, akaliwachila, Milando hai ingumaanisa kyani? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamlongela, “Ukotoho kuwela na holu Malia, kwaikiva Sapanga anguyendelesa kukula kwa luhala ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Utewela na ndumbu, utelela mwana mlumi, na utemkema lihina lyaki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Mweni atewela mkulu na atekemwa Mwana wa Sapanga mweni kuwela kunani gha hyogha. Bambu Sapanga atemghola aweli Nkosi handa amgholili mbuyi ghaki Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Hayu atelongosa wandu wa Yakobu yaani Izilaeli hata machuwa hyogha bila mwihu, na unkosi ghaki utewela ng'ogha na mwihu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia akamyanga Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, “Nenga ni mhinja nityangili ng'ogha na mlumi?” Hai itewela ghuli. <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamyanga, “Mpumulo wa Sapanga atekughulukila, na makakala ghaki Sapanga mweni kuwela kunani gha hyogha utekuhikila handa kisisi, kwaikiva gha nagha, mwana ateweleka atekemwa mhaghulwa wa Sapanga, Mwana wa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Umanyi hilahila yiwa hata Elizabeti, mlongo ghako, na mweni kakola ndumbu pamonga na kuwela mgogolo, na hinaa ni mwehi wa isita kwa mweni kwaikiva wandu wangummanya yiwa mghumba, <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />kwaikiva kwahela lilando liwesekana ng'ogha kwa Sapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Hinu Malia akalonga, “Nenga ni mtumikila wa Bambu, igholeki kwa nenga handa lilando uilongela.” Mwihu Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akahuka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malia angumtyangilila Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Machuwa mayaghani kuulongolo, Malia akajiyandala maha kwa mwanja na akayenda kwa kuloposela kumlima mmonga utamili kumitumbi gha Yudasi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Kula, akayingila mlighuta lya Zakalia, akamjambusa Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizabeti paahyoghanili jambuso lya Malia, mwana mweni kuwela mundumbu gha Elizabeti akaghalambuka. Na makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga yakamhikila, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Akalonga kwa lilowi likulunga, “Wenga uhighilwa kupiti wadala waghangi wogha, na mwana utemlela kahighilwa!” <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nenga ni ghani hata nyongo wa Bambu wa nenga ahiki kwa nenga? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ningukulongela, panihyoghanila hela lilowi ghako, mwana mndumbu gha nenga ahekelelili na akaghalambuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Uhighilwa wenga ukwinili yiwa yatehumila yala Bambu akulaghilili.<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyimbo wa Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Hinu Malia akalonga, “Mpumulo ghangu ungumyinula Bambu, <verse eid="LUK 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Mpumulo ghangu ungumhekelelela Sapanga, Mkombola wa nenga. <verse eid="LUK 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Sapanga akumbukwile nenga mtumikila wa Bambu, hinu kanihighila hinaa wandu wogha watenikema mhighilwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Kwaikiva Sapanga mweni kuwela na makakala, kanigholela makulunga. Lihina lya Sapanga ni lya mweni weka ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Umaha lyaki kwa wandu weni kumyitikila lunguyendelela uweleka hata uweleka. <verse eid="LUK 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Kaghola mighalu mikulunga kwa liwoko lyaki, kawatimula weni kuwela na makwinakwina kumawachilo gha mioyu ghao, <verse eid="LUK 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />kawahulusa wogha weni kuwela na makakala kuhuma vikalilo vyao vya kinkosi na kuwavika wala weni kumuyitikila. <verse eid="LUK 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wogha weni njala kawayukutisa vindu maha, ila wala wanaisa kawaleka mawoko lipala. <verse eid="LUK 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kamtanga Izilaeli mtumikila ghaki, kwa kumbukwike kumuwonela umaha, <verse eid="LUK 1:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Akumbwikile kuwagholela umaha kwa Ibulahimu na wawelekwa ghaki hata machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia kalikala na Elizabeti kwa lipindi lya miehi itatu, kuulongolo akahuya ukaya ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwelekwa kwa Yohana Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Lipindi lya kujiwopola kwa Elizabeti palihikili, akajiwopola mwana mlumi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Wandu wa pabei pamonga na walongo ghaki pawahyoghanila lilando lila yiwa Bambu kamuwonela umaha mkulunga, wahekilelili pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Kuulongolo palihika lichuwa lya inane wahikili kumghola jandu mwana, na wakapala kumpegha lihina handa lya tati ghaki, Zakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ila nyongo ghaki akanili na kuwalongela yiwa lihina lyaki litekemwa Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Wakamlongela, “Ila kwahela mundu kuukolo ghako kawela na lihina handa hali” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Hinu wakamkonya tati wa mwana kwa njila gha kulangiha kilangihi yiwa lihina ghani angupala ampeghi. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakalia akaluwa kindu kya kuyandikila, akayandika nagha, “Yohanandiwa lihina lyaki.” Wandu wogha wakakangaswa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Bahala Zakalia akatumbula kangi kulonga, akimhighili Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Holu ikawayingila wandu wogha watamili pala pabei, na mghalu hula ukalandala kumlima wa mitumbi gha Yudasia. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Wogha wahyoghanilili mghalu hula wakalikonya mumioyu ghao wakilonga, “Ghuli mwana hayu atewela mundu liki?” Kwaikiva makakala gha Bambu yawelili pamonga na mweni.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakalia, tati ghaki mwana, akahikilwa na makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga, akalonga ulota hau, <verse eid="LUK 1:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Ayinulwi Bambu Sapanga wa Izilaeli, kwaikiva kawahikila na kuwalokola wandu ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Katupegha mlokola kana makakala, muweleka wa Daudi mtumikila ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Alaghilili kula dahile kwa njila gha walota wa Sapanga wala wahaghulilwi na Sapanga, <verse eid="LUK 1:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />yiwa atetulokola kuhuma kumakakala gha wahakata watupala ng'ogha na kutuhumisa kumakakala gha wogha wangutuhakila. <verse eid="LUK 1:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Sapanga ailongile atewawonela umaha wagogolo wa twenga, na atekumbwike lilaghano lya Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Amlongelili Ibulahimu mbui wa twenga. <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Yiwa tulokolwe kumakakala gha wahakata wa twenga, tupati kumyupa kwa kukotoho kutila, <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Ili tuwese kuwela wandu wa maha kwa Sapanga na wandu wanguhyoghanila laghilo lyaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Wenga mwana wa nenga, utekemwa mlota wa Sapanga mweni kuwela kunani gha hyogha, kwaikiva utemlongola Bambu kumyandalila njila ghaki maha. <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Kuwatangasila wandu ghaki yiwa watelokolwa kwa kulekeselwa sambi syau. <verse eid="LUK 1:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Upalo wa Sapanga na umaha ghaki utetulangasila handa lijua linguhomoka kuhuma kunani kumahindu. <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Atewalangasila wala wogha walikala kulwisa na wala walikala kukisisi kya kihu, ili atulongosi tupati kukovekela njila gha kuponga.” <verse eid="LUK 1:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana akakula na kuyongeseka kukimu na kumpumulo. Akalikala kumwitu mbaka lichuwa ajiwonesili kwa wandu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuwelekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayu 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Kumachuwa ghala, Augusito, nkosi Kaisali mkulu wa Ulumi akawapegha laghilo, yiwa wagholi uvalangi wa wandu wa mlima wogha. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Uvalangi hau wa utumbula ugholilwi kulipindi Kilenio paawelili mkulu wa mlima wa Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Wandu wogha wayendili kuvalangwa, kila mmonga kumbwani ghaki kuawelekili. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu hilahila atumbulili mwanja kuhuma mumbwani Nazaleti mlima wa Galilaya, na kwaikiva awelili mlongo wa uweleka wa Daudi, akayenda mumbwani Betilehemu kumlima Yudasia, kula awelekili nkosi Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Akayenda kuvalangiwa pamonga na Malia, yula alaghililwi kuposwa na mweni, Malia akiwela na ndumbu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Pawawelili kula Betilehemu, lipindi lya Malia lya kuliwopola likahika, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />na mweni akajiwopola mwana ghaki wa utumbula mlumi, akamvika nguu zya kiuwana, akamwonjesa kukindu kya kuliyila ng'ombi kwaikiva wapatili ng'ogha lighuta lya kuwawonjesa wahenja.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahungaji na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Na kumahala pala, wawelili wahungaji kula kumanyahi wakigholokela mikokolu gha kulighuta uhiku wogha.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Wahungaji wanguhunga mikokolo </figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akawahumila bwitu, na ukulu wa Bambu ukawalangasila mbandi zyogha, na weni wakawela na holu nesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akawalongela, “Mkotoho kuhola. Niwayeghela Habali maha litewahekelesa wandu wogha. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Lelo kumbwani wa Daudi, kwaikiva gha mwenga kaweleka mkombola, mweni ndiwa kilisito, Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na haki ndiwa kilangihi kwa mwenga, mtemlola mwana chali wambindilila vimbendela, na mweni wamuwonjesa mukyombu kya kuliyila ng'ombi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Bwitu lipinga likulunga lya watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga likakongine na hayu mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, wakamuyinula Sapanga wakilonga, <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Ayinulwi Sapanga kunani kundumba, na kulikala kwa kuponga kuweli kwa wandu anguwashukwile kumlima wogha.” <verse eid="LUK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Kuulongolo wala watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga pawahuka na kuhuya kundumba, wahungaji wakalongelana, “Tuyendi ku Betilehemu tukaulole mghalu hula uhumilili na milando Bambu atulongelili.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Hinu, wakayenda kwa kuloposela, wakawalola Malia na Yusufu na yula mwanachali kawonjeswa mukyombu kya kuliyila ng'ombi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Wala wahungaji pawamlola yula mwana wakawalongela wogha lilando waliyoghanilili kulongelelela mwana yula. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Na wogha wahyoghanilili lilando lila walongelilwi na wahungaji wakakangaswa, <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Malia akavika milando hila hyogha kumoyu ghaki na kuliwachilila nesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Wala wahungaji wakahuya kumanyahi kwa weni kunu wakimuyinula na kumsifila Sapanga kwa hyogha wawelili wayahyoghanila na kulola, hyogha handa walongelilwi na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angupeghwa lihina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Lichuwa lya inane kuulongolo, lipindi lya kumuyingisa jandu mwana palihika, wakampegha lihina lyaki Yesu, lihina apeghilwi na mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga pambila gha Malia kukola ndumbu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa Mlighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Machuwa gha Yusufu na Malia kughululwa payahika handa wapalilwi na laghilo lya Bambu ampeghili na Musa, walela wala wakamtola mwana, wakayenda pamonga na mweni ku Yelusalemu ili wamviki kuulongolo gha Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Kulaghilo lya Bambu iyandikilwi, “Kila muwelekwa wa mtumbula mlumi atewela wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Vilavila wakatola litambiku handa ipalilwi kulaghilo lya Bambu, “Ngunda waivili au wana waivili wa ngunda.” <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Lipindi lila kula Yelusalemu kuwelili na mundu mmonga lihina lyaki Simeoni. Mundu yula awelili ni mundu wa maha na mweni kumuyitikila Sapanga. Awelili kayandalilwa na Bambu kulola ukombola wa Izilaeli na mweni awelili akilindila kwa kihemu. Mpumulo wa Sapanga awelili pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga awelili kamhighilisila yiwa atehova ng'ogha akiwela kamlola ng'ogha Kilisito ahaghulilwi na Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Hinu, akilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga, Simeoni akayingila mulighuta lya Sapanga. Walela wa Yesu pawamyegha Mulighuta lya Sapanga mwana ghao ili wamgholeli handa ipalilwi kulaghilo lya Bambu ampeghili Musa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeoni akampokela mwana Yesu mumawoko ghaki kunu akimhighili Sapanga, akilonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Hinaa Bambu, kuyomola kala lilando ulilongeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">umlekiseli mtumikila ghako ayendi kwa kuponga.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwaikiva kwa mihu ghangu nilola mlokola umyeghili,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Yula umhaghulili aweli mlokola wa wandu wa milima hyogha,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />hayu ateshukwilwe na wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi wammanyi Sapanga na ukulu wa wandu ghako Izilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Walela wa Yesu wakakangaswa kuhyoghanila milando hila Simeoni ailongile kulongelelela mwana yula. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeoni akawahighila na kumlongela Malia, nyongo ghaki, “Mwana hayu kawelekwa kwaikiva gha kuwaguwisa na kangi kuwagholokesa wandu watangala ku Izilaeli. Na mweni atewela kilangihi kya kuhindulilwa ivile wandu watemlongela mweni, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Lukasini mawachilo gha mioyu gha wandu watangala yeni kuhighwa yapati kuvikwa lipala. Na kwa wenga utungu utekuhoma kumpumulo handa lipanga.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kuwelili na mlota mmonga mdala, lihina lyaki Ana, biti Fanueli, wa likabila lya Asheli. Awelili kalama na mngwana ghaki kwa machuva isaba, ila mngwana ghaki akahova. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Kuulongolo kalama akihoviwa na mlumi mbaka lipindi lila kawela mgogolo wa machuva isemanini na njechi. Lipindi hali lyogha alikalili mulighuta lya Sapanga akiwopa mulyo na kuyupa uhiku na pamuhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Lisaa lilalila, akahuma kuulongolo, akamsengwili Sapanga, na kulongela milando gha yula mwana kwa wandu wogha wawelili wakiulindila ulokola wa wandu wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuya Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusufu na Malia pawayomola kughola hyogha yalaghililwi na laghilo lya Bambu, wakahuya ukaya Nazaleti, kumlima Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana Yesu akayendelela kukula na kumema luhala na kupokela makakala na Sapanga awelili akimhighila.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Yesu Mulighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kila lichuva Yusufu na Malia wayendili ku Yelusalemu kumhambu wa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu paawelili na ukulunga wa machuva ikumi na ivili, wogha wayendili kulichuwa lya Pasaka handa waigholili kila machuva. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Badili gha mhambu kuyomwika, watumbulili mwanja kuhuya ukaya kwa weni, ila mwana Yesu ahighalili ku Yelusalemu akiwela weka ghaki bila walela ghaki kumanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Wawachilili awelili pamonga na waghanja ghaki mula mmwanja wa pamonga, wakatumbula kumhakula kwa walongo ghao na wandu wawelili wakiwamanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Kwaikiva wamwonili ng'ogha, wakahuya Yelusalemu kumhakula. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Lichuwa lya itatu wamlolili Kulighuta lya Sapanga paghati gha wavula wa laghilo lya Musa, akiwahyoghanila na kuwakonya milando. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Wogha wamuhyoghanilili walikangasili kulola luhala lwaki na kujumila kwa mweni kwa mawachilo gha luhala ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Walela ghaki pawamlolili wakakangaswa. Malia, nyongo ghaki, akamkonya, “Mwana wa nenga, kwa kyani kutugholela hagha? Tati ghako na nenga tuwelili tukikuhaka kwa utungu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu akawayanga, “Kwa kyani munihakulili mmanyili ng'ogha yiwa ningupalwa kulikala Kulighuta lya Tati wa nenga?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ila walela ghaki wamanyili ng'ogha lilando lila awalongelili. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Hinu akahuya pamonga na weni mbaka Nazaleti, akiwela anguwayitikila. Nyongo ghaki ayendilelile kukumbwike milando kumoyu ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu akayendelela kukula kwa mawachilo gha luhala na kukimu, akayendelela kupalwa na Sapanga na wandu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatisa anguwatangasila wandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Lichuva lya ikumi na mhano wa unkosi wa Kaisali mkulu Tibelio, Pontio Pilato awelili angulongosa mlima wa Yudasia. Helode awelili nkosi wa Galilaya, na mlongo ghaki Filipo awelili mlongosi wa mlima wa Itulea na Tulakoniti. Lusania awelili nkosi wa Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Anasi na Kayafa wawelili watambika wakulu wa Sapanga. Lipindi lila ndiwa lilando lya Sapanga limuhikilili Yohanamwana wa Zakalia, kula kumanyahi. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Hinu Yohanambatisa akayenda kumilima hyogha iwelili mmbali mwa lweni Yoludani, akawatangasila wandu. Akawalongela wandu kuleka mahakata na kumhyukila Sapanga na wabatiswe na Sapanga atewalekesela sambi syao.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Handa iyandikilwi kukihitabu kya Isaya yula awelili mlota wa Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mundu angukema haku kumanyahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mumvikili Bambu njila ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">mghole maha njila ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Nagha kila bondi litekulilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Kila litumbi na kitumbi vitelandalwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">na pahyetili patevikwa maha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">njila zihakata zitegholwa maha.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Kila mundu atelola ulokola auyegha Sapanga.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Hinu wandu watangala wamuhikilili Yohanaili awabatisi. Na mweni akawalongela, “Mwenga kiweleka kya njoka! Ni ghani awalongelili yiwa munguwesa kuubhutuka uhakili hula utehika? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Hinu mlangihi kwa njila gha matendu yiwa mhyuki na kumkovekela Sapanga na kulekeselwa sambi. Mkotoho kuliwachila yiwa Sapanga atewapala ikiva mtelonga yiwa ni tati wa twenga. Ninguwalongela chakaka Sapanga anguwesa kughalambula maganga hagha yavile wana wa Ibulahimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Hinu liwao liwela kala kumikegha gha kila libiki lilela ng'ogha matungula maha litedumulwa na kudangwa kulyoto.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Lipinga lya wandu likamkonya, “Tughole kyani hinu?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Akawayanga, “Avile na likoti ivili ampeghi yula avileng'ogha na likoti, avile na mulyo aghole hilahi.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Na watola usulu wakahika kangi ili wabatiswi, wakamkonya, “Mvula tugholi niki?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Na mweni akawalongela, “Mkotoho kutola usulu ngulu ilandine ng'ogha na hila ivikilwi kala.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Na watovangondo wakamkonya, “Na twenga tughole niki?” Na mweni akawayanga, “Mkotoho kutola vindu vya mundu yoyose kwa makakala pamonga na kumyegha kunjengakaya kwa uhwangi. Myukuti na misahala mngupokela.” <verse eid="LUK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Wandu wawelili wakilindila kindu kuhumila, wogha wawachilili kumioyu ghao yiwa Yohanandiwa anguwesa kuvile mweni yiwa Kilisito ahaghulilwi na Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Hinu Yohanaakawalongela wogha, “Nenga ninguwabatisa kwa masi, ila yula atehika kuyetu kwa nenga ni mweni makakala kupiti nenga, na nenga niwesa ng'ogha hata kuwopola lughoyi lwa hilatu ghaki. Mweni atewabatisa kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga na kwa lyoto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Mweni avile na luselu mumawoko ghaki lwa kuyeyesela ughali ghaki, akunguli ngano mungoko, na miyeyu anyanyi kwa lyoto ujimika ng'ogha.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Na Yohanaayangalalili kuwatangasila wandu Habali Maha akitumila njila gha kuwakalipila na kuwaluwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Kuulongolo Yohanaamkalipilili nkosi Helode kwaikiva kampoka Helodia, mdala wa mlongo ghaki Filipo na mahakata ghangi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hinu Helode akayongesa uhakata ghaki kangi kwa kumvika Yohanamulighuta lya wawopwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angubatiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayu 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliku 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Badili gha wandu wogha kubatiswa, Yesu na mweni akabatiswa. Na paawelili akiyupa, kundumba kukawoposoka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Mpumulo wa Sapanga akaghuluka kuhuma kunani kwa njila gha higha wa ngunda. Na lilowi likahyoghanika kuhuma kundumba likilonga, “Wenga ndiwa mwana wa Sapanga mpalwa, ningupalilwa na wenga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwelekwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayu 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu paatumbulili lihengu lyaki awelili na ukulunga wa machuva ikumi itatu, na wandu wawachilili yiwa ni mwana wa Yusufu, Yusufu mwana wa Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli awelili mwana wa Matati na Matati awelili mwana wa Lawi, na Lawi awelili mwana wa Meliki, na Maleki awelili mwana wa Yanai, na Yanai awelili mwana wa Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufu awelili mwana wa Matatia, na Matatia awelili mwana wa Amosi, na Amosi awelili mwana wa Nahumu, na Nahumu awelili mwana wa Hesili, na Hesile awelili mwana wa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai awelili mwana wa Maati na Maati awelili mwana wa Matatia, na Matatia awelili mwana wa Shemeni, na Shemeni awelili mwana wa Yoseki, na Yoseki awelili mwana wa Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda awelili mwana wa Yohanani, Yohanani awelili mwana wa Lesa, na Lesa awelili mwana wa Zelubabeli, na Zelubabeli awelili mwana wa Shealitieli, na Shealitieli awelili mwana wa Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli awelili mwana wa Meliki, Meliki awelili mwana wa Adi, na Adi awelili mwana wa Kosamu, na Kosamu awelili mwana wa Elimadamu, na Elimadamu awelili mwana wa Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eli awelili mwana wa Yoshua, na Yoshua awelili mwana wa Eliezeli, na Eliezeli awelili mwana wa Yolimu, na Yolimu awelili mwana wa Matati na Matati awelili mwana wa Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi awelili mwana wa Simeoni, Simeoni awelili mwana wa Yudasi, Yudasi awelili mwana wa Yusufu, Yusufu awelili mwana wa Yonamu, na Yonamu awelili mwana wa Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakimu awelili mwana wa Melea, na Melea awelili mwana wa Mena, na mena awelili mwana wa Matata, na Matata awelili mwana wa Nasani, na Nasani awelili mwana wa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daudi awelili mwana wa Yese, na Yese awelili mwana wa Obedi, na Obedi awelili mwana wa Boazi, na Boazi awelili mwana wa Salimoni, na Salimoni awelili mwana wa Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni awelili mwana wa Aminadabu, na Aminadabu awelili mwana wa Adimini, na Adimini awelili mwana wa Alini, na Alini awelili mwana wa Hesiloni, na Hesiloni awelili mwana wa Pelesi, na Pelesi awelili mwana wa Yudasi, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yudasi awelili mwana wa Yakobu, na Yakobu awelili mwana wa Isaka, na Isaka awelili mwana wa Ibulahimu, na Ibulahimu awelili mwana wa Tela, na Tela awelili mwana wa Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naholi awelili mwana wa Selugi, na Selugi awelili mwana wa Leu, na Leu awelili mwana wa Pelegi, na Pelegi awelili mwana wa Ebeli, na Ebeli awelili mwana wa Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala awelili mwana wa Kenani, Kenani awelili mwana wa Alifakisadi, Alifakisadi awelili mwana wa Shemu, Shemu awelili mwana wa Nuhu, Nuhu awelili mwana wa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki awelili mwana wa Metusela, na Metusela awelili mwana wa Henoki, na Henoki awelili mwana wa Yaledi, na Yaledi awelili mwana wa Mahalaleli, na Mahalaleli awelili mwana wa Kainamu, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />kainamu awelili mwana wa Enoshi, na Enoshi awelili mwana wa Seti, na Seti awelili mwana wa Adamu, na Adamu awelili wa Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuyeswa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayu 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliku 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu akilongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga paahuya kuhuma kulweni Yoludani, akalongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga kuyenda kuluvagha. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Kula akayeswa na Lihyukana kwa lipindi lya machuwa ialobaini. Kwa lipindi lila, mweni kalyegha ng'ogha mulyo. Na badili gha machuwa ghala akawela na njala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Hinu Lihyukana likamuhikila na kumlongela, “Ikiva wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga, ulaghili maganga hagha yaweli mibumunda.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu akamyanga, “Iyandikilwi kumayandiko gha Sapanga, ‘Mundu kanguwesang'ogha kulama kwa libumunda hela.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Hinu Lihyukana likamtola na kumyegha kumahala pakunani, likamlangigha unkosi wogha wa mlima wogha kwa lihanja limonga, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Lihyukana likamlongela, “Nitekupegha ukulunga kunani gha unkosi hau wogha na faali zyaki ulongose, kwaikiva nipeghilwi havi vyogha na nenga niwesa kumpegha mundu yeyose nimpala. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Havi vyogha vitewela hindu ghako wenga, ikiva utenitumikila kwa kutova manung'una.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu akamyanga, “Iyandikilwi kumayandiko gha Sapanga, ‘Utemyupila kwa kumtovela manung'una Bambu Sapanga ghako, na kumtumikila mweni weka hela.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Hinu Lihyukana likamtola mbaka ku Yelusalemu, likamgholokesa kunani gha kindangawala ku lighuta lya Sapanga na kumlongela, “Ikiva wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga, ulidangi pahi, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />kwaikiva iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga, ‘Sapanga atewalaghila watumikila ghaki wa kundumba wakutange.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Hilahila, 'na weni watekupokela mumawoko ghao, Ili ukotoho likwala mliganga.” <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ila Yesu akamyanga, “Iyandikilwi kumayandiko gha Sapanga, 'Ukotoho kumyesa Bambu Sapanga ghako.” <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Lihyukana palimyesili Yesu kwa kila njila likamleka kwa lipindi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutumbula lihengu lyake ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayu 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliku 1:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Pala Yesu ahuyili kumlima Galilaya akiva na makakala makulunga gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga, na habali zyaki zikalandala kumahala kogha mpabehi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Na mweni akavile kanguwavula wandu kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi na kuyinulwa na wandu wogha.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukanilwa ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliku 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu akahika ku Nazaleti mahala wamlelili, na lichuwa lya Kupumulila, ayingilili kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi handa angughola machuwa hyogha. Akagholoka ili asomi mayandiko mambulete nesu kwa lilowi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Wakampegha kihitabu kya mlota Isaya. Hinu akakigubutula na akalola mahala payandikilwi. <verse eid="LUK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Mpumulo wa Sapanga upamonga na nenga, kwaikiva Bambu kanihaghula na kunipakala mahuta ili niwatangasile wandu wakapuku Habali Maha. Kaniyegha niwalongele wawopwa yiwa watekombolwa na wandu wangalimihu watelola kangi. Kaniyegha niwakombole wahakiliwi. <verse eid="LUK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na kutangasa yiwa lipindi lihika kala lya Bambu kukombola wandu ghaki.” <verse eid="LUK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Hinu paayomola kusoma, akawopa kila kihitabu, akampegha mtumikila, hinu akatama, wandu wogha wawelili mlighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi wakamtumbulila mihu. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Na mweni akatumbula kuwalongela, “Liyandiko hali mlihyoghanilili lihumila lelo.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Wogha wapalilwi nesu na kukangaswa vila anguyendelela kukula kwa luhala. Wakalonga, “Ghuli, hayu mwana wa Yusufu ng'ogha?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Namweni akawalongela mlandano, “Kwa nagha mtenilongela milando hai, ‘Mlamisa ujilamisi mweni,’ na kangi mtelonga, ‘Tuhyoghanila mighalu hyogha ugholili kumbwani Kapelinaumu, hinu uyaghole na baha kumbwani ghako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Na mweni akayendelela kulonga, “Nagha ninguwalongela chakaka, kwahela mlota wa Sapanga anguyitikilwa kumbwani ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, kuwelili na wadala wahovilwi na walumi ghao watangala kumlima wa Izilaeli kumachuwa zya mlota wa Sapanga Elia, lipindi lila kundumba kuwopilwi, ndonya ilekili kutonya kwa lipindi lya machuva itatu na miehi isita na kukavile na njala ngulu kumimbwani hyogha. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Hinu Elia kalaghililwa ng'ogha kwa mundu yeyose wa Izilaeli ila kwa mdala ahoviliwi na mlumi wa Saleputa kumlima Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Hilahila kuwelili wandu watangala wavile na ukalawa ku Izilaeli kumachuwa gha mlota wa Sapanga Elisha, ila pawelili ng'ogha na mmonga alamisilwi, ila ni Naamani hela wa mlima wa Silia.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Wandu wogha wawelili mula kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi pawahyoghanila ghala wahyomili nesu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Wakagholoka, wakamukukula Yesu mbaka panji gha mbwani ghao, uchengwili kunani gha kitumbi. Wakamyegha mmbali ili wamdange pahi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ila mweni akatyanga paghati gha weni na kujiyendela.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu avile na lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maliku 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Hinu Yesu akayenda Kapelinaumu, kumlima wa Galilaya lichuwa lya kupumulila palihikili, akawavula wandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Na weni wakakangaswa nesu kulola njila awavulili, kwaikiva awavulili handa mundu avili na ulongosi paailongile. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Na mlighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi kuwelili mundu akolilwi na lihoka, na mweni akalila kwa lilowi likulunga, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Uvile na kyani na twenga, wenga! Yesu wa Nazaleti? Ghuli, uhika kutuyalamisa? Ningukumanya wenga ni ghani. Wenga uhika kuhuma kwa Sapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu akamkalipila, akimlongela lihoka nagha, “Unyamali, na uhuki mghati mwa mundu hayu.” Na yula lihoka likamdanga yula mundu pahi kuulongolo gha wandu, akahuka mghati mwa mundu yula ng'ogha kumhakili. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Wandu wogha wakangasilwi nesu na kulongelana, “Haki ni kyani? Mundu hayu anguwalongela mahoka kwa ulongosi na makakala ghaki, na weni wanguhuka.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Na habali gha Yesu zikalandala kumlima hula wogha.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wavina watangala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayu 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliku 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu akahuka mghati mwa lila lighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi, akayenda kulighuta lya Simoni. Nyongo mkwahanu wa Simoni awelili kakolwa na ulwala ukalipa, hinu wakamkonya Yesu amlamise. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu akahika na kumgholokela upenuni, akakalipila hula ulwala, na weni ukamleka. Yula nyongo akagholoka bwitu akatumbula kuwatumikila. <verse eid="LUK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Lijuwa palihongili, wakamyeghela Yesu wandu wekaweka wavile na mavina. Akavika mawoko ghaki kunani kwa kila mmonga wa weni, akawalamisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mahoka yakahuma mghati mwa wandu watangala, wakatova lilowi wakilonga, “Wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga” Ila Yesu awakalipilili, wakotoho kulonga, kwaikiva wamanyili yiwa mweni ndiwa Kilisito.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angutangasa ku maghuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maliku 1:35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Kilau ghaki malawila, Yesu akahuka akayenda mahala pakulihigha. Wandu wakavile wakimhaka. Wala wandu pawahikili mahala awelili, wayesili kumkingama ili akotoho kuhuka kwa weni. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ila mweni akawalongela, “Ningupalwa kutangasa Habali Maha gha Unkosi wa Sapanga kumilima ghangi kangi, kwa ikiva Sapanga kanilaghila kughola nagha.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Na mweni akayendelela kutangasa ku Yudasia mghati mwa mighuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwakema wayitikila wa mtumbula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayu 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliku 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lichuwa limonga, Yesu awelili kagholoka mmbali gha lihiwa Genesaleti hilahila walikema lihiwa galilaya na wandu watangala wawelili wakimtindila kunu wakihukumulana hukumulana ili wahyoghanili lilando lya Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Akalola whatu ivili zivile na hindu ng'ogha mmbali mwa lihiwa, na walopola homba weni wakiva wahukili, wanguhonjola nyafu zyao. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu akayingila kuhila whatu imonga iwelili gha Simoni. Yesu akamkonya alikukuli kumlima kutali mmbali mayaghani gha lihiwa. Hinu akatama mula na kuvula wandu. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Paayomolili kuvula, akamlongela Simoni, “Uyendesi whatu mbaka kumasi yatangala na mdangi nyafu zyenu ili mlopole homba.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni akamyanga, “Bambu tuyesili kulopola uhiku wogha ng'ogha kupokela hindu ila kwaikiva ulongile lilando wenga nitedanga nyafu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Hinu pawadangili nyafu, wakalopola homba ngoo hata nyafu zyao zitumbulili kubaluka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Wakawapungila mawoko wawopola waghangi wawelili kuwhatu ghangi wahiki kuwatanga. Wakahika na kuzimemesa whatu zyogha ivili homba, hata ziyesili kujumbukila mlihiwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petelo paalolili mighalu igholeka nagha, akamtundamilila manunguna Yesu na kulonga, “Bambu, ukotoho kutama pabehi na nenga, kwaikiva nenga ni mundu mweni sambi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni pamonga na wogha wawelili pamonga wakangazilwi nesu kwaikiva gha homba ngoo wawalopolili. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Yakobu na Yohanawana wa Zebedayo wawelili walopola pamonga na mweni Simoni, wakangazilwi hilahila. Na Yesu akamlongela Simoni, “Ukotoho kutila, kuhumila lelo uteghola lihengu lya kuwayegha wandu kwa Yesu handa mlopola anguyegha homba ukaya.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Hinu, badili gha kuyegha whatu mmbali mwa lihiwa, wakaleka vyogha kumlima, wakamkovekela Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa avile na ukalawa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliku 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu paakiva kummbwani mmonga, kukahuma mundu mmonga amemesilwi na ukalawa higha wogha, na mweni paamlolili Yesu, akayinama wuso mbaka pahi, akamlongela akimluwa, “Bambu ningumanya, unguwesa kunilamisa nikaghululika.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu akalangiha liwoko, akamyavisa na kumlongela, “Ningupala, ulamiswe.” Na bwitu mundu yula akalamiswa ukalawa ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu akamlaghila, “Ukotoho kumlongela mundu yeyose, ila uyende ukajilangihi kwa mtambika, ukayeghi litambiku kwaikiva gha kughululika kwa wenga handa alaghilili Musa kuwahighilisila wandu yiwa ulamili.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ila mighalu gha Yesu iyendeleleli kulandala kila mahala. Wandu mapinga ngoo walikungulili ili kumuhyoghanila na kulamiswa mavina ghao. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ila mweni ayendili mahala pakumanyahi na kuyupa kula.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu vikongonu ghaki vipola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliku 2:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lichuwa limonga Yesu awelili akivula, Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghililo lya Musa kuhuma kukila mahala ku Galilaya, Yudasia na Yelusalemu, wawelili watama pala. Makakala gha Bambu yawelili pamonga na mweni kwa kulamisa wavina. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Wandu wakahika, wakimyegha mundu mmonga vikongonu ghaki vipolili, awonjili kukindanda, wakayesa kumuyingisa mghati, ili wamviki kuulongolo kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ila, wawesa ng'ogha kwaikiva kuwelili na wandu watangala, wasindilwi kuyingila mghati. Hinu, wakakwela kumyegha kunani gha lighuta, wakamatula mhanga, wakamghulusa yula mundu vikongonu ghaki vipolili pamonga na lihinda kyaki, wakamvika kuulongolo gha Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Mundu angughuluswa kunani gha lipaghala</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu paalolili vila kukwinila ghao mkulunga, akamlongela yula mundu, “Ghanja, ulekeselwa sambi syako.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Wavula wa laghililo na Mafalisayo watumbulili kujikonya, “Ni ghani hayu angumlighu Sapanga? Ni ghani anguwesa kumlekesela mundu sambi ila ni Sapanga weka hela.” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu amanyili mawachilo gha weni, akawakonya, “Kwa kyani mnguliwachila havi mumioyu gha mwenga? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Kindu ghani kivile kiyuyuhu, kulonga, ‘sambi syako ulekeselwa,’ au kulonga, ‘Ugholoki, utyangii’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Hinu ningupala mmanyi yiwa nenga Mwana wa Mundu nivile na ulongosi wa kulekesela sambi baha kumlima wogha.” Hinu akamlongela mundu yula vikongonu ghaki vipolili, “Ningukulongela, ugholoki, utoli lihinda lyako na uhuyi ukaya.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Bwitu mundu yula akagholoka kuulongolo gha wogha, akatola lihinda lyaki akayenda ukaya kwa mweni kunu akimyinula Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Wandu wogha wakangasilwi na kukolwa na holu, wakamyinula Sapanga wakilonga, “Tulola makangaso lelo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliku 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Badili gha yala, Yesu akahuka panji, akamlola mtola usulu mmonga lihina lyaki Lawi, atamili kulighuta lya kutola usulu. Yesu akamlongela, “Nikovekeli.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Na mweni akaleka hyogha na kumkovekela. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Hinu, Lawi akamtengela Yesu mhambu mkulunga kulighuta ghaki. Na lipinga likulunga lya watola usulu na wandu ghangi wawelili watama pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghililo lya Musa wakawang'ung'ulikila wavulwa wa Yesu wakilonga, “Ghuli mngulyegha na kunywegha pamonga na watola usulu na wavili na sambi ghangi?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu akawayanga, “Walamili wampala ng'ogha mlamisa, wampala ni wala wavina. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Hilahila nihikili ng'ogha kuwayandala wandu maha kwa Bambu, ila wala wavile na sambi, wawese kulekeselwa sambi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mghalu gha kuwopa kulyegha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliku 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Wandu ghangi wakamlongela Yesu, “Wavulwa wa Yohana Mbatisa uwopa mulyo mihanja itangala na kuyupa, hata wayitikila wa Mafalisayo ughola hilahila. Ghuli wavulwa ghako wangulyegha na kunywegha?” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli, iwesekana wala wayeghilwi kumhambu wa kuposa wawopa mulyo ikiva bambu wa kuposa kapamonga na weni? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ila lipindi litehika bambu wa mhambu wa uposo atehumiswa paghati gha weni. Kulipindi lila ndiwa watewopa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu akawalongela mlandano hau, “Wandu wadumula ng'ogha kilaka kya lihabiti hyonu na kukivika kulihabiti lya dahile, ikiva waghola nagha, watevile waiyalamila hai lihabiti hyonu, na haki kilaka kitelandine ng'ogha na hai lihabiti lya dahile. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Hilahila kwahela mundu anguvika divai hyonu mghati mwa mhaku wa ngosi wadahile. Ikiva kaghola nagha, hila divai hyonu itebalula hula mhaku wa ngosi, divai itemwaika na mhaku wa ngosi uteyalamila. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Divai hyonu huvikwa kumhaku wa ngosi kyonu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kwahela mundu angupala kunywegha divai hyonu badili gha kunywegha divai gha dahile kwaikiva ulonga hila gha dahile ni maheli nesu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Bambu wa lichuwa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliku 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Limonga lya lichuwa lya kupumulila, Yesu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki wawelili wangutyanga kumatawa gha ngano. Na wavulwa ghaki wakatumbula kuvetula mahoji gha ngano, na wakahumisa punji ghaki kwa mawoko, wakalyegha. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafalisayo wamonga wawakonyili wavulwa, “Ghuli mngughola mghalu upalwa ng'ogha kugholeka lichuwa lya kupumulila?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ghuli, msomili ng'ogha vila agholili Daudi pamonga na waghanja ghaki lipindi wawelili na njala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Daudi ayingilili kulighuta lya Sapanga, akatola hila mibumunda ivikilwi kuulongolo gha Sapanga, akalyegha na kuwapegha ghanja ghaki. Kahela kukovekela laghilo, kwaikiva katu mundu kulyegha mibumunda hila ila watambika weka.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Mwana wa Mundu ndiwa Bambu wa lichuwa lya kupumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu avili na liwoko lipola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliku 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lichuwa lya Kupumulila lighangi, Yesu ayingilili kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi, akavula. Na mula mghati pawelili na mundu avile liwoko ghaki lya kulihila liwelili lipola. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Wavula wa laghililo lya Musa na Mafalisayo wahakulili kulola njila gha kumsitaki Yesu na nagha wawelili wakilindila ili waloli yiwa atemlamisa mundu lichuwa lya kupumulila. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ila Yesu amanyili mawachilo ghao, akamlongela yula avili na liwoko lipola, “Utandamki, ugholoki paghati gha weni.” Yula mundu akayenda kugholoka paghati. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela Wavula wa laghilo na Mafalisayo, “Ninguwakonya, Ni kyani laghilo lya twenga tungupalwa kukovekela kulaghilo tugholi lichuwa lya kupumulila, ni maha kughola lilando maha lichuwa lya kupumulila au kughola lilando lihakata, kumlamisa mundu au kumleka ahovi?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu akawalola wogha wawelili pala, hinu akamlongela yula mundu, “Ulangihi liwoko lyako.” Na mweni akaghola handa alongilwi, liwoko ghaki bwitu likavile likomu kangi. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ila wala wahyomili nesu, wakalongelana njila gha kumgholela Yesu mahakata.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguhaghula wandumindumi ikumi na ivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliku 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Lichuwa limonga Yesu ayendili kulitumbi kuyupa, na kulikala kula kwa uhiku wogha akiyupa kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Kilau ghaki awakemili wavulwa ghaki, na kulipinga lila awahaghulili wandu ikumi na ivili akawapegha lihina limonga Wandumindumi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni, yula Yesu ampeghili lihina Petelo na Andelea mlongo ghaki Simoni, Yakobu na Yohana, Filipo na Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo na Tomaso, Yakobu wa Alifayo na Simoni akemilwi Zelote imanyika mundu alihumisili kulitova kwa mlima ghaki, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yudasi mwana wa Yakobu na Yudasi Isikalioti yula avile kuulongolo ahikili kumhyuka Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvula na kuwalamisa wandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayu 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu ahulukili kuhuma kulitumbi pamonga na wavulwa ghaki, na kugholoka kumahala kuwelili kulandala. Pala kuwelili na lipinga likulunga lya wavulwa ghaki pamonga na lipinga likulunga nesu lya wandu wahumili kummbwani Yelusalemu, kumlima Yudasia hyogha na pandi zya mmbwani Tilo na Sidoni mmbali mwa bahali. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Wandu wala wahikili kumhyoghanila na kulamiswa mavina ghao. Na wala wahakililwi na lihoka walamisilwi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Wandu wogha wapalili kumyavisa, kwaikiva makakala uwelili ukihuma mghati ghaki na kuwalamisa wogha.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Highili na chondi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayu 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Hinu Yesu akawalola wavulwa ghaki na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mhighilwa mwenga mvile wakapuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwaikiva unkosi wa Sapanga ni wa mwenga.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mhighilwa mwenga mvile na njala hinaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwaikiva mteyukutiswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mhighilwa mwenga mlila hinaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwaikiva mtehekelela kwa luheku. <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Mhighilwa mwenga ikiva wandu wawapala ng'ogha, watewaleka, watewalighu na kuwayalamisila lihina yiwa mwenga ni wahakata kwaikiva gha nenga Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Pala dahile mambui wa mwenga wawagholili hilahila walota wa Sapanga, payahumila hagha, mhekeleli kwaikiva mvikilwa hupo ngulu kundumba.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ila chondi mwenga wanahisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwaikiva mlindili mbaka mpatili kala manemu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Chondi mwenga myukuta hinaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwaikiva kuulongolo mtekolwa njala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Chondi mwenga mhekelela kwa luheku hinaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwaikiva kuulongolo mtelumbilila na kulila.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Chondi mwenga lipindi wandu wogha pawawakwilikiha, kwaikiva wambui ghao wawagholelili walota wa uhwangi hilahila.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwapala wahakata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayu 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Ila ninguwalongela mwenga mngunihyoghanila, muwapali wahakata wa mwenga, muwagholeli ulungwana wala wawapala ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Muwayupili kwa Sapanga wahighilwe wala wawalapilili. Na muwayupili wala wanguwagholela mahakata. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ikiva mundu kakutova linganja limonga, umlongele akutove hilahila mbandi yingi. Ikiva mundu kakupoka lihabiti lyako, umlekeseli atoli na likoti hilahila. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mundu paakuluwa kindu umpeghi na mundu paakupoki hindu ghako ukotoho kumpala akuhyisili. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Muwagholeli wandu ghangi hilahila handa mpalili mwenga wawagholeli. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Na ikiva mnguwashukwile hela wala wawapalili mwenga, mtepokela hupo niki? Kwa ikiva hata wavela na sambi huwapala wala wawapala. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kangi ikiva handa mtewagholela lilando maha wala hela wawagholela maheli, watewashukwile niki? Hata wavile na sambi ughola hagha. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Na ikiva mnguwakopesa wala weka mnguwachila yiwa wawahyisili, watewashukwile kwa niki? Hata wala wavile na sambi huwakopesa wavile na sambi ghangi ili wawahuyisili homoso lilalila. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ila mwenga muwapali wahakata wa mwenga na kuwagholela lilando maha, muwakopesi na ng'ogha kulindila kuhuyisilwa na hupo gha mwenga litevile ngulu, na kwa kughola nagha mwenga mtevile handa wana wa mweni kuwela kunani Sapanga wangupalwa kughola. Kwaikiva anguwagholela maheli kwa wala wavile ng'ogha na kushukwile na wavile wahakata. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Mvile na luhungu handa Tati wa mwenga avile na luhungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukotoho kuwalamula waghangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayu 7:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Mkotoho kuwatosa waghangi, na Sapanga atewatosa ng'ogha mwenga. Muwalekeleli waghangi na Sapanga atewalekelela mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muwapeghi ghangi hyogha wayapalili, na mwenga mtepokela. Kangi, mtepokela hupo ngulu imemeswili nesu hata kumwaghika. Kwa ikiva mtevikilwa na Sapanga hupo hilahila muitumila mwenga kwa wandu ghangi.” <verse eid="LUK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu akawalongela kangi wavulwa ghaki mlandano hau, “Angali mihu anguwesa kumlongosa angali mihu mghangi? Kwa nagha wogha waivili wateyingila ng'ogha mulyoghu.” <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mvulwa kawesa ng'ogha kuvile kunani gha mvula ghaki, ila paayomola mavula ghaki, atewesa kuvile handa mvula ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Ghuli unguwesa kulola kibiki kinung'una kivile kulisu lya mlongo ghako na kangi bahala uloli ng'ogha libau limlisu lya wenga?”<verse eid="LUK 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Au ghuli unguwesa kumlongela mlongo ghako, “Mlongo, ulindili nikuhumisi kibiki kulisu gha wenga, na kunu uloli ng'ogha libau liwelili mu lisu ghako mweni?” Mmbindingu wenga. Utumbuli kuhumisa libau livili mulisu lyako, na baha ndiwa utewesa kulola maha ghuli utehumisa kibiki kivile mlisu gha mlongo ghako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libiki humanyika kwa matungula ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayu 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Libiki lya maha lilela ng'ogha mahiliwi mahakata, hilahila libiki lihakata lilela ng'ogha mahiliwi maha. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Wandu humanya libiki kwa matungula ghaki. Wandu wakonyoli ng'ogha matungula gha tini kunani mwa kiputila hilahila wakonyola ng'ogha zabibu kumbigili. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mundu maha uhumisa yavile maha kuhuma kuluhanja maha luvili mumoyu ghaki, na mundu mhakata uhumisa yavile mahakata kuhuma kuluhanja hakata ivile mumoyu ghaki, kwaikiva mundu ulongela kuhumila na yala yamemili mumoyu ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wachengaji wa njila ivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayu 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Ghuli mngunikema ‘Bambu, Bambu,’ na mwenga mghola ng'ogha yala niwalongelili? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nitewalangiha mlandano wa mundu anikovekela nenga, anguhyoghanila milando gha nenga na kuyaghola. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Hayu alandine na mundu anguchenga lighuta, avile kahimba pahi na kuvika mtumbula ghaki kunani gha liganga, kukahumila kumema kwa masi ngoo gha lweni, masi gha lweni yakahika kutova lila lighuta, ila iwesili ng'ogha kutikanyika, kwaikiva iwelili waichenga maha. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ila yoyose apikanila milando gha nenga na aghole ng'ogha chochose, hayu angulandine na mundu achengili lighuta kunani mwa kulutupi na kakotoho kuvika mtumbula. Kumema kwa masi ngoo kukihika, masi yakatova lighuta lila, likagua na kuyalamika nesu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mtumikila wa mkulu wa watovangondo wa Ulumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayu 8:5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu paayomolili kulonga milando hila hyogha kwa wandu wamuhyoghanilili, akayenda mmbwani Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Kula kuwelili mkulu wa watovangondo awelili mlumi, na awelili na mtumikila ghaki ampalili nesu. Mtumikila yula awelili mvina pabehi na kuhova.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Mtovangondo wa Kilumi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Yula mkulu paahyoghanilili habali gha Yesu, akawayegha kwa mweni wagogolo amonga wa Wayahudi, kwa kumkonya ahike kumlamisa mtumikila ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Pawahikili kwa Yesu, wakamluwa amtangi, wakilonga, “Hayu angupalwa kugholelwa mghalu hau,” <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kwaikiva mweni anguupala mlima hau wogha wa twenga, na ndiwa hayu atuchengili lighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Hinu Yesu akayenda pamonga na weni. Paawelili pabehi na kwa yula mkulu wa watovangondo, yula mkulu akawayegha waghanja ghaki kumlongela Yesu, “Bambu, ukotoho kujighasa, kwaikiva nenga nipalilwa ng'ogha uyingile mghati gha lighuta ghangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ndiwa kwaikiva niliwonili nipalilwa ng'ogha kuhika kwa wenga. Ila ulongeli lilando hela, na mtumikila ghangu atelama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwaikiva nenga kangi ni mundu nivile pai gha ulongosi, na nivile na watovangondo pai kwa nenga. Panimlongela mmonga, ‘Uyendi,’ na mweni huyenda, panimlongela ghangi, ‘Uhiki.’ Namweni uhika, na mtumikila ghangu, ‘Ghola kindu haki.’ Namweni ughola.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu paahyoghanila ghala, alikangasili nesu, hinu akahyuka kulilola lila lipinga lya wandu liwelili likimkovekela, akalonga, “Nilola ng'ogha avile na kukwinila handa haku hata paghati gha Izilaeli hyogha.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Hinu wala watumikila walaghilililwi pawahika kulila lighuta, na weni wamuwonili yula mtumikila alamili kala.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumhindula mwana wa nyongo ahoviliwi na mlumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Kuulongolo, Yesu ayendili kumbwani mmonga ukemwa Naini, na wavulwa ghaki na lipinga likulunga lya wandu wayendili pamonga mweni. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Paahikili pabei na lilyango lya mmbwani, kukahumila wandu wapapilii higha gha mlumi mmonga mwana weka wa nyongo ahoviliwi na mlumi ghaki. Wandu watangala wa mmbwani hula wawelili pamonga na nyongo yula. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Bambu Yesu paamwonili nyongo yula akamwonela luhungu, akamlongela, “Ukotoho kulila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Hinu, akayenda pabehi akaliyavisa lila litendegu lya kuwonjela, na wala wawelili walipapa wakagholoka. Hinu akalonga, “Msongolo. Ningukulongela uyimuki.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yula ahovili akayimuka akatama, akatumbula kulongela. Na Yesu akamlongela yula mwana uyendi kwa nyongo ghako. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Wandu wogha wakakolwa na holu, wakavile wangumyinula Sapanga wakilonga, “Mlota wa Sapanga mkulu kahumila paghati gha twenga. Sapanga kahika kuwakombola wandu ghaki.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Lilando lila aligholili Yesu lilandalili kogha ku Yudasia na kumilima gha pabehi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wajumbi kuhuma kwa Yohanambatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayu 11:2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Wavulwa wa Yohanawakamlongela milando hila hyogha ihumilili. Hinu Yohanaakawakema waivili paghati gha weni, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />na kuwayegha kwa Bambu Yesu kumkonya, “Wenga ndiwa yula Yohanaatulongelili utehika kutukombola au tumlindile mundu ghangi?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Wala wayitikila pawahikili kwa Yesu wakamlongela, “Yohanambatisa katuyegha kwa wenga tukukonye, ‘Yiwa wenga ndiwa yula atulongilile utehika au tumlindile mundu ghangi.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Lipindi lilalila Yesu awelili anguwalamisa wandu watangala wawelili wanguhakilwa kwa mavina na wawelili na mahoka na kuwawesesa wandu wangalikulola watangala kulola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Kuulongolo Yesu akawayanga wala wajumbi, “Myende kumlongela Yohanamilando muilola na kuihyoghanila, wangali kulola wangulola, walemafu wangutyanga, wavile na ukalawa wangulamiswa, majogo wanguhyoghanila, wala wahova wanguhinduliwa na wandu wavile na hindu ng'ogha wangulongelwa Habali Maha. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kahighilwa mundu yula avileng'ogha na ungingamo na nenga.” <verse eid="LUK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Pala wajumbi wa Yohanapawahukili, Yesu akatumbula kuwalongela mapinga gha wandu milando gha Yohanaakilonga, “Myendili kumanyahi kwa Yohana mliwachilili kulola niki? Mpalili kulola lunyahi lukukulilwi na liyegha?” <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Hinu, myendili kulola niki? Myendili kulola mundu avalili nguu zya maheli? Ng'ogha. Wala wavalili nguu zya mapesa yatangala na kulikala kwa kuhekelela wangulikala kulighuta lya kinkosi. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Hinu, mnilongele myendili kulola niki? Myendili kumlola mlota wa Sapanga? Hinaa, ninguwalongela mwenga yula mumlola apiti mlota wa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Hayu Yohana ndiwa angulongelwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga, “Sapanga ailongile ningumyegha mtumikila wa nenga akulongoleli kuulongolo, ili akutengeli njila uteityangila,” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />akayomola kwa kulonga, “Ninguwalongela, kuwandu wogha walikalili kumlima wogha kwahela mundu avile mkulu apiti Yohanambatisa. Ila kangi yeyose wamvalangila yiwa mnung'una kuunkosi wa Sapanga anguvalangilwa mkulu apiti Yohana.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Pawahyoghanila ghala wandu wogha pamonga na watola usulu wakayitikila yiwa mghalu wa Sapanga ni maha, na wala ndiwa wandu wapokelili ubatiso wa Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ila Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghilo lya Musa waulemili mghalu wa Sapanga, na kulema kubatiswa na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Hinu nitewalandisa wandu wa kiwelekwa haki na niki? Wogha walandine na ghani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ni handa wasongolo wawelili watama kugulilo na kulongelana kwa lilowi likulunga, lipinga limonga na ghangi, ‘Tugholili mhambu wa luheku, ila mkinili ng'ogha. Tuyimba uyimbo wa luhungu ila mlila ng'ogha.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kwaikiva Yohanambatisa ahikili, mweni alyeghili ng'ogha libumunda hata kunywegha divai handa weni, na mwenga mlongili, ‘Avile na lihoka.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Na mweni Mwana wa Mundu ahikili, angulyegha na kunywegha, na mwenga mkalonga, ‘Mumlole hayu angupala kulyegha nesu hayu ka mlowela, ghanja wa watola usulu na wogha wavile na sambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ila mawachilo gha luhala gha Sapanga yahighilikiswa ni kuwaghola wandu wa maha kwa wogha waikwinila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuukaya kwa simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mfalisayo mmonga amkonyili Yesu kulyegha mulyo ukaya ghaki. Yesu akayingila ukaya kwa hayu Mfalisayo, akatama kulyegha mulyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Kumbwani kula kuwelili na mdala mmonga awelili na sambi nesu. Mdala yula paahyoghanilili yiwa Yesu awelili akilyegha kulighuta kwa yula Falisayo, akahika akiyegha supa gha mahuta gha manungilo igholilwi na maganga gha alabasita. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Akahika, akagholoka kumaghulu gha Yesu, akilila na masosi ghaki yakamguila Yesu kumaghulu. Yula mdala akapakala maghulu gha Yesu kwa hwila ghaki. Hinu akainonela na kuityelemeka yala manungilo gha mapesa zitangala. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Yula Mfalisayo amkemili Yesu paalolili ghala, akaliwachila mmoyu ghaki, “Ikiva mundu hayu mlota wa Sapanga angalimanya yiwa hayu mdala kanogha ng'ogha, kana masambi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu akamlongela yula Mfalisayo, “Simoni, nenga na kindu kya kukulongela.” Na mweni Simoni akamlongela, “Hina. Mvula ulonge.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Wandu waivili wawelili watola mapesa kwa mundu mmonga. Mmonga awelili angupalwa kuhipa vipandi imia na itano vya migwala gha feza na ghangi vipandi ihamsini vya maganga gha feza. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Pawawesang'ogha kuhipa mapesa ghala, yula mundu akawesesa kuwalekesela wogha waivili. Hinu ni ghani paghati gha wala atempala nesu yula Bambu?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni akamyanga, “Ninguliwachila yiwa yula aweseswa kulekeselwa vipandi vya feza vitangala ndiwa atempala nesu.” Na mweni Yesu akamlongela, Utosili kwa uchakaka. <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kuulongolo Yesu akamghalambukila yula mdala na kumlongela Simoni, “Simoni ungumlola hayu mdala? Paniyingila mghati gha lighuta ghako, na wenga unipeghili ng'ogha masi gha kughululila maghulu ghangu, ila mdala hayu kaghulula maghulu ghangu na masosi ghaki kwa kuipyata na hwila ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wenga unijambusili ng'ogha kwa kuninonela, ila hayu mdala kuhuma niyingila baha awelili akininonela maghulu ghangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wenga unipakala ng'ogha mahuta kumutu ghangu, ila mweni kapakala manungilo kumaghulu gha nenga. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kwaikiva gha nagha ningukulongela upalo avile mdala hayu kauwonesa ungughihilisa yiwa Sapanga kamlekesela Sambi ghaki yavile yatangala. Ila yula alekelelilwi kwa mayaghani hupala kwa mayaghani.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Hinu, Yesu akamlongela yula mdala, “Ulekeselwa sambi syako.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Ndiwa wala wawelili pamonga na mweni lipindi lya kulyegha wakakonyana, “Ni mundu wa ghuli hayu hata kanguwesa kukulekesela sambi?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Na mweni Yesu akamlongela yula mdala, “Kukwinila kwa wenga ikulamisa, uyende kwa kuponga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Wadala walongosanili pamonga na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Kuulongolo Yesu akatyanga kummbwani na vimbwani wekaweka, akivula na kutangasa Habali Maha zya Unkosi wa Sapanga. Wala wavula ghaki ikumi na ivili wayendili pamonga. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Pamonga na wadala wamonga wala avile kawalamisa mahoka na mavina ghangi, walongosanili na mweni. Wala ndiwa mahina ghao ni Malia wamkemili Magidalena, yula avile ahumisilwi mahoka isaba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yoana mdala wa Kuza, mghola lihengu mkulu wa Helode, Susana na wadala ghangi watangala. Hagha wadala wawelili wakiwatumikila Yesu na wavulwa ghaki kwa hindu ghao weni.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mundu angukulila mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliku 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Lipindi limonga wandu wawelili wakimkovekela Yesu kuhuma mmbwani wekaweka, na lipinga likulunga lya wandu walikungulili. Na mweni akawapegha mlandano hau, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mundu mmonga ayendili kukulila mbeyu ghaki. Paawelili akikweta mbeyu ghaki, ghangi ziguili mnjila, na watyanga mnjila wazitimbili na wambongo wa kundumba wazilyeghili. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ghangi ziguili kumandakali yakongine na maganga, na badili gha kumela ziyomelili kwa kulepelela unyekinyeki. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ghangi ziguili paghati gha mibiki gha mihomi. Hila mibiki gha mbigili badili gha kukula igholili kuitindila. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ghangi ziguili kulutupu lya maha yavile na lutuba, zimelili na kulela mbunji kila limonga mbunji imia,” Paawelili akilonga ghala alitova lilowi akilonga, “Yula avile na mapulukilo gha kuhyoghanila na ahyoghanile.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa kuvula kwa milandano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliku 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Wavulwa ghaki Yesu wamkonyili lukani lwa mlandano hau. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Na mweni akayanga, “Mwenga mhighiliwa kumanya uchakaka wa Unkosi wa Sapanga hula umanyika ng'ogha dahile hinaa umanyika, ila hagha ghangi wamanyi ng'ogha, ila hagha hulongelwa kwa milandano, ili pawalola wakotoho kuilola, na pawahyoghanila wawese ng'ogha kumanya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela mlandano wa mkulila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliku 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Hinu hali ndiwa lukani lwa mlandano wa yula mtukutula, mbeyu ni lilando lya Sapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Zila ziguili mumnjila zinguwonesa wandu wala wahyoghanila lila lilando, na kuulongolo Lihyukana akahika na lihumisa kumioyu gha weni ili wakotoho kukwinila na kulamiswa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Zila ziguili kumandakali yakongine na maganga ingumanisa wandu wala wavile pawahyoghanila lilando lila hulipokela kwa luheko. Ila handa zila mbeyu, zivile ng'ogha na mikigha kwaikiva ukwinila kwa lipindi lya mayaghani hela, na pawayesilwi huleka lilando lya Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Zila mbeyu ziguili kumbigili ni mlandano wa wandu wala wapikanila lila lilando, ila lipindi mayaghani, pawayenda ghao, hutindilwa na holu, hindu ngoo, na maghaso gha ngalilu gha kila lichuwa vinguwatindila hata kuwesa ng'ogha kukula kuukwinila wa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Na zila ziguili kulutupi gha maha hagha ndiwa wandu wala walipikanila lila lilando, wakalighola kwa moyu maha na kwa kukwinila. Wala hutama nuu mbaka wakalela matungula.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa limbamba ligubikilwi kwa lidebi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maliku 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Wandu wakosa ng'ogha limbamba na kuligubika kwa lidebi au kulivika mulufungu gha kindanda. Ila huivika kunani gha mbaku ili wandu pawayingila mghati wawese kulola mhana. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Hilahila chochose kihighwa kitegubutuliwa, na kwahela kihighwa kya kusindwa kuwoneka ng'ogha lipala. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Kwa nagha, mlikali mihu na vila mvihyoghanila, kwaikiva avile na kindu ateyongesewa, ila yula avile na hindu ng'ogha atepokolwa hata kila aliwachila yiwa kakikola atepokolwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walongo wa unagha wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliku 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Hinu, nyongo na walongo wa Yesu wakahika kumlola, ila wawesa ng'ogha kuhika pabehi na mweni kwaikiva gha lipinga likulunga lya wandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Kuulongolo mundu mmonga akamlongela Yesu, “Nyongo ghako na walongo ghako wangukulindila panji, wangupala kukulola.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ila Yesu akawalongela wandu wogha, “Nyongo ghangu na walongo ghangu ni wala wanguyoghanila lilando lya Sapanga na kulighola.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulaghila liyegha lipongi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliku 4:35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lichuwa limonga, Yesu akwelili whatu pamonga na wavulwa ghaki, akawalongela, “Tughubuki lihiwa tuyendi mpaka mwambu.” Hinu, wakatumbula mwanja. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Pawawelili wakiyenda kwa kutumila whatu hila, Yesu akolilwi na lughono, akawonja, liyegha litopehu likahika mmasi na masi yakatumbula kuyingila mghati mwa whatu, na weni wakavile mngondu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Wala wavulwa wakamwendela Yesu, wakamuyimusa wakilonga, “Bambu, Bambu. Tunguyalamila.” Yesu akayimuka, akaukalipila liyegha na lyeni likaleka kuwumba na masi yakaponga . <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Hinu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Kukwinila kwa mwenga wa kugha” na weni wakawela na holu na kulikangasa, wakikonyana “Hayu ni mundu ghani? Ikiva angulilaghila liyegha na masi vingumyitikila.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu avile na lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliku 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na wavulwa ghaki wakayendelela na mwanja wakavika whatu kumlima wa Wagelasi, ulikalili mbandi gha ipili gha lihiwa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu paawelili angughuluka kuhuma muwhatu, akonganili na mundu mmonga wa mlima hula akolilwi na mahoka. Mundu yula kavala lihabiti ng'ogha kuhuma machuwa yatangala hilahila kalikala ng'ogha mghati mwa lighuta ila kumamambi hela. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Lipindi amlolili Yesu, akalila kwa lilowi na akalidanga pahi kuulongolo ghaki, na kulonga kwa makakala, “Yesu, Mwana wa Sapanga mweni kuwela kunani, kuna kyani na nenga? Ningukuluwa ukotoho kunihakili.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Alongili nagha kwa ikiva Yesu awelili kamlongela hayu lihoka amhuki mundu hayu. Hayu lihoka awelili angumkamula mundu yula mihanja itangala, hata ikavile wandu wamviki mghati na kumuwopa kwa minyololu, ila mweni avidumulili na yula lihoka kumyegha mweni kulivagha. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu akamkonya, “Lihina lyako ghani?” Na mweni akamyanga, “Lihina lyangu ni ‘Mtova ngondu.’ ” Alongili nagha kwa ikiva mghati mwa mundu yula muwelili na mahoka yatangala. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Wala mahoka wakamuluwa Yesu akotoho kuwayegha kuliwumba litali liyendelela. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Na pabehi na pala kuwelili na lipinga lya mighuluwi itangala iwelili ikijihakila mulyo kumibondi gha litumbi. Wala mahoka wakamuluwa Yesu awalekeseli wayingili mghati mwa wala mighuluwi. Na mweni akawalekesela. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Hinu mahoka wakamuhuka mundu yula na kuyingila mghati mwa wala maghuluwi. Lipinga lyogha lya maghuluwi wakaghuluka mbilo kulitumbi na kujumbukila mghati mwa masi, na weni wakahova masi. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Wala wahungaji pawalolili hyogha yahumilili wakabhutuka mbilo, wakayenda kuwalongela wandu kumbwani na kuvimbwani. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Wandu wakahika kulola yahumilili, wakamuyendela Yesu, wakamlola yula mundu ahumisililwi mahoka katama upenuni kwa Yesu, kavala nguu, akiva na lughala ghaki, wakawela na holu. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Wala wandu walolili yala yahumilili wakawalongela wandu wayendili kulola vila yula akolilwi na mahoka alamisilwi. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Hinu wandu wogha wa mlima wa Wagelasi wakakolwa na holu ngulu, hinu wakamkonya Yesu ahuki. Hinu Yesu akayingila mghati gha whatu ili ahuki. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mundu yula ahumisililwi mahoka akamuluwa Yesu wahuki pamonga na mweni, ila Yesu amkanilili, akamlongela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Uhuyi kuukaya ukalongele hyogha Sapanga akugholelili,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:39">hinu yula mundu akayenda akitangasa kila mahala kummbwani hula mighalu hyogha Yesu amgholelili.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biti Yailo anguhinduliwa na mdala mmonga angulamiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliku 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu paahuyili upandi ghangi wa lihiwa, lipinga lya wandu limpokelili kwa luheku, kwaikiva wogha wawelili wakimlindila. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Mkulu mmonga wa lighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi lihina lyaki Yailo akahika. Akajidanga pahi kuulongolo gha Yesu na kumuluwa ahiki kwa mweni, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Kwa ikiva awelili na mwana mdala wa weka avile na ukulunga wa machuva ikumi na ivili, na awelili pabehi na kuhwegha. Yesu paawelili akiyenda kula, lipinga likulunga lya wandu liwelili likimtindila na kumghasa. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Paghati gha weni kuwelili na mdala mmonga avile na uvina wa kuhuma mwahi kwa lipindi lya machuva ikumi na ivili. Kawesa kutumila hindu ghaki hyogha kuwapegha walamisa, ila kwahela hata mmonga kawesa kumlamisa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Mdala hayu akahika kuyetu gha Yesu na kuyavisa liviniku lya lihabiti ghaki. Na bwitu akalamiswa hula uvina wa kuhuma kwa mwahi. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu akakonya, “Ni ghani aniyavisili?” Wandu wogha wakanili, ila Petelo akalonga, “Bambu, ungulola ng'ogha yiwa wandu wangukutindila na kukukovekela.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ila Yesu akalonga, “Kuvile na mundu kaniyavisa kwaikiva ninguhyoghanila nimlamisa mundu kwa makakala ghangu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yula mdala paalolili yiwa kamanyika, akahika akihihimila kwa holu na kutundamila manung'una pahi kuulongolo gha Yesu. Na pala kuulongolo gha wandu wogha, akalongela vila amyavisili na kulamiswa bwitu. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu akamlongela, “Biti, kukwinila ghako ukulamisa. Uyendi kwa kuponga.” <verse eid="LUK 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu paawelili angali akilonga, Yailo akayeghelwa lilando kuhuma kuukaya, “Mwana ghako ahovili kala, ukotoho kuyendelela kumghasa mvula.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu paahyoghanila ghala akamlongela Yailo, “Ukotoho kuwela na holu, ukwinili hela na mweni atelamiswa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Paahikili kuukaya kwa Yailo kamlekesela ng'ogha mundu kuyingila mghati gha lighuta pamonga na mweni, ila Petelo na Yohanana Yakobu na walela wa hayu mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Wandu wogha wawelili wakilila na kulumbilila kwaikiva gha yula biti ahovili. Ila Yesu akawalongela, “Mkotoho kulila, kwaikiva mwana kahova ng'ogha, kaghonja hela.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Na weni wakamuheka Yesu kwaikiva wamanyili yiwa awelili kahova kala. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ila Yesu akamkola liwoko akalonga, “Mwana, uyimuki.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Mpumulo gha mwana ukamuhuyila, akayimuka bwitu Yesu akawalongela wampeghi mulyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Walela ghaki walikangasili, ila Yesu akawalongela wakotoho kumlongela mundu yeyose yala yahumilili.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalaghilila wala wavulwa ghaki ikumi na ivili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliku 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu awakemili wala wavulwa ikumi na ivili, akawapegha ulongosi na makakala gha kuwawinga mahoka hyogha, na uweso wa kulamisa wavina. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Hinu akawalaghilila wayendi kuwatangasila wandu Unkosi wa Sapanga na kulamisa wavina. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Akawalongela, “Pamtumbula mwanja mkotoho kutola chochose. Mkotoho kutola hiyatu, ng'ogha mhaku, ng'ogha mulyo, ng'ogha mapesa, ng'ogha likoti ghangi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Lighuta lyoyose mteyingila na kupokelwa, mlikali hamu mpaka lipindi lya kuhuka kukimbwani haki. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Wandu pawawakanila kuwapokela, mhuki kumbwani hau, na mwenga pamuhuka mupumundi lifu mumaghulu gha mwenga lilando hali mlongelili litewela kilangihi kwa weni kwa mahakata ghao.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Hinu wavulwa wala ikumi na ivili wakatumbula mwanja, wapitilili kuvimbwani wekaweka, wakitangasa Habali Maha na kulamisa wandu kila mahala.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkosi Helode anguyingilwa na holu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliku 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Hinaa, nkosi Helode yula alongosili ku Galilaya akahyoghanila mighalu hyogha iwelili ikigholwa na Yesu, akavile na holu kwaikiva wawelili wakilongela, Yohanambatisa kahinduka kuhuma kwa kihu. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Ghangi walongili yiwa Elia awelili mlota wa Sapanga kahumila, na ghangi walongili yiwa mmonga wa walota wa Sapanga wa dahile kahinduka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ila Helode akalonga, “Yohananimhengili mutu, hinaa hayu ni ghani nihyoghanila lilando ghaki?” Akavile na luhujulu lya kumlola.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwapegha mulyo wandu ielufu itano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Wala wandumindumi pawahuyili, wakamlongela Yesu hyogha wayagholili. Yesu akawatola, wakayenda weka hela kumbwani Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ila wala wandu pawamanyili kula ayendili, wakamkovekela. Yesu akawapokela akawalongela vila Unkosi wa Sapanga unguyenda, akawalamisa wala wapalili kulamiswa. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Lijuwa palitumbula kuhonga, wala wandumindumi ikumi na ivili wakamuyendela na kumlongela, “Uwalekeseli wandu wayendi kuvimbwani na matawa ya pabehi, wakahakuli mulyo na mahala pakughonja, kwaikiva baha tulikala ni kumanyahi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ila Yesu akawalongela, “Muwapeghi mwenga mulyo.” Wakamuyanga, “Twahela chochose ila mibumunda itano na homba waivili. Tuyendi weni mani tukawahemeleli mulyo wandu wogha baha.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Wawelili pala walumi ielufu itano, hinu Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Muwalongeli wandu watami kumapinga gha wandu ihamsini.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Wavulwa wakaghola handa walongelilwi, wakawatamisa wogha. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Hinu Yesu akaitola hila mibumunda miitano na wala homba waivili akalola kundumba, akamshukwile Sapanga, akavihighila, akavimetula, akawapegha wavulwa ghaki wawapeghi wandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Wandu wogha wakalyegha, wakayukuta. Wakakungula yasyelili gha mulyo, wavulwa wakamemesa vibeja ikumi na ivili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angulongela yiwa Yesu ni Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayu 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maliku 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lichuwa limonga, Yesu awelili anguyupa weka hela, na wavulwa ghaki wawelili pabehi. Hinu, akawakonya, “Wandu wangulonga yiwa nenga na ghani?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Na weni wakamuyanga, “Ghangi wangulonga yiwa wenga ni Yohana Mbatisa, ghangi, Elia, ghangi, mmonga wa walota wa Sapanga wa dahile avile kahinduka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Pala akawakonya, “Na mwenga ghuli, mngulonga yiwa nenga ni ghani?” Petelo akayanga, “Wenga ndiwa Kilisito yula ahaghulilwi na Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela mahakili ghaki na kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayu 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maliku 8:30-9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Hinu Yesu akawalaghila nesu wakotoho kumlongela mundu yoyose mlando hula. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Akayendelela kulonga yiwa ingupalwa nenga Mwana wa Mundu nipokeli uhakili utangala na kukanilwa na wagogolo na watambika wakulu na wavula wa laghililo lya Musa na kukomwa, ila lichuwa lya itatu atehinduliwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Hinu akawalongela wandu wogha, “Mundu yeyose paapalwa kuvile mtumikila wa nenga, angupalwa ajikani mweni, atole lipingika ghaki kila lelo, anikovekeli. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwaikiva, mundu apalili kuulokola ukomu ghaki mweni, ateyalamisa ukomu hau, ila yula ayalamisili ukomu ghaki kwaikiva gha nenga, ateulokola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ghuli, kana hupo liki mundu kapokela hindu zyogha zya mlima wogha ila akajiyalamisa mweni? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ikiva mundu anguniwonela honi nenga na mavulo ghangu, Mwana wa Mundu atemuwonela honi mundu hayu lipindi atehika kwa ukulu ghaki na wa Tati na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ninguwalongela unagha, wamonga paghati gha wandu watamili baha watehova ng'ogha mbaka waulole Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angughalambuka wuso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayu 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:28">Maliku 9:28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Palihikili lichuwa lya inane badili gha kulonga ghala, Yesu akawatola Petelo na Yohanana Yakobu, akayenda na weni kulitumbi kumyupa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Paawelili akiyupa, wuso ghaki ughalambukili, nguu zing'alile mbulete pee. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Bwitu na wandu waivili wakawoneka wakilonga na mweni, na weni wawelili Musa na Elia, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Wahumila wakiva na ungalile nesu, wakalonga na mweni vila atehova na njila ateyomwiki yala yayandikilwi kula Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petelo na wayake wawelili wakolwa na lughono nesu, ila hata nagha wayimukili na kulola ukulu ungalile nesu wa Yesu na wala wandu waivili wawelili wagholoka pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Hinu, wandu wala waivili pawawelili wakihuka, Petelo akamlongela Yesu, “Bambu, ni maha twenga twa baha. Hinu tuchengi vibimilo viitatu. kimonga kya wenga, kimonga kya Musa, na kimonga kya Elia,” na mweni alongili ghala akali kamanya ng'ogha kila akilonga. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petelo paawelili akiyendelela kulonga, lihindu likahumila na kuwagubika. Na wavulwa wala watilili kwa kulola yiwa wagubikilwi na lila lihindu. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Na lilowi likahyoghanika kuhuma paghati gha lila lihindu, likilonga, “Hayu ndiwa Mwana wa nenga nimuhaghulili. Mumhyoghanili.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />kuulongolo gha lila lilowi kuhyoghanilika, Yesu awonikanili akiva weka hela. Wavulwa wawelili watamilinuu kwa mighalu hila, na lipindi lila wamlongelili ng'ogha mundu yoyose mighalu hila wailolili.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mhongolo avile na lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayu 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maliku 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Kilau ghaki Yesu na wavulwa ghaki waitatu pawawelili waghuluka kala kulitumbi, lipinga likulunga lya wandu likonganilili na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Pala, mundu mmonga kulipinga lila akatova lilowi, akilonga, “Mvula, ningukuluwa umlamisi mhongolo ghangu mwana ghangu wa weka. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Lihoka humkola, na bwitu mhongolo hutumbula kutova lilowi, humpegha kingulengi, na lifulufulu lingumuhumila mumlomo. Huyendelela kumuhakila nesu, na kukotoho kumleka kwa kuloposela. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Niwaluwili wavulwa ghako wamvingi lihoka hayu, ila wawesili ng'ogha.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu akalonga, “Mwenga kiweleka kiwelili ng'ogha na kukwinila, kileka njila na kihakata. Nitelikala pamonga na mwenga na kutamanuu mbaka ligha?” Hinu akamlongela yula mundu, “Umyeghi mhongolo ghako kwa nenga.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Lipindi mhongolo yula pawelili akimuhikila Yesu, yula lihoka likamgua pahi na kumpegha kingulengi. Ila Yesu akamkalipila yula lihoka na akamlamisa yula mhongolo na kumhuyisa kwa tati ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Na wandu wogha wakangasilwi na uweso mkulunga wa Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu angulongela kangi kwa habali gha kihu kyaki</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliku 9:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Na wala wogha pawawelili wakilikangasa kwa mighalu hila hyogha agholili Yesu, mweni akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mhyoghanili maha hagha ninguwalongela. Mwana wa Mundu anguyenda kuvikwa mumawoko gha wandu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ila wala wavulwa wamanyili ng'ogha yiwa lilando lila lingumanisa niki. Lilando lila liwelili lihighwa kwa weni ili wakotoho kumanya, na weni wakatila kumkonya mlando hula.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghani avile mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliku 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Kukahumila malongelano paghati gha wala wavulwa yiwa ghani paghati gha weni awelili mkulu apiti wogha. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu akamanya mawachilo kumioyu ghao. Hinu akatola mwana akamvika pabehi na mweni, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />na kuwalongela, “Yula ampokela mwana mnung'una handa hayu kwa lihina lya yula ayeghilwi na kupeghwa ulongosi na Sapanga. Anipokeli nengang'ogha, ila angumupokela yula aniyeghili nenga. Kwaikiva yula kawela mnung'una paghati mwa mwenga ndiwa mkulu apiti wogha paghati mwa mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yula kangingamang'ogha na mwenga kambandi gha mwenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maliku 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Na Yohanaakalonga, “Bambu, tumlolili mundu mmonga akivinga mahoka wandu kwa lihina lya yula ayeghilwi na kupeghwa ulongosi na Sapanga, na twenga tumkanisa, kwaikiva mweni wa lipinga lya twenga ng'ogha.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ila Yesu akamlongela, “Mkotoho kumkanisa, kwa ikiva yula kangingama na mwengang'ogha kambandi gha mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu wa kimbwani kimonga kya Samalia wangulema kumpokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Lipindi gha Yesu gha kutolwa kundumba palivile pabehi. Mweni alamulili kuyenda ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Hinu, akawayegha wajumbi wamlonguleli, na weni wakayenda wakayingila kimbwani kimonga kya Wasamalia ili wamtengeli kila kindu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ila wakola mlima wa pala wakanili kumpokela Yesu, kwaikiva awelili kumwanja kuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Wavulwa ghaki, Yakobu na Yohanapawalolili mighalu hila, wakalonga. “Bambu, ghuli ungupala tulaghili lyoto liwaghulukili kuhuma kundumba na kuwayalamisa?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ila Yesu akawahiyukila na kuwakalipila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Hinu wakahuka na kuyenda kukimbwani kingi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wala wangupalwa kumkovekela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayu 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Pawawelili kumwanja, mundu mmonga akamlongela Yesu, “Nitekukovekela kokose uteyenda.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu akalonga, “Likokolo walikema Mbweha wavile na mambaku, na mbongo wa kunani wavile na vijaka ila Mwana wa Mundu avile ng'ogha mahala pakupumlilila.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kangi akamlongela mundu mghangi, “Nikovekeli.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 9:59">Hayu akalonga, “Bambu, nilekeseli lihanja limu niyendi kumsika tati ghangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu akamlongela, “Uwaleki wandu wavile na holu mmoyu wawasiki wandu wa weni, ila wenga uyendi ukatangasi Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Mundu ghangi akalonga, “Bambu, nitekukovekela ila unilekeseli lihanja limonga niwatauli walongo ghangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu akamlongela, “Yeyose akolili lihuka kwa kutukutula na kangi angulola kuyetu, kamaha ng'ogha kwa Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwayegha wavulwa isabani na ivili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Badili gha hagha, Bambu awahaghulili ghangi isabini na ivili, akawalaghila waiviliwaivili, wamlongoleli kukila kimbwani na mahala kula mweni baha apalili kuyenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Akawalongela, “Mabeno yatangala, ila wabena ni mayaghani. Hinu, mumluwe mweni mabeno ayeghi wabena kulitawa ghaki.” <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Hinaa muyendi, mmanyi, ninguwayegha handa wanakondolu paghati gha wahakata ghaki kondolu handa ghalu mwitu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mkotoho kupapa mhaku kya mapesa na ng'ogha muhaku na ng'ogha hilatu na mkotoho gholoka mnjila mkayalamisa lisaa kwa kumjambusa mundu. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Pamuyingila kulighuta lolose, mtumbuli kwa kuwajambusa nagha, “kuponga kutami kulighuta hali” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ikiva kuvile na mundu mpala kuponga, kuponga gha mwenga itetama na mweni, ikiva kwahela mpala kuponga, kuponga itewahyila mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mlikali kulighuta hali mkilyegha na kunywegha vila wawapegha, kwaikiva mghola lihengu angupalwa apokeli msahala. Mkotoho kuhuka huka lihanja limonga lighuta hali na lihanja ghangi lighuta ghangi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Na kumbwani kokose muteyingila, wandu pawawapokela, mlyeghi na kunywegha kila watewapegha. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mlamisi wavina wavile haku, muwatangasili wandu, “Unkosi wa Sapanga upabehi kwa mwenga.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Hinu pamuyingila kumbwani kokose, ikavile wawapokela ng'ogha, mhuki, na mwenga pamtyanga kunjila zya weni mlonge, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Hata lifu lya mmbwani mwa mwenga lijikolili mumaghulu gha twenga tungulipumunda kwa mwenga ivile kilangihi kya mahakata gha mwenga. Ila, mmanyi yiwa Unkosi wa Sapanga upabehi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ninguwalongela unagha yiwa kwa lichuwa lya kulamula mmbwani hau utelamulwa nesu ipiti uhakata wa wandu wa Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chondi kwa mimbwani ikanili kumkwinila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayu 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Chondi wandu wa Kolazini, chondi wadu wa Betisaida, kwaikiva makangaso yagholekili kwa wenga yangaligholeka kummbwani wa Tilo na mmbwani wa Sidoni wandu ghaki wangalileka mahakata dahile kwa kuvala magunila na kujipakala malifu ili kuwonesa waleka mahakata ghao. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Hata nagha, lichuwa lya kutosa mwenga mtepokela utoso mkulunga upiti gha wandu wa Tilo na wandu wa Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na mwenga wandu wa Kapelinaumu, ghuli, mnguliwachila yiwa mteyinulwa mbaka kundumba kwa Sapanga? Ng'ogha nagha, mtehuluswa mbaka kumlima wa wandu wahovili.” <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Hinu Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Yula awahyoghanila mwenga, angunihyoghanila nenga, yula awapokela ng'ogha mwenga, kanipokela ng'ogha nenga, na yula kanipokela ng'ogha nenga, kanipokela ng'ogha Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wala wavulwa isabani na ivili wanguhuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Kuulongolo, wala wavulwa isabani na ivili wahuyili wakiva wamema luheku, wakilonga, “Bambu, hata mahoka watuyitikila patuwalaghila kwa lihina lyako.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu akawalongela, “Niliwonili Lihyukana vila liwelili likighuluka kuhuma kundumba handa lumuli lwa umemi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mlole hinaa, niwapeghili uweso wa kutimba njoka na inge na ukulu wa kumsinda yula mhakata Lihyukana, kwahela kindu chochose kitewahakila. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Hata nagha, mkotoho kuhekelela kwaikiva mahoka wawayitikila, ila muhekeleli kwaikiva mahina ya mwenga yayandikilwi kundumba ili mvile wandu wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguhekelela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayu 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Lisaa lilalila, Yesu akahekelela kwa uweso wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, akalonga, “Ningukushukwile ee Tati, Bambu wa kundumba na mlima wogha, kwaikiva uwahigha wavile na luhala na wavile na mavulo mighalu hai, ukawagubutulila wanung'una. Hina Tati, havi ndiwa ungupala wenga.” <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tati wa nenga, uvikili vindu vyogha kumawoko gha nenga. Kwahela mundu angummanya Mwana ila Tati, kangi kwahela ammanya Tati ila Mwana na yeyose yula Mwana atempala kumugubutulila.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Hinu akawalola wavulwa ghaki akawalongela, “Wahighilwa wala wayalola yala mnguyalola mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kwaikiva ninguwalongela, walota wa Sapanga watangala na wankosi wapalili kulola mighalu munguilola mwenga, ila wayalola ng'ogha, na kuhyoghanila milando mnguihyoghanila mwenga, ila waihyoghanila ng'ogha.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msamalia wa maha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Kuulongolo mvula mmonga wa laghililo lya Musa akagholoka na kumkonya Yesu kwa kumuyesa, “Mvula, nighole niki ili nipokeli ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Mweni akamkonya, “Kiyandikwa niki kukihitabu kya laghililo lya Bambu? Ungumanya niki?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Akamyanga, “Umpali Bambu Sapanga ghako kwa moyu ghako wogha, kwa mpumulo ghako wogha, kwa makakala ghako hyogha na kwa mawachilo ghako lyogha. Na, umpali mundu wa pabehi ghako handa ujipala lamweni.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu akamlongela, “Uyanga maha. Ughole nagha, na wenga paughola nagha utelikala ukomu uyendelela.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ila mweni akipala kujihighilisila yiwa wa maha akamkonya Yesu, “Na mundu wa pabehi wa nenga ni ghani?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Mundu mmonga awelili akighuluka kwa kuhuma Yelusalemu kuyenda Yeliko. Paawelili kunjila, wapokola wakampundangila na wakampokola hindu ghaki na kumtova, na wakamleka kaghonja pala pabehi na kughwegha. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kukahumila mtambika mmonga akighuluka kunjila hilahila. Akamlola, akapitila mmbali. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Hilahila Mlawi mmonga akahika mahala pala, na mweni paamlolili mundu yula awelili kapundangilwa akapitila mmbali na kujiyendela. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ila Msamalia mmonga awelili na mwanja, akahika pala yula mundu awelili, na mweni paamlolili, akamwonela luhungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Akamuyendela, akampakala mtela kuvilonda ghaki kwa njila gha kumvika mahuta na divai na kuwopa litambala, hinu akamkwelesa kunani gha punda ghaki, akamyegha kulighuta lya wahenja na kumlola maha. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Kilau ghaki akatola vipandi viivili vya madini gha feza akampegha yula mweni lighuta, akamlongela, ‘Umuhungi mundu hayu, na chochose utetumila kumyongesela, nitekuhuyisila panihuya.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Hinu Yesu akamkonya, “Paghati gha hagha wogha waitatu, ni ghani alangilili yiwa ni mundu wa pabehi ghaki kwa yula apondangililwi na wapokola?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Mweni akayanga, “Ni yula amuwonelili luhungu.” Yesu akamlongela, “Uyendi ukaghole hilahila.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ukaya kwa Malita na Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu na wavulwa ghaki pawawelili kumwanja Yelusalemu, wayingilili kukimbwani kimonga na mdala mmonga wamkema Malita, akampokela kuukaya ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malita awelili na mhaja ghaki wamkema Malia, Hayu atamili pabehi na Yesu akihyoghanila mavulo ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ila Malita awelili na mahengu yatangala gha mayandalilo kukihinja. Hinu akamuyendela Yesu na kumlongela, “Bambu, ulola ng'ogha yiwa mhaja wa nenga kanileka nigholi mahengu gha kukihinja wekayangu hela? Umlongeli anitangi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ila Bambu akamuyanga, “Malita, Malita, ungughasika na kuhakilika kwaikiva gha vindu vitangala.” <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Bambu akamuyanga ila livile lilando limonga hela lya maha lipiti hyogha na mlando hau ni kunihyoghanila nenga. Malia ndiwa kahaghula, mghalu uwesa ng'ogha kuhumiswa kwa mweni na mundu.<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvula kuyupa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayu 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lichuwa limonga, Yesu awelili mahala kutenu akimyupa Sapanga. Paayomola kuyupa, mmonga wa wavulwa ghaki akamlongela, “Bambu, utuvuli kuyupa handa vila Yohanaawavulili wavulwa ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu akawalongela, “Pamyupa mlonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tati Lihina ghako litundamilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Unkosi ghako uhiki.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utupeghi mulyo wa twenga kila lelo.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utulekeseli sambi sya twenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kwaikiva twenga tunguwalekesela wandu wogha watugholela mahakata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kangi ukotoho kutuvika kumayeso, ila utughulusi kuhuma kwa yula mhakata.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Hinu akawalongela, “Kwa mlandano mmonga wa mwenga kawela na ghanja, akayenda kwa mweni uhiku wa mandandu, akamlongela, ‘Ghanja, pepai nikopesi mibumunda miitatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />kwaikiva ghanja ghangu kapitila kwa nenga akiva kumwanja na nenga nivile ng'ogha na mulyo wa kumpegha.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Na mweni kamghati ghaki amyangi, ‘ukotoho nighasa. Niwopa kala mlyango. Nenga na wana ghangu tughonja, niwesa ng'ogha kuyimuka nikupeghi .’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Kwa unagha ninguwalongela yiwa ateyimuka ng'ogha kumpegha mibumunda kwaikiva mweni ni ghanja ghaki hela, ila kwaikiva gha yula mundu kuyendelela kuluwa ailolile honi, ateyimuka na kumpegha vyogha angupala.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Na nenga ninguwalongela, muluwi na mwenga mtepeghwa, muhaki na mwenga mtepokela, mkuwi mlyango mtewoposelewa mlyango. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwaikiva kila mundu ailuwa angupeghwa, yula kanguhaka angupokela, na mundu yeyose akuwili mlyango anguwoposolewa mlyango. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ni Tati ghani paghati mwa mwenga anguwesa kumpegha mwana ghaki njoka ikiva kamluwa homba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Na ikiva kamluwa lihumbi, ghuli, atempegha mng'ongolo wamkema inge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Hinu ikiva mwenga mwawahakata mngumanya kuwapegha wana wa mwenga vindu vya maha, ni unagha yiwa, Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba atewagholela mwenga ipiti, atewapegha Mpumulo wa Sapanga wala wamluwili.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mkulu wa Mahoka wamkema Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayu 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maliku 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lichuwa limonga Yesu awelili akimuwinga mundu lihoka yula amgholili mundu kuvile angalikulonga. Hinu, hayu lihoka paamuhukili, yula mundu akawesa kulonga, hata na lipinga lya wandu likangasili. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ila wamonga wa wandu wala wakalonga, “Anguwawinga mahoka kwa uweso wa mkulu wa mahoka, yula wamkema Belizebuli.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Na ghangi wapalili kumuyesa wakimluwa awalangihi kilangihi kihighilisa yiwa uweso ghaki uhuma kundumba kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ila Yesu, akiva kamanya mawachilo ghao, akawalongela, “Unkosi wowose pautovana weni kwa weni utelekana utewesa ng'ogha kuyendelela, hilahila, wandu wa lipinga limonga lolose livile na ngondo liteyalamila.” <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Hinu ikiva Lihyukana likijingingamisa lyeni, unkosi ghaki uteyendelela ng'ogha. Ningulonga nagha, kwaikiva mwenga mngulonga yiwa ninguwawinga mahoka kwa uweso wa Belizebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Hinu ikiva nenga ninguwapunga mahoka kwa uweso wa Belizebuli, hata wavulwa wa mwenga hilahila wanguwapunga kwa uweso ghaki kwa ikiva gha nagha wavulwa wa mwenga watewatosa yiwa mnguwachila maheli ng'ogha.<verse eid="LUK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ila ikiva ninguwinga mahoka kwa uweso wa Sapanga, hinu mmanyi yiwa Unkosi wa Sapanga uhikili kala kwa mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Mundu avile na makakala paagholokela lyugha lyaki kwa migoha, hindu ghaki hyogha itesyehila kwa kuponga.” <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ila paahika mundu avile na makakala nesu akampondanga na kumsinda, hayu humpokola migoha ghaki alikwinilili na kutola vindu avikolili.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Mundu yeyose akonganika na nengang'ogha, anguningingama, na yeyose akungula ng'ogha pamonga na nenga, angulandala.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuya kwa Lihoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayu 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Lihoka paliwingwa kwa mundu, hutindilatindila mahala lipala akihakula mahala pakupumulila. Paapatili ng'ogha mahala pakupumulila, hujilongela, ‘Nitehuya kuukaya ghangu kula nihumili.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Paahika na kulola lila lighuta lipyahililwi na vindu kuvikwa maha, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Hinu, huyenda na kuwatola mahoka ghangi isaba wavile wahakata wapiti mweni, wogha huyenda, wakamuyingila mundu hayu. Hinu, lung'ai lwa mundu hayu hinaa utevile uhakata upiti pala mtumbula.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Highili gha unagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu paawelili akilonga yala, mdala mmonga kulila lipinga lya wandu, akalonga kwa lilowi ngulu, “Kahighilwa mdala akulela na kukuyongesa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu akalonga, “Ila wahighilwa nesu wala wandu wangulihyoghanila lilando lya Sapanga na kulikola.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wangupala kilangihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayu 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Lipinga lya wandu paliyendelelili kuyongeseka, Yesu akawalongela, “Kiwelekwa haki kihakata. Kingupala kilangihi, ila kitepeghwa ng'ogha kilangihi kyokyose ila kila kilangihi kya Yona.” <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kwaikiva vila Yona awelili kilangihi kwa wandu wa Ninawi, vilavila Mwana wa Mundu atevile kilangihi kwa wandu wa kiweleka haki. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Kilongosi mkulu mdala wa sheba atehumila lipindi kiwelekwa haki pakitetoswa, na mweni atehighilisa yiwa ni unagha mvile na mahakata. Kwaikiva mweni awelili na mwanja kuhuma kutali mwihu wa mlima wogha, kuhyoghanila milando gha luhala lya Selemani, na lelo pavili na mkulu kupiti Selemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Kwa lichuwa lya utoso, wandu wa Ninawi wategholoka na watehighilisa yiwa ni uchakaka mvile na mahakata, kwaikiva weni wahyukili na kulekiselwa mahakata ghao pawahyoghanilili mavulo gha Yona, na lelo kuvile na yula mkulu kupiti Yona.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhana wa higha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayu 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">Matayu 6:22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Kwahela mundu angukosa limbamba na kuligubika kwa lidebi, ila hulivika kunani kwa mmbaku mlighuta ili wandu pawayingila mghati wapati kulola mhana. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mihu gha wenga ni limbamba lya higha ghako, mihu ghako pailola maha, higha ghako wogha utevile kumhana. Mihu ghako pailola maha ng'ogha, na higha ghako kangi utevile kulwisa. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ujilole umweni ili mhana wa mghati mwa wenga ukotoho kuhyuka kuvile lwisa. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Hinu, ikiva higha gha wenga wogha uvile na mhana, na ukotoho kuvile na mahala popose pavile na lwisa, higha hau uteng'ala maha handa vila limbamba kwa mhana ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwang'ung'ulikila Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghililo lya Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliku 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu paawelili akilonga, Mfalisayo mmonga akamluwa kwa kumulyo ukaya ghaki. Na Yesu akayenda, akatama kulyegha mulyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Hayu Mfalisayo alikangasili kulola yiwa Yesu angulyegha mulyo kunu kaghulula ng'ogha mawoko handa waigholili weni machuwa hyogha. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Bambu akamlongela, “Mwenga Mafalisayo mngughulula kikombi na sahani kwa panji, ila mwenga mghati mmema makalaghanyiko na mahakata.” <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Wasihisihi mwenga. Ghuli, mmanya ng'ogha Sapanga agholili panji ndiwa kaghola na mghati hilahila? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Hinu muwapeghi wavile na hindu ng'ogha na ikiva mghola nagha kila kindu mkighola kitemhekelesa Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Chondi kwa mwenga, mwenga Mafalisayo. Mngumtolela zaka Sapanga hata kwa mahamba gha kuungila mulyo, mahamba gha ngundi na malikolu hyogha kangi mnguwalongela wandu uhwangi ila mngupughanya mighalu ipalwa na Sapanga. Mighalu hai mpalilwi muigholi na hata kukotoho kuyaleka ghala ghangi hilahila.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Chondi mwenga Mafalisayo, kwa ikiva mngupala kutama kuulongolo mahala kwa kutundamilwa kumaghuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi, na kujambuswa kwa kutundamilwa kuulongolo gha wandu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Chondi mwenga Mafalisayo, kwaikiva mvile handa mamambi yavile ng'ogha na kilangihi kuvile lipala, wandu hutyanga kunani ghaki wakiva wamanya ng'ogha kya mghati.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mmonga paghati gha wavula wa laghililo lya Musa akamlongela, “Mvula, milando ghako ingutupughanya na twenga hilahila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Na mwenga wavula wa laghililo lya Musa, chondi mwenga, kwaikiva mnguwapapisa wandu mihigu iwesilwi ng'ogha kupapwa, ikiva mwenga weni mlangihi ng'ogha hata kyala kuwatanga.” <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Chondi mwenga, kwaikiva mnguchenga mamambi gha walota wa Sapanga wa Sapanga wala wagogolo wa mwenga wawakomili. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwa nagha mwenga weni, ni walangihi na munguyitikilana na mighalu gha wagogolo wa mwenga. Kwaikiva wala wawakomili wala walota wa Sapanga, na mwenga mnguwalongela wandu kwa kujumila kila wagholili. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kwa nagha, Sapanga ailongile kwa luhala ghaki, “Nitewayeghela walota wa Sapanga na wandumindumi, ila watewakoma wamonga gha weni, na kuwahakili ghangi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Hinu kiwelekwa haki kitetoswa kwa ikiva gha mwahi gha walota wa Sapanga wogha wakomilwi kuhuma kumtumbula wa mlima wogha. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Kuhuma kujita kwa mwahi gha Abeli mbaka kwa Zakalia avile wamkomili paghati gha kihanja na Lighuta lya Sapanga. Hina, chakaka kiwelekwa haki kitetoswa kwa matendu ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Chondi kwa mwenga mweni wavula wa laghililo, kwaikiva mhighili hula ufunguu wa mlyango wa kumanya lilando lya Sapanga, mwenga weni myingila ng'ogha na muwakanila wawelili wakiyingila wakotoho kuyingila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Paawelili akihuka pala, wala Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghililo watumbulili kumkingama kwa lilaka na kumbabanika na kumkonya milando itangala, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />wakilindila kumtegha ili aghomeli kwa milando ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akalipila milando gha mbindingu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayu 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Lipindi wandu watangala nesu pawawelili walikungulili hata watimbanganili, Yesu akatumbula kuwalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Mjilole na simika gha Mafalisayo, twenga tukema umbindingu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kyokyose kigubikilwi kitegubutuliwa, kila kihighilwi kiteghalambuliwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwa nagha milando hyogha muitangasile kulwisa wandu watehyoghanila pamuhi mhana. Hilahila milando hyogha muipepwa mghati mwa kyumba na milyango itatilwi, yatelongelwa kunani gha lighuta.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yula mungupalwa kumtila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayu 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ninguwalongela mwenga waghanja ghangu, Mkotoho kuwatila wala wakoma higha, wawesang'ogha kughola kindu ghangi kangi wakomela baha hela.” <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nitewalangiha yula avile mngupalwa kuwela na holu kwa mweni, Mumtili yula avile badili gha kukoma kana ulongosi wa kumdanga mundu kulyoto lya kumambi. Hina, ninguwalongela mumtili hayu.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Ingumanyika mbongu wawakema Shomolo waitano wanung'una, wanguhemelwa kwa mapesa mayaghani ikumi hela au ng'ogha? Ila kuulongolo kwa Sapanga hamuisemwi hata mmonga wa weni.” <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Kangi hata hwila gha mutu wa mwenga uvalangilwi wogha. Mkotoho kuwela na holu, hinu mwenga mngupalwa nesu kupiti shomolo watangala.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumkwinila au kumkanila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayu 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Ninguwalongela unagha, kila mundu anikwinila kuulongolo gha wandu, Mwana wa Mundu na mweni atelongela kuulongolo gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga yiwa mundu hayu ni mvulwa ghangu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ila mundu yeyose anikanili kuulongolo gha wandu, na mweni Mwana wa Mundu atemkanila kuulongolo gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Yeyose angulongela lilando lya kumkingama Mwana wa Mundu atemlekesela mahakata, ila yula amlighu Mpumulo wa Sapanga hayu Sapanga atemlekesela ng'ogha mahakata.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Lipindi pawawakola na kuwayegha mwenga kuutoso kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi kuulongolo gha walongosa na gha wakulu, mkotoho kuwela na holu kwa milando mtelitetela au ghala mteyanga, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />kwaikiva Mpumulo wa Sapanga lipindi hali atewavula milando mngupalwa kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mundu avile na hindu msihisihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Hinu mundu mmonga kulila lipinga lya wandu akamlongela, “Mvula, umlongele mlongo ghangu tupeghani kila mmonga na ghaki ulihi atulekesilili tati.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Ghanja ni ghani anivikili nenga kuwoneka mtosa au mpatanisi wa kuwapegha wogha paghati mwa mwenga?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kangi Yesu akawalongela wandu wogha, “Mulole, mjikingami na lumatamata lwogha lwa hindu kwa ukomu, kwaikiva hindu iwesa ng'ogha kugholokela ukomu wa mundu, hata akavile kana hindu nesu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kuulongolo akawalongela mulandano hau, “Kuwelili na mundu mmonga mnahisa hayu litawa lyaki liwesa kulela mabeno yatangala. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Mundu yula awelili na hindu akaliwachila mumoyu ghaki, ‘Niteghola kyani na nenga nahela mahala ghangi pakuvika mabeno ghangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Akajilongela, ‘Niteghola nagha,’ ‘Nitebomola ngoko ghangu na kuchenga ngulu nesu, na nenga nitevika mula ngano ghangu hyogha na hindu ghangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Hinu nitewesa kuilongela mpumulo ghangu, ‘Hinaa uvile na mabeno yatangala na uvile na ngoko itangala. Hinaa utami nuu, na upumulili na kunywegha na kuhekelela.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ila Sapanga akamlongela, ‘Msihisihi wenga, lelu lelu uhiku mpumulo. Na hinaa, vindu havi vyogha ujitengelili vitewele vya ghani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu akamalila kwa kulonga, “havi ndiwa itewela kwa yula mundu ajivikila hindu ngoo ila kavika ng'ogha hindu kwa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumlindila Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayu 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, kwaikiva gha hai ninguwalongela, “Mkotoho kuwela na holu kwa mulyo muupala ili mbati kulama, hata nguu mzipala kwaikiva gha higha gha mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwaikiva kulama ni maha kupiti mulyo, na higha ni maha kupiti nguu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mtole kumlandano wa kughulu, wangutulila ng'ogha na wangubena ng'ogha na hata wavile ng'ogha na ngoko yoyose. Hata nagha , Sapanga huwapegha mulyo. Na mwenga mngupalwa nesu kupiti wambongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ni ghani paghati mwa mwenga anguwesa kuyongesa mayaghani utali wa ukomu wa ghaki? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Hinu, ikiva muwesa ng'ogha kughola mghalu msokombi handa hau, kwa kyani kuvile na holu kwa ghala ghangi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mlole ulua vila ungumela. Ughola ng'ogha lihengu kupokela msahala na kupota ng'ogha nguu kwa kuvala. Ila ninguwalongela, hata Selemani mweni na ukulu ghaki wogha apatili ng'ogha kuvikwa maheli handa limonga lya hau ulua wa mlitawa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Hinu ikiva, Sapanga hulivika nagha lihamba lya mlitawa lila lelo lya baha na kilau hudangilwa kulyoto, ghuli, atewavika ng'ogha maheli nesu mwenga mvile na kukwinila kusokombi msokombi?<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Hinu, mkotoho kughasika yiwa mtelyegha kyani au mtenywegha kyani mkotoho kuvile na holu kwa hagha. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kwaikiva wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi wangughasikila hagha kumlima wogha. Ila Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba angumanya yiwa mngupala vindu havi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Hinaa mngupalwa mtumbuli kughasikila Unkosi wa Sapanga, na hagha hyogha mtepeghwa kwa nyongesa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu gha kundumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayu 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Mkotoho kuwela na holu, mwenga lipinga mayangani. Kwaikiva Tati wa mwenga wa kundumba kapala kuwapegha Unkosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Muwusi hindu gha mwenga mkawapeghi wandu wakapuku hagha mapesa. Mjigholeli mihaku ihakala ng'ogha haku ndiwa kuvika ngoko kundumba, na haku itewesa ng'ogha kupungula. Kangi haku mwihi awesa ng'ogha kuhikila, hata nondo kuyalamisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kula mnguvika ngoko ghako ndiwa na moyu ghako utelikala.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumikila walikali mihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Mliyandali kunitumikila na malimbamba gha mwenga yayaki. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Mvile handa watumikila wangumlindila bambu wa weni ahuyi kuhuma kumhambu wa uposo, ili wamuwoposeleli mlyango pakatova mlyango. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Wahighilwa wala watumikila wavile mkulu ghao paahika atewalola walikala mihu. Ninguwalongela chakaka, hayu bambu ateliyandala, na kuwakema kulihinda na kuwapegha mulyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Hata ikiva bambu hayu atehuya uhiku wa mandandu au malawila pee na kuwalola wangugholokela mihu, wahighilwa watumikila hagha. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Mmanyi yiwa ikiva mweni lighuta angalimanya lisaa mwihi atehika, angalikala mihu, na hata kuleka lighuta lyaki libomolwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Hinu na mwenga hilahila mngupalwa mlikali mihu, kwaikiva Mwana wa Mundu atehika lisaa mulimanya ng'ogha.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumikila mlungwana na mtumikila mlungwana ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayu 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petelo akamlongela, “Bambu, mlandano hau ungutulongela twenga weka, au unguwalongela wandu wogha?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Bambu akayanga, “Ni ghani, avile mtumikila mlungwana na avile na luhala, na bambu ghaki atemvika kuwagholokela watumikila ghaki angupalilwa awapeghi mulyo lipindi lya maha?” <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kahighilwa mtumikila yula, avile bambu ghaki paahika atemlola akighola nagha. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, mkulu ghaki atemvika mtumikila hayu avile mgholokela wa hindu ghaki hyogha. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ila ikiva mtumikila hayu akijilongela mmoyu, “Bambu ghangu kalikala lipindi litali kuhuya,” hinu akatumbula kuwatova wayaki, watumikila walumi na watumikila wadala, hilahila angulyegha na kunywegha na kulowela, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />hinu bambu wa mtumikila hayu atehika lichuwa limanyika ng'ogha, na lisaa limanyika ng'ogha. Na mweni atemtova nesu na kumuhakili na kumvika kwa wandu wakotoho kukwinila.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Mtumikila yula avile angumanya nesu kila akipala bambu ghaki, ila kaleka kuliyandala kughola vila apalilwi kughola, atetovwa hyatu nesu.” <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ila mtumikila yula kaghola yala kwa kumanya ng'ogha, atetovwa hyatu mayaghani. Na yoyose apeghilwi kughola lihengu likulunga na mkulu ghaki atepalwa kuhipa vindu ngoo.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulekanisa wandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayu 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Nihika kukosa lyoto kumlima wogha, na nenga luhujulu lwangu ningalilola yiwa uyaka kala. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Na nenga nivile na ubatiso na mahakilo yala ningupalwa kuyapokela na niteyendelela kughasika mmoyu mbaka yatimile. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mnguliwachila nihika kuyegha kuponga kumlima wogha? Ninguwalongela mwenga ng'ogha nagha, nihika kuyegha malekano. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Na hata nagha, kulighuta lya walongo waitano watelekanika, waitatu watengingama na waivili, waivili watengingama na waitatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tati atengingama na mwana ghaki, na mwana atengingama na tati ghaki. Nyongo atengingama na biti ghaki, biti atengingama na nyongo ghaki. Nyongo mkwahanu atengingama na mdala wa mwana ghaki, na mdala yula atengingama na nyongo mkwahano ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kughalambula lipindi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayu 16:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Hilahila Yesu akalilongela kangi lipinga, “Pamlola mahindu yakihuma upandi hula lihongela lijuwa, mngujilongela, ‘Ndonya itetonya,’ na chakaka itetonya.” <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Hilahila pamlola liyegha likiwumba kuhuma upandi wa kusini, mwenga mngulonga, “kutevile na lihuki,” na ndiwa itevile nagha. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwenga wambindingu, mnguwesa kumanya kulongelela lipindi lya mlima wogha na kundumba, ghuli mnguwesa ng'ogha kumanya hagha yahumila hinaa.<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulaghani na mhakata ghako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayu 5:25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Kwa kyani muwesa ng'ogha kutosa mweni lila lya maha? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kwaikiva msitaki ghako angukuyegha kunjengakaya, ni maha uyomoli na mweni hula uhakata munjila, ili akotoho kukuyegha kwa mundu wa kutosa na mweni akakuyegha kwa watovangondo, na weni wakakuvika mlighuta lya wawopwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ninguwalongela uchakaka utewesa ng'ogha kuhuka mula mbaka uhipi ligwala hyogha ungupalwa kuhipa.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mkilema kuleka uhakata mtehova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Lipindi lila pawelili na wandu wamonga wakamlongela Yesu milando vila wandu wa mbwani Galilaya kwa Pilato kuwakoma wandu na mwahi gha wandu hagha ikahanganika na litambiku lya mkihanja pawawelili wakihinja mikokolu gha litambiku. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Na mweni Yesu akawakonya, “Mnguliwachila yiwa hagha Wagalilaya wawelili na sambi kupiti Wagalilaya ghangi, hata kugholwa nagha? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, ng'ogha, mwenga hilahila pamkotoho kulekiselwa sambi, mteyalamika handa weni. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Au mnguliwachila wala wandu ikumi na inane ku Silohamu wahovili pawaguiliwa na lilingo, mnguliwachila wala wawelili wahakata kupiti ghangi wogha walikalili Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ninguwalongela ng'ogha nagha. Na mwenga pamkotoho kulekiselwa uhakata na kumuhyukila Sapanga, mteyalamika handa weni.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa libiki lilela ng'ogha matungula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Hinu, Yesu akawalongela mlandano hau, “mundu mmonga awelili na libiki walikema mtini mulitawa ghaki gha mizabibu. Mundu hayu akayenda akipala kuyapa matungula ghaki, ila alolili ng'ogha litungula hata limonga. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Hinu, akamlongela mghola lihengu ghaki, ‘Uloli. Kwa lipindi lya machuva itatu nivile nikihika kuyapa matungula gha libiki hali lya tini na mbata ng'ogha kindu chochose. Hinaa uudumuli. Kwa kyani uyendeleli kuyalamisa lutupi lya maha hela?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Yula mkulila akamyanga, ‘Bambu, uuleki kangi kwa lichuva limonga kuulongolo, na nenga niteutukutulila mmbali ghaki na kuuvikila mboleya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ikiva utalela matungula lichuva lya ulongolo, ni maha, hinu pautewesa ng'ogha kulela uudumuli.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa nyongo mmonga lichuwa lya Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lichuwa lya kupumulila limonga, Yesu awelili akivula kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Na pala pawelili na mdala awelili na lihoka livile limghola avile mvina wa kughondama mghongu kwa machuva ikumi na inane hata awesili ng'ogha kugholoka dali. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu paamlola, akamkema akamlongela, “Mdala, ulama kala uvina ghako.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Hinu akamvikila mawoko, na lipindi lilalila higha ghaki ukavile dali kangi, akatumbula kumyinula Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ila mkulu wa lighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi ahyomili kwaikiva Yesu awelili kamlamisa yula nyongo lichuwa lya Kupumulila. Hinu yula mkulu akawalongela wala wandu walikungulili pala, “Mvile na machuwa isita gha kughola lihengu, kumachuwa hagha, mhiki mlamiswi ila mkotoho kuhika lichuwa lya Kupumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Pala Bambu akamyanga, “Mwenga wambindingu yiwa wandu wa maha. Ila ng'ogha. Ni ghani paghati mwa mwenga kaleka kumuwoposola ng'ombi ghaki au punda ghaki kuhuma mlihungulu akamyegha kumpegha masi lichuwa lya Kupumulila? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Hinaa, baha tuvile na mhelekwa wa Ibulahimu hayu Lihyukana limgholili kibyongo kwa lipindi lya machuva ikumi na inane. Ghuli, ni maha ng'ogha kuwoposolewa biti hayu kuhuma kukiwopa haki lichuwa lya Kupumulila?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yesu paalongili ghala, wahakata ghaki wakalihola honi, ila wandu wahekelelili kwaikiva gha mighalu gha kukangasa agholili.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mbeyu isokombi waikema haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayu 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliku 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu akakonya, “Unkosi wa Sapanga ungulandana na kyani? Niteulandanisa na kyani? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ulandana na mbunji isokombi nesu waikema haladali, ivile mundu aitolili na kuitulila kulitawa lyaki. Nayeni ikamela na kukula, ikavile libiki na mbongo wa kundumba wakachenga vijaka kumiputila ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa simika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayu 13:33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu akakonya kangi, “Niteulandanisa Unkosi wa Sapanga na kyani? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ni handa simika aitolili nyongo mmonga na kuihanganisa pamonga na madebi maitatu gha ukowa na ukowa wogha ukatutumuka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlyango ukombala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayu 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu akaphita kumbwani na vimbwani akivula paawelili kumwanja ghaki kuyenda Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mundu mmonga akamkonya, “Bambu ghuli, ni wandu wa mayaghani hela watelamiswa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesu akawalongela, “Myangalayi kuyingila kwa kupitila mlyango ukombala, kwaikiva, ninguwalongela, wandu watangala wateyesa kuyingila ila watewesa ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Lipindi litehika mwenikaya ateyinuka na kuwopa mlyango. Mwenga mtegholoka panji na kutumbula kutova mlyango mkilonga, ‘Bambu, utuwoposeleli mlyango,’ ila mweni atewayanga, ‘Nimanya ng'ogha mhuma kugha.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Na mwenga mtetumbula kumlongela, ‘Twenga ndiwa wala tulyeghili na kunywegha pamonga na wenga, kangi wenga utuvulili twenga kuvimbwani vya twenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ila mweni atewayanga, ‘Niwamanya ng'ogha mwenga hilahila mhuma kugha. Muhuki kwa nenga mwenga waghola mahakata.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Baha ndiwa mtelila na kuhyagha malino, lipindi mtewalola Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobu na walota wa Sapanga wogha walikala ku Unkosi wa Sapanga, ila mwenga baha mdangiliwi panji. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Wandu watehika kuhuma mbandi zyogha inne zya mlima wogha, mashaliki na maghalibi na kusini na kasikazini na weni watelikala kumahala weni wayandalililwi mhambu ku Unkosi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Hina, ulole wala wa mwihu watevile wa mtumbulo, na wala wa mtumbula watevile wa mwihu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalilila wandu wa mbwani Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayu 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Lipindi lilalila wamonga gha Mafalisayo wakamuyendela Yesu na kumlongela, “Uhuki baha uyendi mahala ghangi kwaikiva Helode angupala kukukoma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu akawayanga, “Myendi mkamlongeli yula mbweha, ninguwawinga mahoka na kulamisa wavina lelo na kilau, na nenga lichuwa lya itatu niteyomola lihengu lyangu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Hata nagha, kwa lelo na kilau na kilau ghangi, ningupalwa niyendeleli na mwanja, kwa ikiva maha ng'ogha mlota wa Sapanga ahovi panji gha Yelusalemu ila mghati mwa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Mwenga wandu wa Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu. Mnguwakoma walota wa Sapanga na kuwatova maganga wala walaghililwi kwa mwenga na Sapanga. Nihikili kwa mwenga lihanja kwa lihanja nikipala kuwakungula wana ghako pamonga handa nguku angukungula wana nguku pahi gha mbapatilo ghaki ili awagholokeli, ila wenga ukalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ulole lighuta lya Sapanga wa mwenga, hinaa ninguyenda, ninguwalongela mtenilola ng'ogha kangi mbaka lipindi lila mtelonga, ‘Kahighiliwa yula ayeghilwi na kupeghwa ulongosi na Bambu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu mmonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lichuwa lya Kupumulila, Yesu ayendili kulyegha mulyo ukaya kwa mmonga wa wakulu wa Mafalisayo, na wandu watamili pala wayesili kumlolesa kwa pabehi ili walole kila ateghola. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Bahala, kuulongolo ghaki Yesu kuwelili na mundu mmonga awelili na uvina wa kututumuka higha. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu akawakonya wavula wa laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa na Mafalisayo, “Ghuli, malaghililo yangutulekesela kulamisa wandu lichuwa lya Kupumulila au ng'ogha?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ila weni wakalikala nuu. Hinu Yesu akamkola liwoko yula mvina na kumlamisa, akamlekesela ahuki ukaya ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Hinu Yesu akawakonya, “Ni ghani paghati gha mwenga ikiva mwana ghaki na vilavila ng'ombi ghaki akidubukila mlyohu, atemuhumisa ng'ogha ikiva ni lichuwa lya Kupumulila?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Na wandu hao wawesa ng'ogha kumyanga lilando.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa utundamilu na kuwapokela wahenja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu paalolili vila wala wahenja wapokelilwi wanguhaghula mahala pautundamilu lipindi lya kulyegha, akawalongela mlandano hau. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Ikiva mundu akikukema kumhambu, ukotoho kutama mahala pautundamilu, kwaikiva iwesekana kapokelwa mundu ghangi mkulu apiti wenga. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ikiva akaghola nagha yula mwenekaya wa mwenga waivili atehika na kukulongela, ‘Umlekeli hayu haku.’ Hinu bahala utelihola kuulongolo gha wandu wogha na kupalwa uyendi kutola mahala pakuyetu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Badili ghaki, paupokelwa kumhambu, utami mahala pakuyetu, ili yula mwenekaya wa wenga paakulola atehika na kukulongela, ‘Ghanja ghangu, uhiki haku kuulongolo pautundamilu nesu.’ Kwa nagha utevile upokela utundamilu kuulongolo gha wahenja wayako wogha. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwaikiva yula ajigholili mkulu ateghuluswa na mundu yula ajigholili mnung'una ategholwa kuvile mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Hinu Yesu akamlongela yula awakemili, “Pauyandala mhambu wa mulyo wa pamuhi na wa lumihi, ukotoho kuwapokela waghanja ghako hilahila walongo ghako wa pabehi au wavile na hindu ngoo hela, paughola nagha naweni wanguwesa kukupokela kumhambu kwa weni, na wenga ukahipwa kila ukigholili. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Badili ghaki, pauyandala mhambu, uwapokeli wandu wavile na hindu ng'ogha au walemafu au wangali maghulu au mawoko na wangali mihu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />na wenga utehighiliwa, kwaikiva hagha wawesa ng'ogha na kya kukuhipa. Hinu Sapanga atekupegha hupo ghako lipindi wandu wa maha watehinduka.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mhambu mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayu 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Mmonga paghati gha wala wawelili pamonga na Yesu akalonga, “Kahighiliwa mundu yula atelyegha mulyo kumhambu wa Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu akamyanga, “Mundu mmonga agholili mhambu mkulu, akawakema wandu watangala.” <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Lipindi lya mhambu palihika akamlaghila mtumikila ghaki akawalongele wala wandu wawapokelili, “Mhiki kwaikiva kila kindu kiyandalilwi kala.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ila wogha, kila mmonga, akatumbula kuluwa yiwa kana lihengu ili awesi kuhuka. Wa mtumbula akalonga, “Nihemelili litawa, hinu ningupalwa niyendi kuilolela, pepahi unilekiseli.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Mundu ghangi akalonga, “Nihemela mapinga maitano gha ng'ombi wa kutukutulila hinaa ninguyenda kuwayesa, nakuluwa pepahi unilekiseli.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Na ghangi akalonga, “Nihuma kuposa machuwa hagha, hinu nitewesa ng'ogha kuhika.”<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Mtumikila yula akahuya na kumlongela bambu ghaki mghalu hula. Yula mwenikaya akahyoma, na kumlongela mtumikila ghaki, “Uyendi kwa kuloposela kunjila zya mmbwani na mmbekumbeku gha vimbwani, uwayeghi wandu wakapuku, walemafu na wangali mihu pamonga na wangali maghulu.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Yula mtumikila akahuya na kulonga, “Bambu, yala unilaghilili niyaghola kala, ila pambila kumema.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yula bambu akamlongela mtumikila ghaki, “Uyendi kunjila gha panji gha mmbwani na mmbekumbeku uwagholi wandu wayingile ili lyugha lya nenga limemi.” <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Hinu ninguwalongela, kwahela hata mmonga wa wala wapokelilwi atewesa kulyegha mhambu wa nenga hata mayaghani.<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maghaso paumkovekela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayu 10:37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lipinga likulunga lya wandu liwelili na mwanja pamonga na Yesu, na mweni akawaghalambukila, akawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />mundu yeyose ahika kwa nenga awesa ng'ogha kuvile mvulwa wa nenga ikiva anipala ng'ogha nenga kupiti tati ghaki na nyongo ghaki, mhumbu ghaki na wana, walongo ghaki na wahaja ghaki, hata kulama kwaki mweni. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Yeyose katola ng'ogha lipingika ghaki na kunikovekela atewesa ng'ogha kuvile mvulwa wa nenga.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Kwa nagha ni ghani paghati mwa mwenga avile paapala kuchenga lilingo, kalikala ng'ogha pahi na kuvalanga vingupalwa niki na niki ili aloli yiwa mapesa ghaki yanguwesa kuyomola lihengu?” <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ikiva utewesa ng'ogha kughola nagha, unguwesa kutumbula kikalilo, ila ukasindwa kuyomola lighuta. Pausindilwi kuyomola, kila mundu atekuheka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Wakilonga, “Mundu hayu atumbulili kuchenga, ila kawesa ng'ogha kuyomola.”<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Au, ni nkosi ghani anguwesa kuyenda kutovana na nkosi ghangi, kalikala pahi ng'ogha kuliwachila yiwa atewesa, kwa uweso wa watovangondu ghaki ielufu ikumi, kulitova na yula ahika na watovangondu ielufu ishilini?” <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ikiva atelola anguwesa ng'ogha kutovana, hinu lipindi yula nkosi ghangi akiva ambila kutali, mweni ateyegha laghililo kwa kutumila watumikila ghaki wayendi kwa yula nkosi na kumluwa wagholi malongelano gha kuponga. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Vilavila, yeyose paghati mwa mwenga akiva kawesa ng'ogha kuleka vyogha avikolili, anguwesa ng'ogha kuvile mvulwa wa nenga.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyu wa maha ng'ogha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayu 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliku 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Munyu wa maha, ila pauyalamisa umunyu ghaki, kwahela njila gha kuighola ivile munyu kangi. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Yamaha ng'ogha kwa lutupi hata kwa mbolea, hinu hudangwa hela. Yula avile na mapulukilo gha kuhyoghanila na ahyoghanili.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa kondolu ayaghamilili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayu 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lichuwa limonga, watola usulu na wavile na sambi watangala wayendili kumuhyoghanila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mafalisayo na wavula wa laghilo lya Musa wakatumbula kung'ung'ulika, “Mumloli mundu hayu. Anguwapokela wavile na sambi na kangi angulyegha pamonga na weni.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ndiwa Yesu akawayanga kwa mlandano hau.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ikiva mmonga paghati mwa mwenga kana kondolu imia na mweni akayalamisa mmonga wa weni, ateghola kyani? Ni chakaka atewaleka wala itisini na itisa kumanyahi, na kuyenda kumuhakula yula ayaghamilili.” <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Na mweni paampatili kala, atempapa kukitivi ghaki kwa luheku. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Paahika ukaya, atewakonya waghanja ghaki na kuwalongela, “Mhekeleli pamonga na nenga, kwaikiva nimpatili yula kondolu ghangu ayaghamilili.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ninguwalongela hilahila, kutevile na luheku nesu kundumba kwaikiva gha kulekiselwa sambi yula mhakata mmonga, kupiti kwa wavile na sambi itisini na itisa wala wangujilola yiwa wa maha na wangupalwa ng'ogha kulekeselwa sambi na kumhyukila Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gwala liyaghamilili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesu akawalongela mlandano ngangi akalonga, “Au tulongi kuvile na mdala kana ligwala lya sendi ikumi, na mweni akaiyaghamila imonga, ghuli, anguwesa ng'ogha kukosa limbamba na kupyaghila lighuta ili kuihakula nesu mbaka aipati? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na mweni paaipatili kala, atewakema waghanja ghaki na wandu wa pabehi ghaki kuwalongela, ‘Mhekeleli pamonga na nenga, nilipatili lila ligwala ghangu gha sendi liyaghamilili.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Hilahila, ninguwalongela, havi ndiwa watewela na luheku watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga kwaikiva gha mundu avile na sambi mmonga kalekiselwa sambi na kumhyukila Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa mwana ayaghamilili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Kuwelili na mundu mmonga awelili na wana waivili walumi.” <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yula msokombi akamlongela tati ghaki, “Tati, unipeghi lipinga ghangu lya hindu ghangu.” Hinu akawapegha wana ghaki hindu ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Kuulongolo mayaghani, yula msokombi akakungula na kuwusa hindu ghaki hinu akatumbula mwanja na mapesa apokelili, akayenda kulama kumlima wa kutali na haku akatumila mapesa ghaki kwa kuyananga. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Kuulongolo paayomola kutumila kila kindu ghaki, njala ngulu ikahumila kumlima hula na mweni akavile kahela chochose. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Hinu akayenda kuluwa lihengu kwa mwenekaya mmonga wa mlima hula, na mwenekaya yula akamyegha kulitawa lyaki kughola lihengu lya kuwapegha mulyo ghuluwi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Kwaikiva Mhongolo yula awelili na njala nesu, hinu akawela na lumatamata lwa kulyegha ghala mahamba gha matungula walyeghili wala ghuluwi, ila kuwelili ng'ogha mundu wa kumpegha chochose. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Hinu kuulongolo akatumbula kuliwachila mweni na kujilongelela, “Waghola lihengu wa tati ghangu wangulyegha mulyo utangala mbaka wanguleka yasyehilili ila nenga baha ninguhova na njala?” <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nitehuya kwa tati ghangu na kumlongela, “Tati, nighola uhakata kwa kundumba na ngosa kwa wenga.” <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />“Nikotoho kukemwa mwana ghako kangi. Unigholi handa mmonga wa waghola lihengu ghako.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Hinu, akatumbula mwanja wa kuhuya kwa tati ghaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Paawelili ambila kutali, tati ghaki amlolili, na kumwonela moyu wa luhungu akambhutukila, akamkusukila kwa upalo. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Yula mwana akamlongela tati ghaki, ‘Tati, nighola uhakata kwa kundumba na ngosa kwa wenga.’ Nikotoho kukemwa mwana ghako kangi.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ila tati ghaki akawalongela watumikila, “Kwa kuloposela myeghi lihabiti livile maha nesu, na mumviki pete mukyala ghaki na hilatu mumaghulu ghaki.” <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mumuhinjili ng'ombi msokombi avile na mahuta, tulyeghi na tuhekeleli. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwaikiva awelili handa kahova na hinaa kamkomu kangi, na “Iwachililwi kayaghamila na hinaa kawoneka.” Hinu wakatumbula mhambu pamonga.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Lipindi lila, yula mwana mkulunga awelili kulitawa. Paasoghelela pabehi na lighuta, akahyoghanila lilohi lya wandu lya uyimbo na wandu wakidinga. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Akamkema mmonga wa watumikila na kumkonya, “kuvile na kyani?” <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Hayu mtumikila akamyanga, “Mlongo ghako kahuya ukaya, na tati ghako kamhinjila ng'ombi msokombi mweni mahuta kwaikiva kahuya akiva maha na mkomu.”<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Yula mwana mkulunga akahyoma, akalema kuyingila mghati. Hinu tati ghaki akahuma panji na kumluwa nesu ayingili. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ila mweni akamuyanga, ‘Ukumbwike, machuwa ngenju nikutumikila, nitenyula ng'ogha hata laghililo ghako limonga. Unipeghili kyani? Unipegha ng'ogha hata kambuhi kamonga nikahinji nikagholi mhambu na waghanja ghangu. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ila mwana ghako hayu alyeghili hindu ghako pamonga na waghola ngongola, paahuya ukaya wenga ukamhinjila yula ng'ombi msokombi mweni mahuta.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tati ghaki akamuyanga, ‘Mwana ghangu, wenga uvile pamonga na nenga machuwa hyogha, na vyogha vya ukaya ni vya wenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />‘Ila ipalilwi tuhekeleli na kuheka kwaikiva hayu mfwata ghako awelili kawachilwa kahova na hinaa kamkomu, na iwachiliwi kayaghamila na hinaa angulama.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mgholokela mkalamuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu awalongelili wavulwa ghaki, “Pawelili na mundu avile na hindu na mgholokela ghaki. Hayu avile na hindu akalongelwa yiwa hayu mgholokela ghako awelili akitumila kwa kuyananga hindu ghako.” <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Hinu hayu mundu mnaisa akamkema na kumkonya, “Ni mighalu ghani hai nihyoghanila wangulongelela kwa wenga? Unipeghi mavalangilo gha mapokelo na matumilo gha hindu ghangu, kwaikiva uwesa ng'ogha kuyendelela kuvile mgholokela ghangu kangi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yula mgholokela akajiwachila mmoyu ghaki, “Niteghola kyani hinaa? Bambu ghangu anguniwinga kulihengu lya nenga, nenga nahela makakala gha kutukutula na nenga ningulola honi kuluwaluwa.” <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Hinaa, ningumanya lila nitelighola, ili paniwingwa lihengu, “Wandu wawese kunipokela kuukaya ghao handa mgholokela.”<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Hinu yula mgholokela, akawakema wala wapalwa kuhipa kwa mkulu ghaki, mmonga mmonga, akamlongela yula wa mtumbula, “Ungupalwa kuhipa mapesa yinga kwa bambu wa nenga?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />“Na mweni akayanga, ‘Mipipa imia gha mahuta gha libiki lya zaituni.’ Yula mgholokela akamlongela, ‘Utoli likalatasi lyako’ na ughalambuli uyandiki ihamsini.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Hinu akamkonya wa ivili, “Wenga ungupalwa kuhipa ninga?” Mweni akamyanga, “Magunila imia gha ngano.” Yula mgholokela akamlongela, “Utoli likalatasi lyako uyandiki isemanini.”<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Ndiwa yula bambu akamuyinula yula mgholokela mhakata kwa vila aigholili kwa luhala. Kwaikiva wandu wamwinula ng'ogha Sapanga wa mlima wogha hau wangughola lihengu lyao kwa luhala kupiti wandu wamkwinila Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela, wandu ughola uhakata ili kupokela mapesa, “Muwatangi maghanja kwa hindu gha mlima wogha, ili paiyomoleka, mpati kupokelwa kumahala gha machuwa hyogha bila mwihu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Yeyose avile apalili kuwela mundu mchakaka kumighalu misokombi, hayu atewela mundu mchakaka kumighalu mikulunga, na yula avile apalili ng'ogha kuwela mundu mchakaka ng'ogha kumighalu misokombi kangi avile atewela ng'ogha kuwela mchakaka kumighalu mikulunga. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ikiva mwenga, pamgholokela hindu muwela ng'ogha na kukwinila na unagha kwa vindu Sapanga awapeghili mumlima wogha hau, Hinu, mtewela ng'ogha wachakaka kumighalu mikulunga gha unagha? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Na mwenga ikiva mvile ng'ogha wandu wa maha pamgholokela hindu gha mundu ghangi, hinu ni ghani atewakwinila hindu mgholokeli mweni?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Kwahela mtumikila anguwesa kutumikila bambu waivili. Kwaikiva atempala mmonga na yula ghangi atemhyomela. Mtewesa ng'ogha kumtumikila Sapanga pamonga na hindu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo wekaweka gha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayu 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliku 10:11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mafalisayo wahyoghanilili ghala hyogha wakatumbula kumuheka na kumpughanya kwaikiva weni ni wapala mapesa. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenga mngujighola yiwa wandu wa maha kuulongolo gha wandu, ila Sapanga angumanya mioyu gha mwenga. Kwaikiva vila vindu vivile vinguwoneka vya utundamilu kwa wandu, vingumghola Sapanga ahyomi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Malaghililo gha Bambu ampeghili Musa na mayandiko gha walota wa Sapanga yatumililwi kuwalongosa mbaka kuhika kwa Yohana Mbatisa. Kuhuma lipindi hali Habali Maha lya Unkosi wa Sapanga ingutangaswa na kila mmonga wangulongelwa kwa njila wekaweka wayingili. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ila inguwesekana kundumba na mlima wogha kuhuka ila iwesekana ng'ogha kupungula elufi kuhuma kumayandiko gha laghililo lya bambu ampeghili Musa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Mundu yeyose apala kumpegha mdala ghaki mayandiko gha kumleka na kumposa mdala ghangi angughola ngongola, na mlumi amposayi mdala alekilwi na mlumi ghangi angughola ngongola.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu avile na hindu na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesu akayendelela kulonga, “Pawelili na mundu mmonga awelili na hindu na avalili nguu zya zambalau na mbulete pee, hayu awelili kalikala kwa kujihekelesa mweni kila lelo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Hilahila kumlyango ghaki alikalili mundu avile na hindu ng'ogha lihina lyaki Lazalo awelili akiyeghwa pala, mundu avile na vilonda higha wogha. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Yula Lazalo awelili akiliwachila kulyegha na kuyukwite kwa mulyo usyeghilili udangilwi kuhuma kwa yula mundu mnaisa. Hata waghalu wahikili na kumhyanga vilonda ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Lipindi likahika yula mundu avile na hindu ng'ogha akahova, na watumikila wa kundumba wa sapanga wakamtola alikali pamonga na Ibulahimu. Hilahila yula mundu naisa akahova na akasikwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Na yula mundu awelili mnaisa paawelili akihakilwa na maghaso kula mlima wa wandu wahovili, akalola kundumba, akamlola Ibulahimu kwa utali, na mweni Lazalo awelili pabehi na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Hinu yula mundu avile mnaisa akamkema, “Tati Ibulahimu, uniwoneli luhungu na umlaghili Lazalo ataviki kyala kyaki mghati mwamasi yapongi lulimi ghangu, kwaikiva ninguhakilwa nesu kulyoto hali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ila Ibulahimu akamyanga, “Mwanaghangu, ukumbwike yiwa lipindi uwelili ukomili upokelili mighalu gha maha nesu, ila Lazalo apokelili mighalu ihakata. Ila hinaa anguhekeleswa baha na wenga ungulikoma kumaghaso.” <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Pamonga na hagha, “Kuvile na lyohu likulunga nesu paghati gha twenga na mwenga. Hinu wala wavile haku wawesa ng'ogha kuhika kula kwa mwenga, na wala wavile kula wawesa ng'ogha kuhubuka kuhika haku kwa twenga.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Kuulongolo mundu avile na hindu ngoo akalonga, “Ikiva nagha, tati Ibulahimu, ningukuluwa umlaghili Lazalo ayendi ukaya kwa tati ghangu,” <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />“kwaikiva nivile na walongo waitano, ayendi akawalemese wakotoho likala kwa kughola mahakata wakayingila mahala haku pavile na mahakili nesu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ila Ibulahimu akamuyanga, “Walongo ghako wavile na laghililo lya Musa na walota wa Sapanga, wawahyoghanili hagha wogha.” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Yula mundu avile na hindu ngoo akalonga, “Ng'ogha nagha, tati Ibulahimu, ila mundu paahinduka kuhuma mlima wa wandu wahovili na kuwayendela watelekisela mahakata na kumhyukila Sapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />“Na mweni Ibulahimu akamlongela, ‘Ikiva watekovekela ng'ogha mayandiko gha Musa na walota wa Sapanga, watewesa ng'ogha kughola kyokyose hata ikiva kahinduka mundu kuhuma kumlima wa wandu wahovili.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Makanilo kwa uhakata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayu 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">18:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maliku 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Lichuwa limonga Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Mighalu imghola mundu kughola uhakata yabaha machuwa hyogha. Ila chondi mundu yula amgholayi mundu agholi uhakata. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Mbaha mundu hayu awopwe liganga litopehu lya kusyaghila kuntandala na kudangwa mmasi gha bahali kupiti kumghola mmonga gha wandu wangunikovekela agholi uhakata. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Hinu nagha, chondi! Ikiva mlongo ghako kakugholela mahakata,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">umkalipile na alekisela uhakata na kukuhyukila, umlekeseli. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ikiva mundu akikugholela uhakata mihanja isaba kwa lichuwa limonga na mihanja isaba akahika kwa wenga akalonga, ‘Nilekiseli,’ umlekeseli.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo gha ukwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Hinu, wandumindumi ghaki wakamlongela Bambu, “Utuyongeseli kukwinila.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Bambu akawayanga, “Ikiva mvile na kukwinila kusokombi handa mbunji gha haladali, mngewesa kuulongela mbiki hau wa mkuyu, ‘Utupuki ukameli mbahali,’ na weni ungawayitikila.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya mtumikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Ikiva mmonga paghati mwa mwenga kana mtumikila angutukutula kulitawa au anguhunga kondolu, ghuli, mkulu hayu atemlongela mtumikila paahika, ‘Uhiki baha utami ulyeghi mulyo?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ng'ogha nagha, atemlongela, ‘Unitumikilile kwa kuniyandalile mulyo nilyeghi, vala vila ingupalwa uvali ugholoki, mbaka niteyomola kulyegha na kunywegha ndiwa na wenga ulyeghi na kunywegha.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ghuli mundu hayu atemshukwile mtumikila hayu kwaikiva gha kughola yala amlaghilili? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Hilahila kwa mwenga. Lipindi pamyomola kughola hyogha mlaghililwi, mlonge, ‘Twenga tuwatumikila hela, tughola kila tupalwa kughola.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalamisa wakalawa ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu paawelili mnjila akiyenda Yelusalemu, apitilili paghati gha Samalia na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Paawelili akiyingila kukimbwani kimonga, wandu waikumi wavile na ukalawa wakonganilile na mweni, wakagholoka kwa utali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Wakatova lilowi wakilonga, “Yesu, Bambu, tuwoneli luhungu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Paawalolili akawalongela, “Myendi kwa watambika mkajilangihi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Hinu ikava pawawelili wakiyenda wakalamiswa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Mmonga paghati gha weni paalolili yiwa kalamiswa kala, akahuya kwa Yesu akimyinula Sapanga kwa lilowi likulunga nesu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Akajidanga pahi kuulongolo kumaghulu gha Yesu akamshukwile. Na mundu hayu awelili kahuma ku Samalia, <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu akakonya, “Wandu walamisilwi wawelili ikumi ng'ogha? Hinu wala itisa wakugha? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ghuli kwahela mundu ghangi kawesa kuhuya na kumshukwile Sapanga ila hayu mhenja weka yaki?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Hinu akamlongela hayu mundu, “Ugholoki, uyendi zyako, kukwinila ghako kukulamisa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Unkosi wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayu 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Lipindi limonga, Mafalisayo wamkonyili Yesu, “Unkosi wa Sapanga utehika ligha?” Na mweni akawayanga, “Unkosi wa Sapanga utehika ng'ogha kwa kuloleka handa kindu kinguloleka kwa mihu. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kwahela mundu atewesa kulonga, ‘Wa baha’ au ‘Wa pala,’ Kwaikiva Unkosi wa Sapanga upaghati mwa mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki, “Lipindi linguhika mtepala kulola limonga lya lichuwa lya Mwana wa Mundu, ila mteilola ng'ogha.” <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Wandu watewalongela, “Yula pala”. Au “Hayu baha.” Mkotoho wabhutukila. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwaikiva Mwana wa Mundu atehika handa vila mhana ungulangaza na kulangaza kundumba haku na kula ndiwa Mwana wa Mundu atehika. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ila ingumpala atumbuli kughasika nesu na kukanilwa na kiwelekwa haki. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Handa iwoneka lipindi lya Nuhu, ndiwa itewoneka hilahila kumachuwa gha Mwana wa Mundu kuhuya. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Lipindi lila lya Nuhu wandu wayendelelili kulyegha na kunywegha, kuposa na kuposwa mbaka lipindi lila Nuhu kayingila msafina, hinu masi matopehu yakamemesa mlima wogha na kutumbula kuyalamisa wala wogha wayingila ng'ogha msafina. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ndiwa iwelili vilavila lipindi lya Lutu. Wandu wayendelelili kulyegha na kunywegha, kuhemela na kuwusa, kutulila mbeyu na kuchenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ila lichuwa lila Lutu paahuka Sodoma, lyoto likalipa likaghuluka kuhuma kundumba handa ndonya, na kuwayalamisa wandu wogha walikalili pala. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />“Havi ndiwa itewoneka lichuwa lila Mwana wa Mundu paagubutiliwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Lichuwa hali, mundu yeyose avili kunani gha lighuta ghaki, akotoho ghuluka kukovekela vindu ghaki vivile mghati gha lighuta ghaki, hilahila na yula atevile mlitawa akotoho huya ukaya kutola chochose. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mkumbwike yamkolili mdala wa Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Mundu yeyose apala kulokola kulama ghaki atekuyaghamila na yeyose ateyaghamila kulama ghaki atekulokola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ninguwalongela, uhiku wa lichuwa lila wandu waivili watevile wawonja mukindanda kimonga, mmonga atetolwa na ghangi atelekwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Wadala waivili watevile wakisyagha ukowa pamonga, mmonga atetolwa na ghangi atelekwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Walumi waivili watevile mulitawa wakighola lihengu, mmonga atetolwa na ghangi atelekwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Hinu wayitikila ghaki wakamkonya, “Bambu hagha yatehumila kugha?” Yesu akawayanga kwa mlandano akilonga, “Pala paawelili na higha gha likokolo lihova kumanyahi ndiwa mbongo ngwasi watejikungula.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mdala ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki na mlamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kuulongolo, Yesu akawapegha wavulwa ghaki mlandano ili walole wangupalwa kuyupa machuwa hyogha kwa kukotoho kutenyuka moyu. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Akawalongela, “Kumbwani mmonga kuwelili na mtosa mmonga avile kamyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga na ng'ogha kumtundamila mundu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kummbwani hau hilahila kuwelili na nyongo mmonga ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki, hayu nyongo ayendili kwa yula mtosa mihanja ngoo akimuluwa akilonga, “amtangi ili awese kupokela vindu ghaki kuhuma kwa mhakata ghaki.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />“Kwa lipindi litali yula mlamula akanilili. Ila kuulongolo akalonga mmoyu ghaki, ‘Pamonga na nenga nimyitikila ng'ogha Sapanga na ng'ogha nimtundamila mundu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Ila kwaikiva hayu ahovitiliwi na mlumi angunighasa, nitemtanga apokeli vindu ghaki, ili akotoho kuyendelela kunighasa na kumwihu nitetoka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Hinu, Bambu akayendelela kulonga, “Mumhyoghanili vila ailongile hayu mtosa mhakata. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ghuli, Sapanga atewagholela ng'ogha maheli wala awahaghulili, wavile wangumlilila pamuhi na uhiku? Ghuli, hatehika kwa kuloposela kuwatanga? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ninguwalongela atewagholela kwa kuloposela wala wangumlilila. Hata nagha, ghuli, atelola wandu wa kukwinila mlima wogha lipindi Mwana wa Mundu paahika?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa Mfalisayo na mkungula usulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu akawapegha mlandano hau kwa wala weni kukwinila yiwa weni ni wandu wa maha na kuwapughanya ghangi. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Wandu waivili wayendili kulighuta lya Sapanga kuyupa, mmonga paghati gha wala awelili Mfalisayo na ghangi awelili mtola usulu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Yula Mfalisayo, akiva kagholoka weka hela, akayupa nagha, “Sapanga, ningukushukwile kwaikiva nenga nilandana ng'ogha na wandu waghangi. Wapokola na wahwangi na wangongola na nenga nilandine ng'ogha handa hayu mtola usulu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />“Nenga ninguwopa mulyo mihanja miivili kwa machuwa isaba, ninguyegha litambiku gha lipinga lya ikumi gha hindu ghangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ila yula mtola usulu akagholoka kwa utali, kayesa ng'ogha hata kuyinula wuso ghaki kulola kundumba, ila ajiyavisili kukitivi na liwoku akigondama akilonga, “Sapanga, uniwoneli luhungu nenga mghola sambi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />“Ninguwalongela, hayu mtola usulu ahuyili ukaya akiva kalekeselwa kala uhakata. Ila yula ghangi, kalekeselwa ng'ogha uhakata. Kwaikiva kila yula mweni kujighola yiwa mkulu ateghuluswa, na kila ajighola mnung'una atekweleswa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahighila wana wanung'una</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliku 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Lichuwa limonga wandu wamonga wamyeghilili Yesu wana wanung'una ili awayavise wahighiliwe. Wavulwa pawalola ghala, wakawakalipila wandu wala. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ila Yesu akawakema wala wana wahiki kwa mweni, akalonga, “Muwaleki wana wanung'una wahiki kwa nenga, wala mkotoho kuwakanisa, kwaikiva Unkosi wa Sapanga ni wa wandu handa hagha wana. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ninguwalongela chakaka, mundu yeyose kaupokela ng'ogha Unkosi wa Sapanga handa hagha wana wanung'una, ateyingila ng'ogha ku Unkosi hau wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Avile na hindu ngoo mmonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliku 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mkulu mmonga, Myahudi, amkonyili Yesu, “Mvula wa maha, nigholi niki ili niwese kupokela ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu akamyanga, “Kwa kyani ungunikema wa maha? Kwahela mundu yeyose avile wamaha ila Sapanga weka hela. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Unguyamanya malaghililo gha Musa, ‘Ukotoho kughola ngongola, ukotoho kukoma, ukotoho kughola wihi, Ukotoho kulonga ulangihi wa ughwangi, uwatundamili tati ghako na nyongo ghako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yula kilongosi akayanga, “Malaghililo hagha gha Musa hyogha ninguyaghola kuhuma uwana ghangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu paahyoghanila ghala, akamlongela, “Ungupalwa kangi kughola kindu kimonga, uwusi kila kindu ghako, uwapeghi wandu wakapuku hagha mapesa, kwa kughola nagha na wenga utevika na ngoko kundumba, ndiwa uhiki unikovekeli.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Paahyoghanila lilando hali, anyengemalili nesu kwaikiva awelili mundu avile na hindu ngoo.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu akamlola akalonga, “Uloli vila ivile ikamala kwa mundu avile na mapesa kuyingila ku Unkosi wa Sapanga kiyuhuyuhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Hinu ni yuhuyuhu nesu kwa likokolo walikema ngamia kuyingila kulilanga lya sindanu kupiti mundu avile na hindu ngoo kuyingila ku Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Wala wandu pawahyoghanila ghala, wakalonga, “Hinu ghani, atelamiswa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu akayanga, “Ghala yawesekana ng'ogha kwa mundu, ila yanguwesekana kwa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Na Petelo akamkonya, “Na twenga, ghuli? Tuleka vindu vyogha tukakukovekela.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu akayanga, “Ninguwalongela chakaka mundu alekili lighuta ghaki, au mdala au walongo au walela au wana kwaikiva gha Unkosi wa Sapanga, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />atepokela vindu vitangala lipindi hali lya hinaa na ukomu wa machuwa hyogha bila mwihu kumlima wogha kulipindi lila litehika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela kangi kihu kyaki lihanja lya itatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:10-19">Matayu 20:10-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliku 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu akawatola mmbali wala wayitikila ikumi na ivili, akawalongela, “Mhyoghanili. Tunguyenda Yelusalemu na haku kila kindu kiyandikiliwi na walota wa Sapanga kulongela Mwana wa Mundu kitegholeka. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwaikiva ateyeghwa na kukamulwa kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi na weni watemghola uhakata na kumuhunyila mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Watemtova hilatu na kumkoma, ila lichuwa lya itatu atehinduka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ila hagha wayitikila wamanyili ng'ogha lilando lila, kwaikiva kumamyika kwaki kuwelili kuhighwa kwa weni, hinu weni wamanyili ng'ogha yiwa Yesu awelili akilongela kyani.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumlamisa mundu angalimihu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliku 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Lipindi Yesu paatyanga na kahika pabehi na Yeliko, kuwelili na mundu mmonga angalimihu kalikala mnjila akiluwaluwa wamtangi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Mundu angalimihu hayu pakahyoghanila lilowi lya lipinga lya wandu likityanga, akakonya, “Kuvile na kyani?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Wala wandu wakamlongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti angutyanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Akatova lilowi, akilonga, “Yesu, mwana wa Daudi, uniwoneli luhungu!.”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Wala wandu walongololili kuulongolo wakamkalipila wakimlongela akotoho kulonga, ila mweni akayendelela kutova lilowi, “Mwana wa Daudi, niwoneli luhungu!.”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu akagholoka, akawalaghilila wamyeghi mundu yula kwa mweni. Paahikili pabehi, Yesu akamkonya, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Ungupalwa nikugholeli kyani?” Na mweni akamyanga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Bambu, ninguluwa mbati kulola.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu akamlongela, “Lola kukwinila haku kukulamisa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Akawesa kulola lisaa lilalila, akamkovekela Yesu, kunu akimyinula Sapanga. Wandu wogha pawalola ghala, na weni wakamyinula Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu pamonga na Zakayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu ayingilili kumbwani Yeliko, akavile akityanga kunjila zya mmbwani hula. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Pawelili na mundu mmonga haku kumbwani lihina lyaki Zakayu. Akiva mkulu wa watola usulu na hayu awelili mundu mnaisa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Mweni apalili kumlola Yesu yiwa ni mundu liki, ila kwa ikiva gha lipinga likulunga lya wandu na kwa vila awelili mhupi, kasindwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Hinu akalongolela kwa kutula mbilo kuulongolo gha wandu akakwela kunani gha mkuyu ili amlole Yesu, kwa ikiva Yesu awelili akihika kupitila njila hila. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu paahikili pala pahi gha hula mkuyu, akalola kunani, akamlongela, “Zakayu, ughuluki kwa kuloposela, kwaikiva lelo nitevile mhenja ghako ukaya ghako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Hinu Zakayu akaghuluka kwa kuloposela, akampokela Yesu kuukaya ghaki kwa luheku likulunga. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Wandu wogha pawayalola ghala, wakatumbula kung'ung'ulika wakilonga, “Kayenda kuvile mhenja kwa mundu mweni sambi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ila Zakayu akagholoka, akamlongela Yesu, “Mhyoghanili, Bambu, nenga nitewapegha wandu wavile na hindu ng'ogha mandina gha hindu ghangu, na ikiva nimpokola mundu yeyose kindu, nitemuhuyisila mianja inne.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Ndiwa Yesu akamlongela, “Lelo, ulokola uyingila ukaya kwa hayu kwaikiva, hayu hilahila ni mhelekwa wa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwaikiva Mwana wa Mundu kahika kuhakula na kulamisa wandu wayaghamilili.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa watumikila ikumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayu 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Lipindi wandu wawelili wambila wanguhyoghanila hagha, pala awelili akihika pabehi na Yelusalemu na wandu wala waliwachilili yiwa, Unkosi wa Sapanga utehika lipindi lilalila, Yesu akawalongela mlandano hau. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Hinu akawalongela, “Kuwelili na mundu mmonga wa ukolu wa kinkosi atumbulili mwanja kuyenda mlima wa kutali ili apokeli lihengu lya unkosi, kuulongolo ahuyi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Hinu, pambila gha kuhuka, akawakema watumikila ghaki ikumi, akawapegha mapesa yatangala kila mmonga na kuwalongela, “Mgholi biasala mbaka nitehika.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ila wandu wa mlima ghaki mweni wawelili wampala ng'ogha. wakayegha laghililo na kulonga, “Tupala ng'ogha hayu mundu avile nkosi wa twenga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Hata nagha mundu yula akapeghwa Unkosi na kuhuya kumlima ghaki, na paahika akawakema wala watumikila ghaki awelili kawalekela mapesa, ili amanyi yiwa wapokela mapesa ninga kwa kughola biasala na mapesa awapeghili.” <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mtumikila wa mtumbula akahika na kulonga, “Bambu, kupitila hila imonga unipeghili nighola biasala na iyongeseka mihanja ikumi gha mapesa unipeghili.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Yula mkulu akamyanga, “Ughola maheli mtumikila wa maha, kwaikiva ughola vila ipalilwi kugholwa kukindu kinung'una, hinu ningukupegha ulongosi kumimbwani ikumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Waivili na mweni akahika, akalonga, “Bambu kupitila hila imonga unipeghili iyongeseka mihanja itano mapesa ghangi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Na mweni akamlongela, “Na wenga utevile na ulongosi kumimbwani itano.”<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mtumikila ghangi akahika, akalonga, “Bambu utoli mapesa ghako imonga unipeghili, niihighili mahala kutambala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />“Kwaikiva niwelili na holu, wenga ni mundu mkalipa. Wenga ni mundu uwesa kutola kindu kya wenga ng'ogha na kangi hutungula pala utulili ng'ogha.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mkulu ghaki akamuyanga, “Nakutosa kwa milando ghako mweni, wenga mtumikila mhakata, umanyili yiwa nenga ni mundu mkalipa, niwesa kutola vindu pala nivika ng'ogha na kunokola pala nitulili ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kwa kyani hinaa ukavika ng'ogha kwa wandu wawesa kuvika nyongesa ili panihika, nitoli yala mapesa ghangu na nyongesa ghaki?”<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ndiwa akawalongela wala wawelili wagholoka pabehi, “Mumpokole hagha mapesa na mkampeghi yula avile na ikumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Wakamlongela, “Bambu, ila hayu kana nyongesa kala gha hagha mapesa mihanja ikumi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Na mweni akawayanga, ‘Ninguwalongela’ kila avile na kindu atepokela na kuyongeswa. Ila yula avile na hindu ng'ogha hata kila kya mmawoko ghaki kitetolwa.” <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Na hinaa, “Wala wahakata wa nenga wakanilili yiwa nenga nkosi ghao ng'ogha, muwayeghi baha, muwakomi bahala kuulongolo gha nenga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyingila Yelusalemu kwa luheku ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu akalonga hagha, hinu akalongolela kuulongolo gha weni wakiyenda Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Paahikili pabehi vimbwani vya Betifage na Betania, pabehi na litumbi lya Mizeituni, akawalaghila wavulwa ghaki waivili, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />akawalongela, “Myendi kukimbwani kivile kuulongolo mwa mwenga mkilola. Pamvile mkiyingila kukimbwani haki, mtemlola mwanapunda kawopwa avile katumilwa ng'ogha na mundu. Mumuwoposole, mumuyeghi baha.<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwanapunda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Na ikiva mundu anguwakonya kwa kyani mngumuwoposola, mumlongeli, ‘Bambu angumpala.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Hinu, wakayenda, na weni wakongine na kila kindu handa vila Yesu awalongelili. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Pawawelili wakimuwoposola yula mwanapunda, weni wenikaya wakawakonya, “Kwakyani mngumuwoposola hayu mwana punda?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Na weni wakawayanga, “Bambu angumpala.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Hinu, wakamyeghela Yesu yula mwana punda. Hinu wakagubika nguu zyao kunani gha yula mwanapunda, wakamkwelesa Yesu kunani ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu akayendelela na mwanja na wandu wakayanjasa nguu zyao munjila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Paahikili pabehi na Yelusalemu, kughuluka libondi lya litumbi lya Mizeituni, lipinga likulunga lya wavulwa wakatumbula kuhekelela kwa kutova lilowi na kumyinula Sapanga kwa lilowi likulunga kwaikiva gha miujisa mikulunga wailolili, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Wawelili wakilonga kahighilwa nkosi yula ayeghilwi kwa lihina lya Bambu.” “kuponga kundumba na Ukulu haku kunani kundumba, kila mundu amshukwile Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Amonga gha Mafalisayo wawelili paghati gha lila lipinga lya wandu wakamlongela, “Mvula, wakalipile wavulwa ghako wanyamali.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu akawayanga, “Ninguwalongela mwenga, ikiva hagha wangunyamala, maganga hagha yatetova lilowi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalilila wandu wa mmbwani wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu paahikili pabehi na mmbwani wa Yelusalemu na kuulola mmbwani hula akatumbula kulila <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />akalonga kwa wandu wa mmbwani hula, “Niwelili nikipala hata lelo baha mmanyi mighalu gha kughola yayegha kuponga, ila hinaa yaghighwa kumihu gha mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwaikiva machuwa yanguhika, itevile wahakata ghako watechenga likuta likamala na kuutindila mmbwani ghako na kutumbula kukupundangila mbandi zyogha. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Watekupundangila nesu wenga pamonga na wandu walikala mghati ghako Yelusalemu. Watekulekesela ng'ogha hata liganga limonga kunani gha ghangi kwaikiva umanyili ng'ogha lipindi Sapanga ahikili kukulokola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwawinga waghola biasala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliku 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ndiwa Yesu akayingila Mliyugha lya lighuta lya Sapanga akatumbula kuwawinga wala wawelili wakiwusa vindu mula. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Na mweni akawalongela, “Iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga, ‘Lighuta lyangu litevile lighuta lya mayupo’, ila mwenga mulighola kuvile mbaku gha wapokola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kila lelu Yesu awelili akivula mlyugha lya lighuta lya Sapanga, watambika wakulu na wavula wa laghililo lya Musa na vilongosi wa wandu wawelili wakihakula njila ili wamkome. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ila walolili ng'ogha njila kwa ikiva wandu wogha wamkovekelili Yesu wakihyoghanila milando ghaki kwa kupala ng'ogha maghaso.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu uhuma kugha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliku 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lichuwa limonga Yesu paawelili akivula wandu kulighuta lya Sapanga na kutangasa Habali Maha, watambika wakulu na wavula wa laghilo, pamonga na vilongosi wagogolo wa Wayahudi wakamuhikila. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Wakamkonya, “Utulongeli, ungughola mighalu hai kwa ulongosi wa ghani? Na ghani kakupegha ukulu hau?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Na Yesu akawalongela, “Na nenga nitewakonya lilando. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Ukulu wa Yohanawa kubatisa uhumili kundumba au kwa wandu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Wakalongelana weni kwa weni wakilonga, “Ikiva tukilonga, ‘Uhumili kundumba,’ mweni atetukonya, ‘Kwa kyani mumkwinila ng'ogha?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Na patulonga ukulu uhumilili kwa wandu, wandu wogha baha watetutova maganga, kwaikiva wogha wangulikwinila yiwa Yohanaawelili mlota wa Sapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Hinu wakayanga, “Tumanya ng'ogha ukulu hau uhumili kugha.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu akawalongela, “Hata nenga nitewalongela ng'ogha ningughola mighalu hai kwa ulongosi wa ghani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa litawa lya mizabibu na watukutula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliku 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela wandu mlandano hau, “Mundu mmonga atukutulili litawa lya mizabibu, akawapegha watukutula ili kuulongolo awahomosi, hinu akatumbula mwanja mbaka mlima wa kutali, akalikala haku kwa lipindi litali. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Lipindi lya kubena, mundu hayu akamyegha mtumikila ghaki kwa wala watukutula, ili awese kutola homoso ghaki lya mizabibu. Ila wala watukutula wakamtova mtumikila yula, akahuya mawoko lipala. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kangi mweni litawa akamlaghila mtumikila ghangi, hayu na mweni wakamtova, wakamuwinga na akahuya mawoko lipala. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Akamlaghila kangi mtumikila wa itatu, na hayu hilahila wakamtova na kumuhakila wakamdanga panji gha litawa. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yula bambu mweni litawa lya mizabibu akaliwachila, ‘Niteghola kyani? Nitemlaghila mwana ghangu nimpala mani watemtundamila.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Wala watukutula pawamlola yula mwana, wakalongelana, ‘Hayu ndiwa mlihi. Hinu, tumkome ili ulihi ghaki uvile wa twenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Hinu, wakamuhumisa panji gha lila litawa lya mizabibu, wakamkoma.” Yesu akakonya, “Yula bambu mweni litawa atewaghola kyani wala watukutula? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Atehika kuwakoma watukutula hagha na kuwapegha watukutula ghangi hali litawa lya mizabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Wandu pawahyoghanila milando hila wakalonga, “Lilando hali likotoho humila kwa twenga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ila Yesu akawakwenjulila mihu akalonga, “Mayandiko hagha gha Sapanga yangumanisa liki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Liganga lila walikanili wachenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">livile liganga likulunga lya mmbali?’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mundu yeyose paaguila kunani gha liganga hali atetenyukatenyuka na palimguwila mundu yeyose, litemtimbanga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhipa usulu kwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliku 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Wavula wa laghililo na watambika wakulu wamanyili yiwa mlandano hula walongelilwi weni na hinu wakapala kumkamula palapala, ila wakawela na holu wandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Kwa nagha wakulu hagha wawelili wangumnyatila Yesu wamkamuli. Wakawapegha wandu swinda. Na wakayegha wandu kumkonya Yesu milando. Wandu hagha wakajighola yiwa ni wa maha. Ila wawelili wakihakula njila gha kumkamula Yesu kwa milando ghaki ili wayende kumsitaki kwa kilongosi wa kilumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Hinu wamonga gha wala walaghililiwi wakamkonya, “Mvula, tungumanya yiwa wenga ungulonga na kuvula ghala gha chakaka. Hilahila wenga uloli ng'ogha ukulu wa mundu, ila unguvula vila wandu wangupalwa watami handa Sapanga angupala. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Hinu utulongeli yiwa tungupalwa kuhipa usulu kwa Kaisali au ng'ogha?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ila Yesu amanyili mteghu ghao, akawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Mnilangisili hali ligwala, ghuli, wuso na kilangihi ni vya ghani?” Na weni wakamuyanga, “Ni gha Kaisali.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu akawalongela, “Hinu, gha Kaisali mumpeghi Kaisali na gha Sapanga mumpeghi Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Wakawesa ng'ogha kumkamula kwa yala milando ayalongile kuulongolo gha wandu na weni wakakangaswa nesu na kula kuyanga kwaki, wakanyamala jii.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhinduki na kihu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliku 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Hinu wamonga wa Masadukayo wala wangulonga yiwa kwahela uhinduki wa yula ahovili, wakamhikila Yesu na kumkonya, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mvula, Musa atuyandikilili yiwa ikiva mlongo wa mundu mlumi paahwegha na kumleka mdala ghaki kahela mwana, hinu angupalwa hayu mlongo amposi yula mdala ahovitiliwi ili amleleli mhacha ghaki wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Hinaa pawelili na walongo isaba. Yula wa mtumbula aposili na kuulongolo akahova na kaleka ng'ogha mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Hinu yula wa ivili akamlihi hayu mdala ahovitiliwi na mweni akahova kangi kaleka ng'ogha mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Na mlongo wa itatu hilahila akamlihi. Milando igholeka hunagha kwa wogha isaba wogha wahovili na kuleka ng'ogha wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kumwihu na yula mdala ahovitiliwi akahova. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Hinaa, ghuli lichuwa lya wandu kuhindulilwa hayu mdala atevile mdala wa ghani? Kwaikiva aposiliwi na walongo wogha isaba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu akawayanga wandu walikala hinaa huposa na kuposwa kumlima wogha hau. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ila wandu wala Sapanga kailolela yiwa wangupalwa kupokela fwasi kumlima wogha hula na kuhindulilwa kukihu weni wateposwa ng'ogha hata kuposa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Hagha wawesa ng'ogha kuhova kangi, kwaikiva weni ni handa watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. Weni ni wana wa Sapanga, kwaikiva wahindulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Hata Musa ahighilisili yiwa wahovili watehinduka, ailongile hagha kumayandiko gha Sapanga pala kukila kiputila kiwelili kikiyaka lyoto. Pala Sapanga ailongile mweni ni Bambu “Sapanga wa Ibulahimu na Sapanga wa Isaka na Sapanga wa Yakobu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Hinu, “Mweni ka ng'ogha Sapanga wa wala wahovili, ila ni Sapanga wa wala wakomu kwaikiva kwa mweni wogha wangulama.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wamonga wa wala wavula wa laghililo lya Musa wakalonga, “Mvula uyangili maheli nesu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Wakalonga nagha kwaikiva wawesa ng'ogha kumkonya kangi lilando ghangi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito ni mwana wa ghani?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliku 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Hinu Yesu akayendelela kuwalongela, “Iwesekana ghuli wandu walongi yiwa Kilisito ni mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Daudi mweni ayandikili kukihitabu kya zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Bambu amlongelili Bambu wa nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">ulikali kuliwoku lyangu lya kuliyila’<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbaka nikugholi uwasindi wahakata ghako na kuwalongosa wavile pahi gha ulongosi ghako.” <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />“Ikiva Daudi angumkema, Kilisito ni Bambu ghaki, hinu, itevile ghuli mwana ghaki?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwalongela wandu walikali mihu kwa wavula wa laghililo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliku 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Wandu wogha lipindi wangumuyoghanila Yesu akawalongela wavulwa ghaki kuulongolo gha wandu, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mlikali mihu na wavula wa laghililo gha Musa wala wangupala kutyangatyanga wakiva wavala lihabiti na hupala kujambuswa na wandu kwa kutundamilwa kumasoku na hulikala mahala pautundamilu kulighuta lya kukonganika Wayahudi na kulikala mahala pautundamilu kumhambu. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Huwapokola wadala wahovitiliwi na walumi hata kumaghuta ghao, ikiva wangujilangusila yiwa wandu wa maha kwa kuyupa mayupo matandamahu. Hagha watepokela utoso ukalipa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Litambiku lya nyongo ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maliku 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Hinu Yesu paalola kwa umaha, akawalola wandu wanaisa vila wawelili wakivika litambiku kulisanduku lya luhanja kulighuta lya Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Hilahila akamlola nyongo mmonga ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki akivika mula gwala ivili isokombi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ndiwa Yesu akalonga, “Chakaka ninguwalongela, hayu nyongo ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki na avile na hindu ng'ogha kavika mula litambiku lipiti wandu ghangi wogha. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Hagha ghangi wogha wavika litambiku kwa Sapanga kwa ikiva wavile na hindu ngoo wavika mayaghani kwa vila vitangala wapokelili, ila hayu nyongo ahovitiliwi na mlumi ghaki pamonga ni mundu avile na hindu ng'ogha, kavika mlisanduku kila kindu akidahila kuukomu ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulota kuyalamika kwa lighuta lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliku 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Wamonga wa wavulwa ghaki wayesili kumulangiha vila Lighuta lya Sapanga walichengili kwa maganga maheli na kwa vindu vitolilwi handa litambiku kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />Yesu akalonga, “litehika lichuwa limonga havi vindu mnguvilola vitebomolwa, hinu litesyehila ng'ogha liganga kunani gha ghangi, kila kindu kitebomolwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lung'ai na mahakili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliku 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Wavulwa hagha wakamkonya, “Mvula, mighalu hai itehumila ligha? Ni kilangihi liki kitelaghiha yiwa yavile pabehi kugholeka?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu akawayanga, “Mlikali mihu ili mkotoho kulongelwa uhwangi. Kwaikiva wandu watangala watehika kwa lihina lya nenga, wakipala kulonga, ‘Nenga ndiwa Kilisito,’ na ‘Mwihu wa mlima wogha upabehi kuhika. Ila mwenga mkotoho kuwakovekela.’ <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Hinu, pamtehyoghanila lilando lya ngondo na maghaso, mkotoho kutila, kwaikiva ingupalwa hagha yatumbuli kuhumila, ila mwihu wa mlima wogha umbila.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Kuulongolo akayendelela kulonga, “Mlima kwa mlima ghangi itetovana, na unkosi mmonga utetovana na unkosi ghangi.” <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kila mahala patevile na mihihimilo gha lindakali kogha na kogha, njala ikalipa na kuvina mahakata nesu. Kutevile na mighalu gha kutila nesu handa vilangihi kuhuma kundumba. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ila yambila kuhumila hagha hyogha, wandu watewakamula wamonga gha mwenga na kuhakilwa. Watewayegha kumawoko gha wakulu wa maghuta gha kukonganika Wayahudi na kuwopwa kumaghuta gha wawopwa, na mwenga mteyeghwa kuulongolo gha wankosi na walongola kwaikiva gha lihina lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Hai itevile njila gha mwenga kuwalongela Habali Maha. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ila kumioyu gha mwenga mkotoho kutila kindu yiwa mtelonga kyani haku. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kwaikiva nenga baha nitewapegha milando na luhala lula kwahela hata mhakata wa mwenga mmonga atewesa kusindana na hau na hata kuingingama. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Walela wa mwenga, walongo, walongo wa mmbali pamonga na waghanja wa mwenga watewahyuka mwenga na wamonga gha mwenga mtekomwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Wandu wogha watewapala ng'ogha mwenga kwaikiva gha lihina lya nenga. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ila patewela ng'ogha ghwila imonga gha mutu gha mwenga iteyalamila. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ila kwa kuyendelela kugholoka kwa kukamala mtelokola mpumulo gha mwenga.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulongela uloto wa kuyalamila kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayu 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maliku 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Pamlola mmbwani wa Yelusalemu utindilwa na watovangondo, hinu mmanyi yiwa kuyalamika kwaki kupabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Lipindi hali, wala wavile kumlima wa Yudasia wabhutukili kumatumbi na wala wavile kummbwani Yelusalemu wahuki hamu na wala wavile kumatawa wakotoho kuyingila kummbwani. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwaikiva hali litevile lipindi lya matovo kuhuma kwa Bambu ili hyogha yayandikiliwi kumayandiko gha Sapanga yahumile. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Chondi kwa wavile na ndumbu na wala watevile wakiyongesa kumachuwa ghala. Kutevile na lung'ai ngulu kumlima wogha na lilaka lya Sapanga litewahikila wandu hagha. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Ghangi watekomwa kwa lipanga na ghangi watetolwa kuhusutu kumlima ghangi na wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi wateulongosa Yelusalemu kwa makakala na kuwahakila wandu ghaki, mbaka lipindi lyao litetimila.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliku 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kutevile na kilangihi kulijua na mwehi na ndondwa. Milima hyogha kumlima wogha yatevile na lung'ai kwaikiva gha holu ihumila na mlindimo wa mawimbi gha bahali.” <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Wandu watehyunga mpumulo kwa holu ngulu na kuilola mighalu ihumila kumlima wogha, kwaikiva makakala gha vindu vya kundumba yatetikanyika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Lipindi hali ndiwa watemlola Mwana wa Mundu akihika kumahindu pamonga na makakala na ukulu mkulunga. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Lipindi mighalu hai paitetumbula kugholeka, mgholoki na myinule mutu, kwaikiva ukombola wa mwenga utama pabehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlandano wa libiki lilela tini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliku 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela mlandano hau, “Muwachilile libiki lilela tini na mibiki ghangi.” <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Pamlola yiwa itumbula kuhipula mahamba, mnguwesa kumanya lipindi lya kutukutula lihika pabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Hilahila, pamlola mighalu hai ihumila, mmanyi yiwa Unkosi wa Sapanga utama pabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Chakaka ninguwalongela, wandu wa kiwelekwa haki kitehuka ng'ogha pambila gha hagha hyogha kuhumila. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Kundumba na mlima wogha viteyenda, ila lilando lyangu liteyenda ng'ogha.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tungupalwa kulikala mihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mlikali mihu, mioyu gha mwenga ili mkotoho kukolwa na mighalu gha mlima wogha handa kuyananga hindu na ulowela na mighalu hyogha gha ukomu hau. Kwaikiva lichuwa lila litewahikila bwitu. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwaikiva itewahikila handa vila mteghu paukamula, ndiwa lichuwa lila litewahikila wandu wogha walikala kumlima wogha kogha. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mlikali mihu, na myupi lipindi lyogha ili muwese kupokela makakala gha kutyanga maha kumighalu hai hyogha itehumila na kugholoka kuulongolo gha Mwana wa Mundu.” <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kila lelo pamuhi Yesu awelili akivula Mlighuta lya Sapanga na lumihi paihikili, ayendili kulitumbi lya Mizeituni na kulikala kula uhiku wogha. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Wandu wogha wawelili wakiyenda ku Lighuta lya Sapanga malawila pee, ili wawese kumuhyoghanila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Mghalu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Mhambu wa mabumunda yavikilwi ng'ogha simika, ingukemwa Lichuwa lya Pasaka, liwelili ipabehi kuhika. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Watambika wakulu na wavula wa ulaghilo wanguhakula njila gha kumkoma Yesu, ila wakawela na holu gha wandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi anguyitikila kumuhyuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliku 14:10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Hinu, Lihyukana likamuyingila wangumkema Yudasi Isikalioti, mmonga wa wala wavulwa ikumi na waivili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yudasi akayenda akalongelana na watambika wakulu na wagholokela wa lighuta lya Sapanga. akalongela na weni vila watemkamula Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Na weni wakahekelela na kumlongela yiwa watempegha mapesa. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasi akayitikila na akavile akihakula njila gha maha gha kumyegha kwa weni wandu wakotoho kumanya.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulyegha mhambu wa Pasaka na wavulwa ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliku 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Hinu, lichuwa lya mabumunda yavikilwi ng'ogha simika likahika. Hali ndiwa mhambu livile mwanakondolu wa Pasaka huhinjwa handa litambiku. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Hinu Yesu akawalaghila Petelo na Yohana, akawalongela, “Myendi mkatutengeli ili tuwese kulyegha mhambu wa Pasaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Na weni wakamkonya, “Ungupala tuitengeli kugha?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Akawalongela, “Mhyoghanili, pamvile mnguyenda kumbwani, mtekongana na mlumi apapili lindeleku lya masi. Mumkovekeli mbaka mghati gha lighuta ateyingila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mumlongeli mweni lighuta, ‘Mvula angukukonya, kya kugha kila kyumba atelyeghela mhambu wa Pasaka na wavulwa ghaki?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Na mweni atewalangiha kyumba kikulu kunani gha mlighuta kivile kitamikiliwi vindu vya mhambu maha mtengeli hamu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Hinu wakayenda wakalola kila kindu handa Yesu awalongile, wakatengela pala mulyo wa pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyo wa Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliku 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Wakolintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Lisaa palihikili, Yesu akatama kulyegha mulyo pamonga na wandumindumi ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Akawalongela, “Imbendeze nenga kulyegha mhambu wa Pasaka hai pamonga na mwenga pambila gha kuhakilwa kwa nenga. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Hinaa ninguwalongela, niteulyegha ng'ogha kangi mhambu wa Pasaka mbaka pala itehumila ku Unkosi wa Sapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Hinu akatola kitekelu kya divai, akashukwile, akalonga, “Mtoli haki mnyweghi wogha. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Hinaa ninguwalongela, nitenywegha ng'ogha kangi divai gha zabibu mbaka Unkosi wa Sapanga utekahika.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Hinu akatola libumunda, akashukwile, akaumegha, akawapegha akilonga, “Hau ndiwa higha wa nenga utolwa kwaikiva gha mwenga. Mgholi nagha kwa kunikumbwike nenga.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Hilahila badili gha kulyegha, akatola kila kitekelo kya divai akalonga, “Kitekelo haki ni lilaghano lya hyonu lihighiliswa mwahi gha nenga, inguyitika kwaikiva gha mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Ila, mloli, yula atenihyuka kabaha mlihinda pamonga na nenga. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ni chakaka Mwana wa Mundu anguyenda kukomwa handa lukani lwa Sapanga , ila chondi yula mundu atenihyuka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Hinu wakatumbula kukonyana weni kwa weni ni ghani paghati gha twenga ateghola mghalu hau.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masindano yiwa ghani mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kangi yakahumila masindano paghati gha wala wandumindumi yiwa ni ghani awachilwili kuvile mkulu kupiti ghangi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu akawalongela, “Wankosi wa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi wanguwalongosa wandu kwa makakala na wala wavile na ukulu kwa wandu hagha wangujikema maghanja wa wala wanguwalongosa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ila mwenga mkotoho kughola handa wala ila yula avile mkulu kwa mwenga na alikali handa mnung'una kwa wogha kulongosa handa mtumikila. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kwaikiva, ni ghani avile mkulu, yula angulikala mmesa na kulyegha mulyo au yula mweni kuwagholela wandu handa mtumikila? Ninguliwachila ni yula angulikala kumesa kulyegha mulyo. Hata nagha, nenga na baha paghati mwa mwenga handa mtumikila.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Mwenga ndiwa mhighalili na nenga lipindi lyogha lya mayeso gha nenga, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />na handa vila Tati gha nenga anipeghili Unkosi, hilahila na nenga ninguwapegha mwenga Unkosi. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Ili mpati kulyegha na kunywegha mmesa gha nenga kumhambu wa Unkosi wa nenga na kulikala kuvikalilo vya kinkosi, mkiva mkitosa makabila ikumi na ivili gha Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulota yiwa Petelo atemhyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni, uhyoghanili Lihyukana lipalili kuwayeyesa mwenga handa mundu anguyeyesa ngano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ila nenga Simoni nikuyupila kwa Sapanga ili kukwinila ghako kukotoho kupungula. Na wenga paunihyukila na kunikwinila uwapeghi moyu walongo ghako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Na mweni Petelo akamuyanga, “Bambu, nenga nijivika kala maha kuyenda pamonga na wenga kuyenda kulighuta lya wawopwa na hata kuhova.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Ningukulongela wenga Petelo, pambila gha njogholu kutova lilowi lelo utevile unikanila mihanja itatu yiwa ungunimanya ng'ogha nenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pochi na Libegi na Lipanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Hinu Yesu akawakonya wavulwa ghaki, “Paniwalaghilili mvile ng'ogha na mhaku wa mapesa na ng'ogha mhaku wa nguu na ng'ogha hilatu, mlepelelwili na kindu chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">“Wakalonga ng'ogha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu akawalongela, “Ila hinaa, yula avile na mhaku wa mapesa na atole na yula avile na mhaku hilahila atole. Na yula kahela lipanga, awusi lihabiti ghaki akahemeli lipanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwaikiva ninguwalongela, liyandiko hali lingupalwa ligholeki kwa nenga, yiwa, ‘Avalangililwi pamonga na wahakata’ kwa chakaka yala yayandikiliwi yanilongelela nenga yangupalwa yagholeki.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Wavulwa ghaki wakamlongela, “Bambu, lola, tuwela na mipanga ivili baha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyupa kulitumbi lya Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliku 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu akahuka akayenda kulitumbi lya Mizeituni handa iwelili akighola, na wavulwa ghaki wakamkovekela. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Paahikili kula akawalongela, “Myupi, ili mkotoho kuyingila mmayeso.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Hinu akawaleka, akayenda utali wa mundu kuwesa kudanga liganga, akatova manung'una, akayupa kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tati, ikiva ungupala, ukihumisi kitekelo haki kya maghaso, hata nagha, mapalo ghako yatimili,” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Bahala mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga akamuhumila, akamvika makakala. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Na mweni akiva kulutungu mkulunga, akayupa kwa kuyangalayi na lihuki lyaki likavile handa mwahi lingughuluka pahi kulutupi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Kuulongolo paayomola kuyupa, akawahuyila wavulwa ghaki, akawalola wawonja, kwaikiva wawelili wana utungu mmoyu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Na mweni akawakonya, “Kwa kyani muwonja? Mulamuki muyupi ili mkotoho kuyingila mumayeso.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliku 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu lipindi akiyendelela kulonga, lipinga likulunga lya wandu likahika, likilongoswa na Yudasi Isikalioti, akiva awelili mmonga wa wala wavulwa ikumi na ivili. Akamhikila Yesu ili amjambusi kwa kumkusukila. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ila Yesu akamlongela, “Yudasi, ghuli, ungumhyuka Mwana wa Mundu kwa kumkusukila?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Wala wavulwa ghaki pawalolili ghala wakalonga, “Bambu, tutumili mapanga ghetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Mmonga wa wala wavulwa akamtova mtumikila wa Mtambika mkulu, akamdumula lipulikilo lya mbandi gha liwoku lya kulihila.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Pala, Yesu akalonga, “Uleki, hai ingubaka.” Akaliyavisa lila lipulikilo lya yula mtumikila wa mtambika, akalilamisa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela watambika wakulu na wakulu wa wagholokela wa Lighuta lya Sapanga na wagogolo ghangi wa Kiyahudi wahikili kumkamula, “Ghuli, mhika na mapanga na mimbonga kunikamula yiwa nenga na mpokola? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Paniwela pamonga na mwenga machuwa hyogha mlighuta lya Sapanga mnikamula ng'ogha. Ila, hali ndiwa lipindi lya mwenga nesu, ndiwa lipindi lya ulongosi wa lwisa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo angumkanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayu 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maliku 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Hinu wakamkamula Yesu, wakamtola na kuyenda pamonga na mweni lighuta kwa Mtambika Mkulu. Petelo akiva angumkovekela kuyetu kwa utali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Wandu wala pawahika ukaya kwa mtambika mkulu wakakosa lyoto paghati gha lyugha na weni wawelili walikala pamonga na mweni Petelo akalikala pamonga na weni. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mtumikila mmonga mdala paamlolili Petelo kalikala pabehi na lyoto, akamkwinjilila mihu, akalonga, “Mundu hayu hilahila awelili pamonga na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ila Petelo alikanili akilonga, “Aku, Nimmanya ng'ogha nenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Kuulongolo mayaghani, mundu ghangi akamlola Petelo, akalonga, “Wenga ni mmonga wa wala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Ila Petelo akayanga “Mundu wenga, ng'ogha nenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kuulongolo handa lisaa limonga havi, mundu ghangi akayendelela kulonga, “Kwa chakaka hayu awelili pamonga na Yesu, kwaikiva mweni kangi ni Mgalilaya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petelo akayanga, “Wenga mundu, nenga nimanya ng'ogha kiulonga,” na palapala ambila akilonga, njogholu akatova lilowi. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Bambu akaghalambuka na kumhyukila Petelo na mweni Petelo akumbwikile ghala milando awelili kalongelwa na Bambu Yesu, “Lelo pambila njogholu katova lilowi ng'ogha, utenihyuka mihanja itatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Pala Petelo akahuma panji, akalila nesu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angupughanywa na kutovwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayu 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maliku 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Wala wandu wawelili wangumgholokela Yesu wakatumbula kumpughanya na kumtova. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Wakamuwopa nguu kumihu na kumkonya, “Utulongeli ghani kakutova?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Wakayendelela kumlighu kwa malighu yatangala.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa kuulongolo gha njengakaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayu 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Paihika malawila wakonganikili wagogolo vilongosi wa Izilaeli na Watambika wakulu na wavula wakamyegha kuulongolo gha njengakaya ghao. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Wakamkonya, “Ikiva wenga ndiwa Kilisito, utulongeli.” ila Yesu akawalongela hata nikiwalongela mtekwinila ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Na nenga paniwakonya lilando mteniyanga ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ila kuhuma hinaa, “Mwana wa Mundu atelikala mbandi gha liwoku lya kuliyila wa Sapanga avile na makakala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Wogha wakamkonya wakalonga ndiwa kulonga wenga ni Mwana wa Sapanga?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Mweni akawayanga ni chakaka vila mngulongela yiwa ni Mwana wa Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Hinu wakalonga, “Tupala ng'ogha ulangihi kwaikiva twaweni tuhyoghanila milando kuhuma mumlomo ghaki.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyeghwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayu 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliku 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Hinu lipinga lyogha lya wandu wayimukili na kumyegha Yesu kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Na weni wakatumbula kumlamula wakilonga, “Tumlola hayu mundu akiwayaghamisa wandu wa mlima hau, akiwakanisa wandu wakotoho kuhipa usulu kwa nkosi kaisali na kujikema yiwa mweni ni Kilisito, Nkosi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Hinu Pilato akamkonya Yesu, “Wenga ndiwa Nkosi wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu akamuyanga akamlongela, “Wenga ungulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato akawalongela watambika wakulu na wala walikungulili, “Nilola ng'ogha lilando lihakata kwa mundu hayu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ila weni wayendilelili kulonga, “Anguwaghola wandu wahyuki mighalu gha Kiyahudi kumlima wa Yudasia hyogha, kuhuma Galilaya atumbulili mbaka kuhika mbandi hai.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuulongolo gha Nkosi Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato paahyoghanila mighalu hila akakonya, “Hayu mundu ni mwenikaya wa Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Paamanyile yiwa Yesu awelili kahuma kumahala kungulongoswa na Helode, akamyegha kwa Helode avile kawela hilahila ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode paamlolili Yesu ahekilelili nesu kwaikiva lipindi litali ahyoghanilili mighalu gha Yesu na mweni awachili kulola kilangihi hata mmonga ugholilwi na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helode akamkonya milando ngenju Yesu, ila Yesu ayangili ng'ogha hata limonga. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Watambika wakulu na wavula wa laghililo lya Musa wakajihumila kuulongolo, wakayegha masitaka ghao kwa kukalipa nesu ghala agholili Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Helode na watovangondo ghaki wakampughanya Yesu na kumkinila, hinu wakamvika nguu gha kinkosi, wakamhuyisa kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Lichuwa lila Helode na Pilato wagholili ughanja ikiva pambila gha lichuwa lila wawelili mundu na mhakata ghaki.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alamulilwa kihu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliku 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Hinu Pilato akakema konganiko lya watambika wakulu na vilongosi ghangi na wandu walikala mlima hula, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />akawalongela, “Mwenga mumyegha mundu hayu kwa nenga mkilonga yiwa awelili anguwapapusa wandu wakani ulongosi wa kilumi. Hinaa mhyoghanili. Nimkonyili kuulongolo gha mwenga na nilola kana mahakata ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Na Helode kalola ng'ogha mahakata kwa mundu hayu, ndiwa kwaikiva kamuhuyisa kwa twenga. Ni chakaka yiwa mundu hayu kaghola ng'ogha chochose kya kumghola ahovi. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Hinu nitelonga atovwi hyatu na kumleka.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kila mhambu wa Pasaka, Pilato apalilwi kuwafughulila muwopwa mmonga.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ila wandu wogha wakatova lilowi kwa pamonga, “Umviki weka hayu, utufughulile Balaba.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba awelili kavikwa mulighuta lya wawopwa kwa kuyenda kuhyetu na silikali gha Walumi na kwaikiva gha kuhwegha kwa wandu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Hinu Pilato alongile na weni kwa lihanja lya ivili, kwaikiva mweni apalili kumfughulila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ila weni wakayendelela kutova lilowi wakilonga, “Avambwi kulipingika, Avambwi kulipingika.”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato akawalongela kwa lihanja lya itatu, “Kaghola uhakata liki? Nenga nilola ng'ogha uhakata kwa mundu hayu mbaka apalwi kuhova, hinu nitemtova hyatu, kuulongolo nimlekeseli.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ila weni wakayendelela kutova lilowi kwa makakala nesu, yiwa Yesu avambwi, kumwihu, lilowi lya weni lipokelilwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Hinu Pilato akalamula yiwa vila wandu wangupala igholwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Akamuwoposola kuhuma kulighuta lya wawopwa yula wampalili, avile kavikwa mula kwa kughola uhakata wakukanila Silikali na kukoma wandu, akamuhumisa Yesu kwa weni, wamghole wapalili kumghola.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvambwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Pawawelili wakimuyegha, wakonganili na mundu mmonga wamkemili Simoni mwenikaya wa Kilene, awelili akihuma panji gha mmbwani. Hinu wakamkamula, na kumtwika amtangi kwa kuyetu hula lipingika wa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Wandu, lipinga kwa lipinga, wamkovekelili, wamonga wa wandu wala wawelili wadala wala wamlumbilili na kumlilila. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu akawahyukila, akalonga, “Mwenga wanyongo wa Yelusalemu, mkotoho nililila nenga, ila mjililile weni na kwaikiva gha wana wa mwenga.” <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwaikiva machuwa yatehika na wandu watelonga, “Sapanga kawahighili wala waghumba na wayongesa ng'ogha.” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Lipindi hali, ndiwa wandu watetumbula kuilongela mitumbi, “Mtuguili” na kwa vitumbi, “Mtugubiki.” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />“Ikiva wandu waghola nagha kwa libiki livihi, kwa libiki liyomu itevile ghuli?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Wawatolili kangi wandu ghangi waivili, waghola mahakata, wahovi pamonga na mweni. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Pawahikili mahala wapakema, “Lifufu lya mutu,” ndiwa wakamuvamba Yesu pamonga na wala wahakata waivili, mmonga mbandi gha liwoku lya kuliyila na ghangi mbandi gha liwoku lya shotu kila mmonga na lipingika ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu akalonga, “Tati, uwalekeseli kwaikiva wangumanya ng'ogha lila walighola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Hinu wakapeghana nguu zyaki kwa kukinisa mihu gha mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Wandu wawelili wagholoka pala wakilola. Wala wakulu na weni wawelili wakimpughanya, wakilonga, Awesili kulamisa ghangi na ajilamise mweni, ikiva ndiwa Kilisito wa Sapanga, ahaghulilwi.<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Wagholokela na weni wakahika wakamdanila na kumpughanya, wakamyeghela divai iwelili na simika ili anyweghi. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Na weni wakamlongela, “Ikiva wenga ni Nkosi wa Wayahudi, ujilamisi mweni.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Vilavila wavikili kibau kunani ghaki wayandikili, “Hayu ndiwa Nkosi wa Wayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mmonga wa wala wahakata wavambilwi kulipingika, amlighili akilonga, “Ghuli, wenga ng'ogha Kilisito? Hinu, ujilamisi mweni, utulamisi na twenga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ila yula mhakata ghangi akamkalipila myaki akilonga, “Wenga umholu Sapanga hata mayaghani? Wenga upokela utoso hauhau. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Twenga tungupalwa tutoswe uhakili kwaikiva tughola mahakata. Ila mundu hayu kaghola ng'ogha uhakata wowose.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kumwihu akalonga, “Bambu Yesu, ungumbuki nenga pauyingila ku Unkosi ghako.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu akamuyanga, “Chakaka ningukulongela wenga, lelo haihai utelikala pamonga na nenga kupepu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguhova</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Iwelili inguwachilwa lisaa isita pamuhi kwa kulola lijuwa, lijuwa likaleka kulangala na lwisa likagubika Izilaeli hyogha mbaka lisaa itisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />na lipazia litopehu liwelili lilekanisa mbandi ivili ku Lighuta lya Sapanga likabaluka vipandi viivili kuhuma kunani mbaka pahi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu akalila kwa lilowi likulunga, “Tati, kumawoku ghako ninguuvika mpumulo ghangu.” Paayomola kulonga ghala, akadumuka mpumulo.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Pala, yula mkulu wa watovangondo mweni kuwagholokela watovangondo paalolile ghala yahumilili, akamyinula Sapanga akalonga, “Kwa chakaka, mundu hayu awelili mundu wa maha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Wandu wala wogha wawelili walikungula pala kwaikiva gha mghalu hula wa kumuvamba Yesu na ghangi, pawalola mghalu hula, wakahuya kuukaya wakitova vitivi kwa luhungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Waghanja ghaki wogha pamonga na wala wadala wayendili pamonga kuhuma ku Galilaya, wagholokili kwa kutali wakilola mughalu hula.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvikwa kulimambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Hinu kuwelili na mundu mmonga lihina lyaki wangumkema Yusufu, mwenikaya wa kimbwani kimonga kya Wayahudi wangukikema Alimataya. Awelili mundu wa maha na angutundamilwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Awelili akilindila kuhika kwa Unkosi wa Sapanga. Hayu awelili kahuma Alimataya, pamonga na awelili mmonga wa Njengakaya ngulu gha Wayahudi, kakanila kulamula kwa wayaki. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Mundu hayu akayenda kwa Pilato, akaluwa apeghwi higha wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Hinu akaghulusa higha hula kuhuma kumsalaba, akautindilila nguu mbulete ikemwa Sanda, akauvika mulimambi lihongolilwi kumghomba, livile lisikwa mundu ng'ogha. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Lichuwa lila liwelili lijumaa, na mighalu gha mayandalilo gha lichuwa lya kupumulila itumbulili kugholwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Wala wadala wamkovekelili Yesu kuhuma Galilaya wakamkovekela Yusufu, hinu walilola lila limambi na vila uvikilwi higha wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kuulongolo wahuyili kuukaya, wakayandala uvumba na manungilo gha kupakala higha wa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Lichuwa lya Kupumulila wapumulilili handa laghililo lya Musa liyandikilwi.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayu 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliku 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ijumapili, lichuwa lya mtumbulo lya wiki, malawila pee, wala wadala wayendili kulimambi wakipapa ghala uvumba na manungilo wayandalili. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Wakalola lila liganga livikilwi ku mlyango wa limambi lihukumulilwi mmbali gha mmambi.<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Liganga livikilwi kumlyango</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Pawayingila mghati, walola ng'ogha higha wa Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Pawawelili wambila wangulikangasa mhambu hula, bwitu wandu waivili wavala nguu zing'alili nesu, wakagholoka pabehi na weni. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Wala wadala wakayingila holu, wakaghondama wuso ghao pahi kulutupi. Ndiwa wala wandu wakawalongela, “Kwa kyani mnguhakula avile angulama kuwahovili?” <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Kabaha ng'ogha, kahinduka kala. Mkumbuki vila awalongelili paawelili kula Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />“Lasima Mwana wa Mundu ahumiswe kuyeghwa mumawoko gha wandu wavile na sambi, wamuvambi mulipingika na lichuwa lya itatu ahinduki.”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Hinu pala wala wadala wakumbukili milando ghaki ailongelili Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Wakahuya ukaya kuhuma kumamambi, wakawapegha wala wandumindumi ikumi na mmonga na wandu ghangi milando gha mighalu ghala hyogha. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Wala wadala walongile milando hila kwa wandumindumi ni Maria Magidalena na Yoana na Malia nyongo wa Yakobu, pamonga na wadala ghangi wakonganilili pamonga. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Wandumindumi wa Yesu wayatolili ghala milando handa vindu vya kupughanyika, hinu wakasindwa kukwinila. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ila Petelo akahuma, akayenda mbilo mbaka kumamambi. Na paaghondama kulola mghati, akalola nguu mbulete wamtindilisilili Yesu wekayaki. Akahuya ukaya kunu akilikangasa kwa ghala yahumilili.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja wa kuyenda Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maliku 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lichuwa lilalila, wandu waivili paghati gha wavulwa wa Yesu wawelili mumnjila wakiyenda kimbwani kimonga lihina lyaki Emau, kiwelili kutali handa kilomita ikumi na imonga kuhuma Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Wawelili wakilongela ghala hyogha yahumilili. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Pawawelili wakilongelana, Yesu mweni akahumila kuulongolo, akatyanga pamonga na weni. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Wamlolili kwa mihu, ila wammanyili ng'ogha . <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu akawakonya, “Mngulonga kyani ikiva mngutyanga mnjila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Na weni wagholokili nuu, kuwuso kulolesa luhungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Mmonga wa weni lihina lyaki Kileopa, akayanga, “Ghuli, wenga ni mundu mhenja wekahela ku Yelusalemu unguwoneka umanya ng'ogha yahumilili machuwa hagha.”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Na mweni akawayanga, “Mighalu liki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Weni wakamyanga, “Mighalu imkolili Yesu wa Nazaleti.” Mweni awelili Mlota wa Sapanga mweni uweso wa kughola na kuvula kuulongolo gha Sapanga na kuulongolo gha wandu wogha. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Watambika wakulu na wakulu wa twenga wamyeghili atoswe kuhova, wamvambili mumapingika. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ila twenga tuwachilili yiwa mweni ndiwa atewakombola Izilaeli. Hinaa lelo lihika lichuwa lya itatu kuhuma mighalu hila kugholeka. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kangi, wadala ghangi wa baha watulilimulili pawayenda malawila pee kumamambi, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />na kulola ng'ogha higha wa Yesu. Wakahuya na kulonga yiwa wahumililwi na Watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga na wakawalongela yiwa Yesu avile angulama. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Wamonga gha twenga wayendili kumamambi wakalola ghala wayalongili wala wadala, ila mweni wamlola ng'ogha.<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Hinu Yesu akawalongela, “Mwenga muwasihisihi wa nagha, na mvile na utopehu wa mioyu kwa nagha kuyikwinila mighalu hyogha yalongilwi na walota wa Sapanga! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ghuli, impala ng'ogha Kilisito kuhakilwa kwa njila hazi, ili ayingile kuukulu ghaki?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Akawalongela lipalalipala mighalu hyogha impalili kumuhumila mweni ku Mayandiko gha Musa apeghilwi na Sapanga na walota wa Sapanga yayandikilwi kwa kumlongela mweni.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Pawakihikila pabehi kila kimbwani wawelili wangukiyendela, Yesu akaghola handa anguyendelela na mwanja. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ila weni wakamluwa wakilonga, “Ulikali pamonga na twenga, kwaikiva lijuwa linguhonga, na uhiku unguhika.” Hinu, akayingila kukimbwani, akatama pamonga na weni. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Paatama kulyegha mulyo pamonga na weni, akatola libumunda, akauhighili Sapanga na akaumetula na kuwapegha. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Bwitu mihu ghao ghakaghalambuliwa, hinu wakammanya yiwa mweni ni Yesu ila mweni akahuka paghati mwaweni. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Hinu, wakalongelana, “Ghuli, mioyu gha twenga ijakamulilwi ng'ogha lipindi awelili akitulongela lipalalipala Mayandiko Mambulete nesu kula mnjila?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Wakahuka lisaa lilalila, na kuhuya Yelusalemu, wakawalola wala wandumindumi ikumi na mmonga na wala ghangi wawelili pamonga na weni walikungulili. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Wakawalongela wavulwa waivili,“Kwa chakaka Bambu kahinduka, kamuhumila Simoni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Hinu, wala wavulwa waivili wakawalongela yala yawahumilili mnjila, na vila wammanyili pawameghili libumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguwahumila wayitikila ghaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Pawawelili wakiwalongela ghala, Yesu mweni akagholoka paghati gha weni, akawalongela, “Kuponga ilikali na mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Wakalikangasa na kukolwa na holu na wakiliwachila walola mpumulo. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ila mweni akawalongela, “Kwa kyani mngunyengemala? Ghuli mvile na holu kumioyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mlole mawoko na maghulu gha nenga, yiwa ni mundu. Mniyavisi mlole, kwaikiva mpumulo livile ng'ogha na higha na mihupa handa mnilola.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Kuulongolo paayomola kulonga ghala, akawalangiha mawoko na maghulu ghaki. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Wawelili na luheku nesu kunu wakilikangasa hata kusindwa kukwinila yiwa iwesekana ng'ogha, kwa vila walikangasana, akawakonya, “Mvile na mulyo wowose baha?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Wakampegha kipandi kya homba wa kunyanywa. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Akakitola, akalyegha, wogha wakimlola.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Hinu akawalongela, “Hali ndiwa lihengu niwalongelili panivile pamonga na mwenga, yiwa iwelili lasima kuhumila hyogha yayandikilwi kwaikiva gha nenga kulilaghilo lya Bambu ampeghili Musa na kuhitabu vya walota wa Sapanga na kuhitabu kya Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Hinu akawagubutulila luhala gha weni ili wawesi kumanya mayandiko. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Akawalongela, “Ndiwa iyandikiliwi, yiwa Kilisito atehakilwa na lichuwa lya itatu atehinduka kuhuma kukihu, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />na yiwa ni lasima, kwa lihina lyaki, milima hyogha kutumbula na Yelusalemu, yatangasiwi yiwa wandu wangupalwa kuleka mahakata na kumhyukila Sapanga ili kulekeselwa sambi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Mngupalwa kuwalongela wandu ghangi kila kiloleka kumihu gha mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na nenga nitemyegha kunani kwa mwenga Mpumulo wa Sapanga yula Tati alaghilili atewapegha, ila mlindili haku kumbwani mbaka mpati ghala makakala yahuma kunani.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyenda kundumba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliku 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Matendu 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Hinu akawalongosa wavulwa ghaki kuyenda panji gha mbwani Betania, akayinula mawoko ghaki kunani, akawahighila. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Paawelili akiwahighila, akawaleka, akatolwa kuyenda kundumba. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Weni wakatova manung'una na kumyupa, hinu wakahuya Yelusalemu wakiva na luheku likulunga. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Wakalikala lipindi lyogha Mulighuta lya Sapanga na kumuhighili Sapanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>